"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/d196e09ee475c805af43bc6ebf62a77de11ea0ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T01:02:10Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-06T17:22:40Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"ci: switch claude code review to manual trigger (workflow_dispatch)\n\nReplace the pull_request trigger (opened/reopened) with workflow_dispatch\nso the review workflow only runs when explicitly requested from the\nActions tab. The PR number is now provided as a required input parameter\ninstead of being read from the pull_request event context.\n\nThis avoids unnecessary CI spend on every PR open/reopen and gives us\ncontrol over when reviews are invoked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbefc48aa25416d2f9632ac27f8fec0129dfa623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/dbefc48aa25416d2f9632ac27f8fec0129dfa623"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/d196e09ee475c805af43bc6ebf62a77de11ea0ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht