.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/aaa183a76aaf38be1c094631e22c51a436b8d9e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T21:43:17Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T21:43:52Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: address PR review findings — security, tests, relay error handling\n\n1. Fix e2e: move chrome.tabs.query from page.evaluate to sw.evaluate\n   (chrome.tabs is extension-only, not available in page context)\n2. Fix e2e: navigate to localhost instead of example.com (content script\n   only injects on allowed hosts)\n3. Fix inject hook: use curl --data-urlencode for pwd with spaces\n4. Add sender.tab validation to file-techdebt handler (security gap)\n5. Add MV3 service worker termination comment for relayPollTimer\n6. Broadcast claude-code-relay-error instead of consumed on fetch failure\n7. Replace hardcoded macOS paths with MRPLUG_TEST_LOCAL_PATH env var\n8. Add \"e2e\" script to package.json\n9. Add afterAll cleanup in relay.test.ts describe blocks\n   Add cleanup in e2e relay contract tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed8a2da64b124af68ebc70c7c14a47e1a677b9a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/ed8a2da64b124af68ebc70c7c14a47e1a677b9a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/aaa183a76aaf38b