:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(modal): add .catch() to handleSubmit call sites to prevent unhandled rejections\n\nCarbon bundle dump was caused by handleSubmit() being called from handleKeyDown\n(Enter key) and onRequestSubmit (Carbon Modal prop) without .catch(). Chrome dumps\nthe entire minified content script bundle as error context for unhandled rejections.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ceb1713c8b1fb1ab7c37686671f94bf0365b3871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/ceb1713c8b1fb1ab7c37686671f94bf0365b3871"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/56f5e9f277a932eca5f6bbc0e7e1cb2316856fff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/56f5e9f277a932eca5f6bbc0e7e1cb2316856fff","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKDU2ZjVlOWYyNzdhOTMyZWNhNWY2YmJjMGU3ZTFjYjIzMTY4NTZmZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd","sha":"461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd"}],"sha":"56f5e9f277a932eca5f6bbc0e7e1cb2316856fff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/56f5e9f277a932eca5f6bbc0e7e1cb2316856fff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T02:25:47Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(modal+build): catch async action handler rejection; remove redundant Rollup inputs\n\nFeedbackModal: handleActionClick is an async function called from a\nReact onClick. React doesn''t await async handlers, so any rejection\nbecomes an unhandled promise rejection — Chrome dumps the entire\nminified content script bundle as the error context (same pattern\nas the earlier mousedown fix). Added .catch() to silence the dump\nand surface a clean error in console instead.\n\nvite.config.ts: removed explicit rollupOptions.input entries for popup\nand options. CRXJS discovers these entry points from manifest.json\nautomatically; the duplicate Rollup entries caused output filenames\nto diverge between builds (options.html vs src/options/index.html),\nwhich is what triggered the ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND on the options page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aac7d1074d05525b70f508658760dfb370059da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/aac7d1074d05525b70f508658760dfb370059da9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKDQ2MWJhYzJjMzZiNjc2ZGFhMjQzYzNjNzRmYWExYWNhNmFkOTI5YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc","sha":"7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc"}],"sha":"461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/461bac2c36b676daa243c3c74faa1aca6ad929bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T02:17:56Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(background): programmatic content script injection for pre-loaded tabs\n\nWhen Cmd+Shift+F fires on a tab that was open before the extension\nloaded, browser.tabs.sendMessage throws \"Receiving end does not exist\"\n— the content script was never injected. This is why frame.jim.software\ndidn''t activate while localhost:4000 (constantly refreshed during dev)\ndid.\n\nFix: catch the sendMessage error and inject programmatically using\nchrome.runtime.getManifest() to read the current hashed filenames,\nthen retry toggle after a 350ms init pause.\n\nSecurity: isAllowedHost() gate runs before any injection. Programmatic\ninjection is only performed on localhost, 127.0.0.1, and *.jim.software.\nThe command itself is user-initiated (keyboard shortcut) — no external\ntrigger path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88528f6be80c34699f32741cdaeff90397323efb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/88528f6be80c34699f32741cdaeff90397323efb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKDdjZDgzOTc5NmJkMjY3ZmMyMzlmZmM3MmIzNGM2ZjI0MzBkNWJkZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a","sha":"29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a"}],"sha":"7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/7cd839796bd267fc239ffc72b34c6f2430d5bdfc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T02:12:13Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(modal): show resolved repo in Claude Code success message and pending banner\n\nBackground send-to-claude-code now returns resolvedRepo and\nresolvedRemoteName in the response. FeedbackModal uses them:\n\n- Success message: \"Context queued for cv-builder — will inject into\n  your next Claude Code prompt.\" (was generic)\n- Pending banner: \"⬆ Context queued · cv-builder — will inject...\"\n- Clearing the banner also clears claudeCodeRepo state\n\nLabel priority: resolvedRemoteName (short, \"cv-builder\") >\nresolvedRepo basename (\"cv-builder\") > full repo slug.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f620ce3cdf177bbd1da708a3863dd1e9a258e213","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/f620ce3cdf177bbd1da708a3863dd1e9a258e213"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKDI5Zjk5YjNhMDQ0Y2U3ZjllMzgwODhiMzZkODVmMDdhMmQ3ZmNmOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7","sha":"dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7"}],"sha":"29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/29f99b3a044ce7f9e38088b36d85f07a2d7fcf9a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T02:10:40Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(relay): enrich payload with resolved project mapping for Claude context\n\nThe hook was reading elementContext.localPath which doesn''t exist —\nlocalPath lives in ProjectMapping, not ElementContext. Result: Claude\nreceived no repo or local path and searched the wrong repo.\n\nBackground send-to-claude-code handler now calls resolveProjectMapping\n(same logic used for GitHub issue routing) and adds three fields to the\nrelay payload before POSTing:\n  resolvedRepo       — e.g. \"ojfbot/cv-builder\"\n  resolvedLocalPath  — e.g. \"/Users/yuri/ojfbot/cv-builder\"\n  resolvedRemoteName — e.g. \"cv-builder\" (from data-mf-remote, if present)\n\nHook updated to read these top-level fields and include them in the\ninjected context block as:\n  Repo: ojfbot/cv-builder\n  MF remote: cv-builder\n  Local path: /Users/yuri/ojfbot/cv-builder\n\nNote: resolvedRemoteName will be empty until shell PR #19 is merged\n(data-mf-remote attribute on AppFrame). resolvedRepo still resolves\ncorrectly via tier 2 (page URL) in the interim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fd57e410759892ba089621c14cf83bffb0e8405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/7fd57e410759892ba089621c14cf83bffb0e8405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKGRjODA5MWQ2MTdiOTg1ZThiNGFjNDI4MTljZmUyNzBlYmMxNWQwYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b","sha":"7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b"}],"sha":"dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/dc8091d617b985e8b4ac42819cfe270ebc15d0a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T02:04:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(routing): swap tier order in resolveProjectMapping — page URL before remoteEntry origins\n\nShell chrome bug: when inspecting an AppSwitcher or HomeScreen element on\nlocalhost:4000, the shell has cv-builder, blogengine, and tripplanner\nremoteEntry scripts loaded. The old tier 2 (remoteEntry origins) matched\ncv-builder first, routing a shell inspection to ojfbot/cv-builder.\n\nNew order:\n  1. data-mf-remote attribute (precise — element is inside this remote)\n  2. Page URL hostname (reliable — localhost:4000 → ojfbot/shell)\n  3. remoteEntry origins (last resort — for non-shell MF hosts without\n     data-mf-remote in scope)\n  4. config.githubRepo global fallback\n\nThis makes shell-chrome inspections always route to ojfbot/shell on\nlocalhost:4000 or frame.jim.software, regardless of which remotes are\nloaded in the page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"593b64c3b25d9d57176d60b70d08775cd0cfbd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/593b64c3b25d9d57176d60b70d08775cd0cfbd81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKDdlNWEwZTE2MjAzNjI3MTQ2ZjhiYTFmM2QyOWVjM2UyNmQxYjg4NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/c21c9868d5c2ab6719aad3ec2b6ddf83ee17929d","sha":"c21c9868d5c2ab6719aad3ec2b6ddf83ee17929d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/c21c9868d5c2ab6719aad3ec2b6ddf83ee17929d"}],"sha":"7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/7e5a0e16203627146f8ba1f3d29ec3e26d1b884b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/c21c9868d5c2ab6719aad3ec2b6ddf83ee17929d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T01:59:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(relay): add explicit confirmation UX for Claude Code context injection\n\nAddresses draft-blocker: \"a silent CI trigger from a browser extension is\nan unacceptable default\" (daily-logger review 2026-03-08).\n\nConfirmation model:\n- The badge click in FeedbackModal IS the explicit user opt-in\n- After successful POST to relay, a persistent blue banner appears:\n  \"⬆ Context queued — will inject into your next Claude Code prompt [Clear]\"\n- [Clear] button calls DELETE /clear on the relay, discarding the payload\n  before Claude Code''s UserPromptSubmit hook consumes it\n- Payload is single-use: consumed (and deleted) on the first Claude Code prompt\n\nChanges:\n- mrplug-mcp-server: add DELETE /clear endpoint\n- background: add clear-claude-code-context message handler\n- FeedbackModal: claudeCodePending state + banner + handleClearClaudeCode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"969d9f3dd0d3bc1faf89be54790acf3f9662b6a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/969d9f3dd0d3bc1faf89be54790acf3f9662b6a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/c21c9868d5c2ab6719aad3ec2b6ddf83ee17929d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type"