and decision records\n\nmrplug-mcp-server/: Express relay on port 27182\n- POST /submit — receives inspection payload from extension\n- GET /consume — Claude Code UserPromptSubmit hook calls this; returns\n  payload as structured context prefix injected into the prompt\n- GET /status — health check\n\nhooks/mrplug-inject.sh registered in ~/.claude/settings.json so every\nClaude Code prompt is automatically enriched with MrPlug context when\nan element has been submitted.\n\ndecisions/ and .agents/ contain ADRs and agent config (tooling-only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d92e46851726e7deb0e9ca5e11168cc1b5ca277a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/d92e46851726e7deb0e9ca5e11168cc1b5ca277a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/f515699bb6de945d28b95e2f0272c134e76bc999","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/f515699bb6de945d28b95e2f0272c134e76bc999","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKGY1MTU2OTliYjZkZTk0NWQyOGI5NWUyZjAyNzJjMTM0ZTc2YmM5OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/258621c3b30e00c2869514d6a478ccfccf612267","sha":"258621c3b30e00c2869514d6a478ccfccf612267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/258621c3b30e00c2869514d6a478ccfccf612267"}],"sha":"f515699bb6de945d28b95e2f0272c134e76bc999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/f515699bb6de945d28b95e2f0272c134e76bc999"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/258621c3b30e00c2869514d6a478ccfccf612267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T00:30:41Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:30:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(content): use mousedown for element selection to support buttons\n\nButtons are not selectable when selection is driven by the click event\nbecause Chrome suppresses click after mousedown.preventDefault() on a\nbutton.  Moved element selection to the mousedown capture listener —\nmatching how browser DevTools work.\n\nThe click listener is kept but only for suppression (prevents the\nbutton''s own onClick from firing after we have selected it).\n\nAlso adds .catch() on the async handleClick call to convert unhandled\npromise rejections into a readable console.error instead of Chrome\ndumping the entire minified bundle as the error context.\n\nKNOWN ISSUE: button selection still requires extension reload to take\neffect — not yet confirmed working end-to-end.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b9db51bed4b049c0d7cc75b7c755113275454dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/6b9db51bed4b049c0d7cc75b7c755113275454dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/258621c3b30e00c2869514d6a478ccfccf612267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/258621c3b30e00c2869514d6a478ccfccf612267","node_id":"C_