49cc548b4ebb2952fc8870b2880e28464f7676/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-09T22:39:40Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-10T02:16:25Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: address critical issues from Claude Code Review\n\n## Critical Fixes\n\n1. **Remove unused import** (Bug #7)\n   - Remove AnthropicAgent import and type reference from content/index.tsx\n   - AIAgent handles both providers, no separate class needed\n\n2. **Add security documentation** (Security #1)\n   - Create comprehensive SECURITY.md\n   - Document env.json risks and proper production architecture\n   - Warn about API key bundling (dev-only)\n   - Document prompt injection risks\n   - Add mitigation strategies and best practices\n\n3. **Improve error handling** (Critical #3)\n   - Surface AI errors to users with actionable messages\n   - Distinguish between API key, network, and rate limit errors\n   - Add suggested actions for configuration issues\n   - Replace generic console errors with user-friendly feedback\n\n4. **Fix TypeScript errors**\n   - Add null check for response before accessing properties\n   - Ensure type safety throughout error handling flow\n\n## Follow-up Issues Created\n\n- #15: Implement prompt injection sanitization (High Priority)\n- #16: Refactor to provider pattern architecture (Medium Priority)\n- #17: Improve API key detection and validation (Medium Priority)\n\n## What''s Next\n\nThese follow-up issues address:\n- Structured input sanitization for security\n- Better code organization and extensibility\n- Robust API key validation with clear error messages\n\nRelated to PR #14 and Claude Code Review feedback\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2d9d4be1bda0a7573846eba15fece8e38c4d133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/f2d9d4be1bda0a7573846eba15fece8e38c4d133"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/8549cc548b4ebb2952fc8870b2880e28464f7676","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/8549cc548b4ebb2952fc8870b2880e28464f7676","node_id":"C_kwDOQkfx6toAKDg1NDljYzU0OGI0ZWJiMjk1MmZjODg3MGIyODgwZTI4NDY0Zjc2NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/MrPlug/commit/fc3a9bb04f7ea910402ca22bd338a0461ed12c99","sha":"fc3a9bb04f7ea910402ca22bd338a0461ed12c99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/fc3a9bb04f7ea910402ca22bd338a0461ed12c99"}],"sha":"8549cc548b4ebb2952fc8870b2880e28464f7676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/8549cc548b4ebb2952fc8870b2880e28464f7676"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/fc3a9bb04f7ea910402ca22bd338a0461ed12c99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-09T22:18:39Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-10T02:16:25Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: implement Anthropic API integration and fix AI agent initialization\n\nThis commit adds full support for Anthropic Claude API alongside OpenAI,\nwith proper configuration management and UI improvements.\n\n## Core Changes\n\n### API Integration\n- Add @langchain/anthropic package for Claude Sonnet 4 support\n- Update AIAgent class to auto-detect API key type (OpenAI vs Anthropic)\n- Add separate anthropicApiKey field in ExtensionConfig\n- Fix LangChain prompt template syntax (escape curly braces)\n\n### Configuration Management\n- Create env.json system for secure local API key storage\n- Add scripts/inject-env.js to generate src/lib/env.ts before build\n- Update .gitignore to exclude env.json and src/lib/env.ts\n- Add startup auto-configuration in background worker\n- Background worker now configures extension on every startup if no API key found\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fix content script initialization to use correct API key field\n- Add config reload fallback when AI agent not initialized\n- Fix prompt template parsing error (\"Single ''}'' in template\")\n- Update background worker to set anthropicApiKey instead of openaiApiKey\n\n### UI Improvements\n- Make suggested action badges clickable with hover effects\n- Add handleActionClick for github-issue, claude-code, and manual actions\n- Add comprehensive logging throughout initialization flow\n- Update QUICKSTART.md with verification steps\n\n### Developer Experience\n- Add DEBUG.md with step-by-step troubleshooting guide\n- Add test-page.html for testing element selection\n- Enhanced console logging for config loading and agent initialization\n\n## Testing\n- Extension successfully initializes with Anthropic API key\n- AI responses work correctly with Claude Sonnet 4\n- Settings page displays API key (starred out)\n- Action badges are clickable and show appropriate alerts\n\nCloses #8 (partial - establishes foundation for code splitting)\nRelated to #6 (Claude Code Review feedback)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6364d23e28dc3f9188a88504148ecd56fd04bf92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/6364d23e28dc3f9188a88504148ecd56fd04bf92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/commits/fc3a9bb04f7ea910402ca22bd338a0461ed12c99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOC