ps://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/commits/4fa5da7f096f01081a5f564811e0710090b1d62c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-08T03:30:19Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-08T04:34:29Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: configure automated Claude Code Review for PRs\n\nThis commit sets up automated Claude AI code reviews for all pull requests,\nproviding thorough architectural and code quality analysis.\n\nChanges:\n- Add GitHub Actions workflow for automated Claude reviews\n  - Uses Claude Sonnet 4 (claude-sonnet-4-20250514)\n  - Triggers on PR open, update, and reopen events\n  - Enhanced error handling and API error detection\n  - Helpful failure messages with troubleshooting steps\n\n- Comprehensive review focus areas:\n  - Architecture & Design patterns\n  - Code Quality & TypeScript usage\n  - Security vulnerabilities & CSP compliance\n  - Performance & bundle size optimization\n  - Testing coverage & quality\n  - Browser Extension best practices (Manifest V3)\n  - Dependency analysis\n\n- Add detailed setup documentation (.github/CLAUDE_REVIEW_SETUP.md)\n  - Step-by-step API key configuration\n  - Workflow permissions and triggers\n  - Customization options\n  - Cost management tips\n  - Troubleshooting guide\n\nSetup Required:\n- Add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to repository secrets\n- See .github/CLAUDE_REVIEW_SETUP.md for complete setup instructions\n\nThe workflow will automatically review PR #6 once the API key is configured.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3baf8f8f8bba85d1055b4706263e7a516d262717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/MrPlug/git/trees/3baf8f