i.github.com/users/akhilshastri/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/mf-containers/commits/29c092313bda36914310cf3d8b19d197579cd57f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-07T05:17:20Z","email":"shastri.akhil@gmail.com","name":"Akhil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-07T05:17:20Z","email":"shastri.akhil@gmail.com","name":"Akhil"},"message":"feat: implement cross-bundler module federation with lifecycle methods\n\n- Add lifecycle methods (Mount/unMount) to webpack entry module with default and named exports\n- Create mfWebpackService singleton to demonstrate shared state across federation\n- Update libs structure to export both default object and named exports for compatibility\n- Configure Vite proxy to forward /ioi/** requests to webpack dev server\n- Update remote module URL to use proxied path (/ioi/remoteEntry.js)\n- Add debugging console logs for troubleshooting module federation\n- Update App component to call lifecycle methods on mount/unmount\n- Fix Button component imports to use libs structure with fallback handling\n\nThis enables Vite (host) to consume Webpack (remote) modules with proper lifecycle management and cross-bundler compatibility.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd69bf8187584ad0e907f682405448c763b1cd2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/mf-containers/git/trees/bd69bf8187584ad0e907f682405448c763b1cd2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/mf-containers/git/commits/29c092313bda36914310cf3d8b19d197579cd57f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8503650?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/events{/privacy}","followers_ur