.github.com/users/akhilshastri/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/mf-containers/commits/95c32127da12253ad25ef33a298ba55e69b0f9bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-07T04:57:47Z","email":"shastri.akhil@gmail.com","name":"Akhil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-07T04:57:47Z","email":"shastri.akhil@gmail.com","name":"Akhil"},"message":"Initial commit: Module Federation setup with Webpack and Vite\n\n- Created pnpm workspace with two apps\n- mf-webpack: React app with Webpack 5 Module Federation exposing Button component\n- mf-vite: Vite app consuming the federated Button component\n- Configured shared dependencies (React, ReactDOM) as singletons\n- Set up proper CORS headers and federation configuration\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1711b76a21e077259b92e48ee3e613f362df5094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/mf-containers/git/trees/1711b76a21e077259b92e48ee3e613f362df5094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/mf-containers/git/commits/95c32127da12253ad25ef33a298ba55e69b0f9bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8503650?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilshastri/following{/other_user}","g