orial no Qdrant com 768d embeddings\n\n- Analise Documental: enriquecimento com precedentes do Qdrant\n\n- Redacao Peticoes: fundamentacao com jurisprudencias do Qdrant\n\n- Estrategia Processual: analise baseada em precedentes similares\n\nSistema de populacao automatica:\n\n- TemaExtractor: extrai tema juridico com Gemini\n\n- DataJud API: busca precedentes CNJ\n\n- Gemini Embeddings: text-embedding-004 (768d)\n\n- Qdrant Cloud: armazenamento vetorial\n\n- Redis Cache: indice reverso para busca rapida","tree":{"sha":"d703ba4b22778a4603c1da03e9464ec4dd7c934e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thiagobodevanadv-alt/assistente-jur-dico-principal/git/trees/d703ba4b22778a4603c1da03e9464ec4dd7c934e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thiagobodevanadv-alt/assistente-jur-dico-principal/git/commits/4e119283ffa51b02e24d0064216213a413d527a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248499898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thiagobodevanadv-alt","id":248499898,"login":"thiagobodevanadv-alt","node_id":"U_kgDODs_Oug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodevanadv-alt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagobodev