ing the \"browser mode\"\ntests.\nReconfigure normal (server-side, non browser rendered) tests to work in\ntandem with the new broser mode run.\nAdd a special vitest operation to unify the 2 test outputs and check the\ncoverage accross the entire repo space (server AND client tests)!\nAdd special browser specific `test/setup-browser.jsx` to include CSS\nclasses so that components render correctly 💅\n\n* test: first basic component test in browser mode\n\n* test: link & button component tests\n\n* test: notifications, plus basic interactivity\n\n* test: noddy render tests for simple components\n\n* test: various table rendering & interactivity\n\n* test: nody rendering tests for app page skeletons\n\n* chore: add CSpell exceptions\n\n* test: noddy route test\n\n* fix: remove duplicate header, and test\n\n* refactor: better group class names for line length\n\n* refactor: better class name defs, and tests\n\n* refactor: organise imports, fix broken test\n\n* test: add simple dot reporter for test progress\n\n* test: exceptions and coverage refinements\n\n* chore: various minor edits, mostly stylistic\n\n* ci: attempt to run tests & catch coverage gaps\n\n* test: Sonarcloud recommendations\n\n* Initial check-in\n\n* - Minor updates\n\n* test: enable vitest browser mode (#8)\n\n* test: add lint:fix script\n\n* ci: update github actions versions, add sonarqube\n\n* test: install deps, add test scripts & configs\nAdd the separate vitest config necessary for running the \"browser mode\"\ntests.\nReconfigure normal (server-side, non browser rendered) tests to work in\ntandem with the new broser mode run.\nAdd a special vitest operation to unify the 2 test outputs and check the\ncoverage accross the entire repo space (server AND client tests)!\nAdd special browser specific `test/setup-browser.jsx` to include CSS\nclasses so that components render correctly 💅\n\n* test: first basic component test in browser mode\n\n* test: link & button component tests\n\n* test: notifications, plus basic interactivity\n\n* test: noddy render tests for simple components\n\n* test: various table rendering & interactivity\n\n* test: nody rendering tests for app page skeletons\n\n* chore: add CSpell exceptions\n\n* test: noddy route test\n\n* fix: remove duplicate header, and test\n\n* refactor: better group class names for line length\n\n* refactor: better class name defs, and tests\n\n* refactor: organise imports, fix broken test\n\n* test: add simple dot reporter for test progress\n\n* test: exceptions and coverage refinements\n\n* chore: various minor edits, mostly stylistic\n\n* ci: attempt to run tests & catch coverage gaps\n\n* test: Sonarcloud recommendations\n\n* test: name page tests appropriately\n# Conflicts:\n#\tapp/authenticate/page.test.jsx\n#\tapp/business-messages/page.test.jsx\n#\tapp/county-parish-holdings/page.test.jsx\n#\tapp/land-details/page.test.jsx\n#\tapp/linked-businesses/page.test.jsx\n#\tapp/linked-contacts/page.test.jsx\n\n* Moved simple post-deployment tests into ViTest\n\n* Fixed merge issue:\n\n* minor lint fix\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Robin Knipe <robin.knipe@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1cf6b4613c3be3c225eba8a2e93fc06dd2b0fbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEFRA/fcp-cv-frontend/git/trees/d1cf6b4613c3be3c225eba8a2e93fc06dd2b0fbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEFRA/fcp-cv-frontend/git/commits/85869b0cdb3b3199481aabf6846f6a028cf637eb","verification":{"payload":"tree d1cf6b4613c3be3c225eba8a2e93fc06dd2b0fbd\nparent ff2975d8019521dbc1d1bc464f5148542da16c26\nauthor Gordon Marsh <gordon.marsh@defra.gov.uk> 1772113799 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772113799 +0000\n\nMove simple post-deployment BDD/Playwright tests into Vitest (#23)\n\n* test: add lint:fix script\n\n* ci: update github actions versions, add sonarqube\n\n* test: install deps, add test scripts & configs\n\nAdd the separate vitest config necessary for running the \"browser mode\"\ntests.\nReconfigure normal (server-side, non browse