both Year-by-Year sheets (NPV line, Savings bar)\n- Full CFO Analysis with all sections in both languages:\n  * Key KPIs for Management\n  * Sensitivity Analysis (Tornado Chart)\n  * Sensitivity Matrix (NPV vs Grid Price vs Yield)\n  * ESG Environmental Impact\n  * Break-Even Analysis\n  * Scenario Analysis\n  * Energy Price Inflation Sensitivity\n  * Decision Summary (CAPEX vs Status Quo)\n- Dynamic Excel formulas referencing between sheets\n- Company logo in headers\n- Professional formatting with color-coded cells\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe54d4038611752552c93443699d6f7f05c64d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/fe54d4038611752552c93443699d6f7f05c64d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/8adaf376ff696c86b586a30132eba6d70a0b483d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/8adaf376ff696c86b586a30132eba6d70a0b483d","node_id":"C_kwDOQlBB2NoAKDhhZGFmMzc2ZmY2OTZjODZiNTg2YTMwMTMyZWJhNmQ3MGEwYjQ4M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/8126e5540ffd97764efab6cdad2624257a7754d4","sha":"8126e5540ffd97764efab6cdad2624257a7754d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/8126e5540ffd97764efab6cdad2624257a7754d4"}],"sha":"8adaf376ff696c86b586a30132eba6d70a0b483d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/8adaf376ff696c86b586a30132eba6d70a0b483d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/8126e5540ffd97764efab6cdad2624257a7754d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T20:18:46Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T20:18:46Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"feat(site-assessment): Full 4-step wizard UX for standalone PV site assessment\n\nComplete redesign of Site Assessment module as standalone portal:\n\nStep 1 - Location:\n- Interactive map with street/satellite views\n- Location search via Nominatim (OpenStreetMap)\n- Click-to-select coordinates\n- Reverse geocoding for address display\n\nStep 2 - Area Drawing:\n- Polygon and rectangle drawing tools\n- Real-time area calculation (geodesic)\n- Perimeter and vertices display\n- Layer toggle (street/satellite)\n\nStep 3 - Configuration:\n- 4 installation types: flat roof, pitched roof, ground, carport\n- Configurable tilt, azimuth, GCR parameters\n- Module specifications (power, dimensions)\n- PVGIS API integration for optimal angles\n\nStep 4 - Results:\n- Calculated kWp capacity and yearly MWh production\n- Specific yield from PVGIS\n- Quick financial estimation (CAPEX, savings, payback)\n- Export to project, copy results, PDF export\n\nUX Features:\n- Progress bar with step indicators\n- Toast notifications\n- Help modal\n- Responsive design\n- Modern dark theme\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88e42e1247bc25244c3d5667f15e1a2483d17b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/88e42e1247bc25244c3d5667f15e1a2483d17b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/8126e5540ffd97764efab6cdad2624257a7754d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/recei