78e3b9fc077a05aba6ce5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T20:10:28Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T20:10:28Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"feat(site-assessment): Map-based PV capacity calculator with PVGIS integration\n\nNew micro-frontend module for B2B site assessment:\n- Interactive map (Leaflet + OpenStreetMap) with polygon drawing\n- Area calculation from polygon coordinates (geodesic)\n- PVGIS API integration for optimal tilt and irradiation data\n- 4 installation types: flat roof, pitched roof, ground, carport\n- Automatic capacity calculation (m² to kWp)\n- Yearly production forecast from PVGIS\n- Export results to project or clipboard\n\nIncludes:\n- Docker container configuration (port 9017)\n- Nginx routing in shell (/modules/siteassessment/)\n- Navigation tab in main shell\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac760f24ba25d61fa35a5a20f553af3e9259da48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/ac760f24ba25d61fa35a5a20f553af3e9259da48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/37023c15d48d8d0660d78e3b9fc077a05aba6ce5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/37023c15d48d8d0660d78e3b9fc077a05aba6ce5","node_id":"C_kwDOQlBB2NoAKDM3MDIzYzE1ZDQ4ZDhkMDY2MGQ3OGUzYjlmYzA3N2EwNWFiYTZjZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/989072e4d25e6135aa786f48f573ee28a8272d60","sha":"989072e4d25e6135aa786f48f573ee28a8272d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/989072e4d25e6135aa786f48f573ee28a8272d60"}],"sha":"37023c15d48d8d0660d78e3b9fc077a05aba6ce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/37023c15d48d8d0660d78e3b9fc077a05aba6ce5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/989072e4d25e6135aa786f48f573ee28a8272d60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T19:53:19Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T19:53:19Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"feat(economics): Feature Pack 1 - BESS replacement, residual value, nominal/real rates\n\nP0-1: BESS & Inverter Replacement Scheduling\n- calculateBessReplacementSchedule() with percent_of_initial/per_kwh modes\n- calculateInverterReplacementSchedule() (optional, disabled by default)\n- calculateReinvestmentSchedule() combining both into year->cost lookup\n- Reinvestment costs integrated into cash flow, NPV, LCOE calculations\n- CFADS in bankability now includes bessReplacementCost\n\nP0-2: Residual Value Modes\n- calculateResidualValue() with zero/fmv/contractual modes\n- residualValueYearMode: end_of_analysis or end_of_contract (EaaS)\n- Residual value applied as positive cash flow in specified year\n\nP0-3: Nominal vs Real Rate Consistency\n- getEffectiveDiscountRate() with automatic real->nominal conversion\n- nominalToRealRate() and realToNominalRate() helper functions\n- Guardrails for NaN/missing inflation in real mode (fallback to nominal)\n- Consistent rate application across NPV, LCOE, sensitivity, EaaS\n\nTests: 57 Vitest tests (40 feature-pack-1 + 17 bankability)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c1fea9dea1db32c4ff61b45c73c830497920bec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/5c1fea9dea1db32c4ff61b45c73c830497920bec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/989072e4d25e6135aa786f48f573ee28a8272d60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers