"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/839fe1511f4201e2efa7f9df5dc537b122b3c3eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-10T10:40:15Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-10T10:40:15Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"Merge feat/excel-export-formulas-fix: Economics Snapshot V2 with data contract\n\nImplements investor-ready economics with strict data contract:\n- CAPEX_CLIENT: 0..30 years (31 records)\n- EAAS_CLIENT: 1..30 years (30 records)\n- EAAS_INVESTOR: 0..duration (duration+1 records)\n\nKey features:\n- Correct margin formula (profit/sellPrice)\n- Backend validation for year ranges and completeness\n- PostgreSQL ENUM for model_type\n- Year 0 CAPEX for investor models\n- SQL verification and pytest tests","tree":{"sha":"98a5f057b3719512b3f3d268e7e75c3eff686933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/98a5f057b3719512b3f3d268e7e75c3eff686933"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/839fe1511f4201e2efa7f9df5dc537b122b3c3eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"log