ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/7a21a51be2e9a54252c4060f87fbed0c13d12130/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T16:19:45Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T16:19:45Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"feat(drivers): add objectives/profiles/policy/variant_space models + validation (v4.5.0 PR1)\n\n## Changes\n- Extended OptimizationObjective enum with: IRR, LCOS, LCOE (alias), RESILIENCE, SELF_CONSUMPTION_RATE (alias)\n- Extended RecommendedReasonCode enum with: IRR_MAX, LCOS_MIN, RESILIENCE_MAX, NPV_NEAR_OPTIMAL_TIE_BREAK\n- Added OptimizationProfile enum (balanced, pv_self_consumption, arbitrage, resilience_backup, commercial_peak_shaving)\n- Added RecommendationPolicy model with near_optimal_tolerance_pct and tie_breakers validation\n- Added VariantSpace model for power x duration grid with max_variants validation\n- Added DriverRecommendation, DurationSweepPoint, MarginalMetrics models\n- Added objective aliases (lcoe -> lcos, self_consumption_rate -> self_consumption) in request_normalizer\n- Added 26 unit tests for model validation\n- Updated contract tests for new objectives\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d8f13f1c669b30d51a4688e83bb2fece60f8c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/5d8f13f1c669b30d51a4688e83bb2fece60f8c57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/7a21a51be2e9a54252c4060f87fbed0c13d12130","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","