:55:58Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T12:55:58Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"test(pack): add SCIM provisioning auth scenario pack (v4.4.0 PR11)\n\nAdd scim_provisioning_auth.yml pack with 89 regression scenarios:\n\nToken Management (8 scenarios):\n- Token create, revoke, expiry, validation\n\nSCIM Base Endpoints (4 scenarios):\n- ServiceProviderConfig, ResourceTypes, Schemas\n\nSCIM Users (16 scenarios):\n- CRUD operations, filter, pagination, activate/deactivate\n\nSCIM Groups (12 scenarios):\n- CRUD operations, membership management\n\nGroup Mappings (13 scenarios):\n- Create, update, delete, role management\n\nGroup Sync (11 scenarios):\n- Sync triggers, membership preservation, revocation\n\nDeprovision (7 scenarios):\n- Session/key revocation, membership handling\n\nTenant Isolation (5 scenarios):\n- Cross-tenant access prevention\n\nError Handling (5 scenarios):\n- Error format validation\n\nSecurity (4 scenarios):\n- Hash protection, audit logging\n\nIncludes 26 unit tests for pack structure and coverage.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"079006b7ee1922f3813aa921d0bb645612bcc760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/079006b7ee1922f3813aa921d0bb645612bcc760"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/0d08b26d2001a8f9da3d178763eb86725136c8f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsm