","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/66e430bf19d3b3b9c855e1beb869529ff69e471b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/efd67909c9809b9217eac96b0c5e69049fd1071f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:39:02Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:39:02Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"obs(scim): add SCIM observability metrics and alerts (v4.4.0 PR10)\n\nAdd comprehensive Prometheus metrics for SCIM provisioning:\n\nToken Metrics:\n- scim_token_requests_total - requests per token\n- scim_token_validation_total - validation results\n- scim_tokens_active - active token gauge\n\nUser Metrics:\n- scim_users_requests_total - Users endpoint requests\n- scim_users_provisioned/updated/deprovisioned_total - lifecycle events\n- scim_users_total/active - user gauges\n\nGroup Metrics:\n- scim_groups_requests_total - Groups endpoint requests\n- scim_groups_total - group gauge\n- scim_group_members_total - members per group\n\nSync Metrics:\n- scim_sync_requests_total - sync operations\n- scim_sync_members_added/removed_total - membership changes\n- scim_sync_errors_total - sync errors\n\nDeprovision Metrics:\n- scim_deprovision_requests_total - deprovision operations\n- scim_deprovision_sessions/api_keys/memberships_revoked_total\n\nAlert Rules (docs/observability/scim_alerts.yml):\n- Token expiry warnings\n- High error rate alerts\n- Sync failure detection\n- Capacity limit warnings\n- Orphaned mapping detection\n\nIncludes 15 unit tests for metrics recording functions.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e554400ca7c94ef1369cc77ed96851fc9f503975","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/e554400ca7c94ef1369cc77ed96851fc9f503975"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/efd67909c9809b9217eac96b0c5e69049fd1071f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"U