id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/5c483736160e0720c28182977dc1acda2b999318/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:34:21Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:34:21Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"feat(ui): add SCIM provisioning management panel (v4.4.0 PR9)\n\nAdd ProvisioningPanel React component for managing SCIM provisioning:\n\nTokens Tab:\n- List all SCIM tokens with status (active/revoked/expired)\n- Create new tokens with expiration\n- Revoke tokens with confirmation\n- Show token creation modal with copy-to-clipboard\n\nGroups Tab:\n- Display synced SCIM groups from IdP\n- Show member counts and external IDs\n- Read-only (groups managed by IdP)\n\nMappings Tab:\n- Create group → project mappings\n- Toggle mapping enabled/disabled state\n- Change mapping roles (viewer/editor/admin)\n- Delete mappings with confirmation\n\nFeatures:\n- Sync status display in header\n- Manual sync trigger button\n- Polish language UI\n- Responsive design\n- 19 unit tests\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e5ec2890375450269522d168f62914ef8636d28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/1e5ec2890375450269522d168f62914ef8636d28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analiz