er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/27609d2706888180774bb497845dfe2c16129e03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:25:52Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:25:52Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"feat(provisioning): add SCIM group project mapping API (v4.4.0 PR7)\n\nAdd admin endpoints for managing SCIM group → project mappings:\n- GET /api/provisioning/mappings - list mappings with filters\n- POST /api/provisioning/mappings - create mapping + trigger sync\n- GET /api/provisioning/mappings/<id> - get single mapping\n- PATCH /api/provisioning/mappings/<id> - update role/enabled\n- DELETE /api/provisioning/mappings/<id> - delete + revoke memberships\n- POST /api/provisioning/mappings/sync - trigger manual sync\n- GET /api/provisioning/mappings/status - get sync status\n\nKey features:\n- Tenant isolation for all operations\n- Automatic sync on mapping create/enable\n- Automatic revocation on mapping disable/delete\n- Role changes trigger revoke + resync\n- Group display name enrichment in responses\n\nIncludes 24 unit tests covering all endpoints and edge cases.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8200b6b1a97d8acd8fc4ef7c7f7e38007f15c80a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/8200b6b1a97d8acd8fc4ef7c7f7e38007f15c80a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/27609d2706888180774bb497845dfe2c16129e03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/27609d2706888180774bb497845dfe2c16129e03","node_id":"C_kwDOQlBB2NoAKDI3NjA5ZDI3MDY4ODgxODA3NzRiYjQ5Nzg0NWRmZTJjMTYxMjllMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/c3be326e13abf127606ced49b4db6a17119cdff6","sha":"c3be326e13abf127606ced49b4db6a17119cdff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/c3be326e13abf127606ced49b4db6a17119cdff6"}],"sha":"27609d2706888180774bb497845dfe2c16129e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/27609d2706888180774bb497845dfe2c16129e03"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/c3be326e13abf127606ced49b4db6a17119cdff6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:20:10Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T11:20:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(scim): add Group Sync Engine for SCIM→project memberships (v4.4.0 PR6) (#271)\n\nImplement sync engine that propagates SCIM group memberships to\nproject memberships while preserving manual assignments.\n\nFeatures:\n- sync_group: Sync single group to all mapped projects\n- sync_all_groups: Sync all groups for a tenant\n- sync_user: Sync all groups a user belongs to\n- revoke_scim_memberships: Remove SCIM memberships when mapping disabled\n- get_sync_status: Get counts of groups, mappings, memberships\n\nKey behaviors:\n- source=''scim'' memberships are managed by sync engine\n- source=''manual'' memberships are never modified by sync\n- Removing user from SCIM group removes project membership\n- Disabling mapping revokes all related memberships\n\nTests: 14 unit tests passing\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"382aea926750f508aff3a8f5b0fa3e3365e39070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/382aea926750f508aff3a8f5b0fa3e3365e39070"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/c3be326e13abf127606ced49b4db6a17119cdff6","verification":{"payload":"tree 382aea926750f508aff3a8f5b0fa3e3365e39070\nparent af535407c9c1ab4c2192baccb7791c3f8062bf55\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767439210 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767439210 +0100\n\nfeat(scim): add Group Sync Engine for SCIM→project memberships (v4.4.0 PR6) (#271)\n\nImplement sync engine that propagates SCIM group memberships to\nproject memberships while preserving manual assignments.\n\nFeatures:\n- sync_group: Sync single group to all mapped projects\n- sync_all_groups: Sync all groups for a tenant\n- sync_user: Sync all groups a user belongs to\n- revoke_scim_memberships: Remove SCIM memberships when mapping disabled\n- get_sync_status: Get counts of groups, mappings, memberships\n\nKey behaviors:\n- source=''scim'' memberships are managed by sync engine\n- source=''manual'' memberships are never modified by sync\n- Removing user from SCIM group removes project membership\n- Disabling mapping revokes all related memberships\n\nTests: 14 unit tests passing\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpWPtqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA06IQABZzztmcAlo9YMO3OtyUiXTZ\nTWt1bAQ9E4JbfAL95xndswU8o7SAcQo1ROurXaMubMcRfddXzmnmIiKyvwv+8k2R\noUwKl9+9TcmfpjUICvrIZHk8bsyvsNeSuz+0dY5CmGKDr5/KLVB5zGs7cTPG1ICO\nviPM5+Cq7oiNvB3MN+03R6Rz3f3WB6evTycrEtbGEbS+mlxXm15sznF3c7u4hnZB\nJBpeGpdMJt4GcgovEsslg99iT6ULJk+wt1hp