url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/c3be326e13abf127606ced49b4db6a17119cdff6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/af535407c9c1ab4c2192baccb7791c3f8062bf55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T09:47:11Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T09:47:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(scim): add SCIM Groups API with CRUD and membership management (v4.4.0 PR5) (#270)\n\nImplement RFC 7644 SCIM 2.0 Groups endpoint with full CRUD operations:\n- POST /Groups - Create group with optional initial members\n- GET /Groups - List groups with filter and pagination\n- GET /Groups/<id> - Get group with members\n- PATCH /Groups/<id> - Update group fields and members\n- PUT /Groups/<id> - Replace group entirely\n- DELETE /Groups/<id> - Delete group (cascades to memberships)\n\nFeatures:\n- Full SCIM Group schema: displayName, externalId, members\n- Filter support: displayName eq, externalId eq\n- Pagination: startIndex, count (max 100)\n- Member operations: add, remove, replace\n- Tenant isolation for all operations\n\nMember management operations:\n- add_group_member: Add user to group (idempotent)\n- remove_group_member: Remove user from group\n- set_group_members: Replace all members atomically\n- get_group_members: List all members with user details\n- get_user_groups: List all groups a user belongs to\n\nTests: 39 new unit tests (193 total SCIM tests passing)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39d19e49b8b68d60a8735a8f03417fa74ad4e6f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/39d19e49b8b68d60a8735a8f03417fa74ad4e6f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/af535407c9c1ab4c2192baccb7791c3f8062bf55","verification":{"payload":"tree 39d19e49b8b68d60a8735a8f03417fa74ad4e6f1\nparent 7827e556e76a3a529037bfdc92c9aba43b071c1f\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767433631 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767433631 +0100\n\nfeat(scim): add SCIM Groups API with CRUD and membership management (v4.4.0 PR5) (#270)\n\nImplement RFC 7644 SCIM 2.0 Groups endpoint with full CRUD operations:\n- POST /Groups - Create group with optional initial members\n- GET /Groups - List groups with filter and pagination\n- GET /Groups/<id> - Get group with members\n- PATCH /Groups/<id> - Update group fields and members\n- PUT /Groups/<id> - Replace group entirely\n- DELETE /Groups/<id> - Delete group (cascades to memberships)\n\nFeatures:\n- Full SCIM Group schema: displayName, externalId, members\n- Filter support: displayName eq, externalId eq\n- Pagination: startIndex, count (max 100)\n- Member operations: add, remove, replace\n- Tenant isolation for all operations\n\nMember management operations:\n- add_group_member: Add user to group (idempotent)\n- remove_group_member: Remove user from group\n- set_group_members: Replace all members atomically\n- get_group_members: List all members with user details\n- get_user_groups: List all groups a user belongs to\n\nTests: 39 new unit tests (193 total SCIM tests passing)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpWOWfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZvsQAIOZXpOmWDGVthwcP9sEqeRE\nesaY9kJxDYkY3XQESP4KEYlZxkHCpnWeMc8HoGFaQyAMgBmT+YhA+ba0LvMZxcCn\nil0T4HercE5ses0G/fD/iDXwueqwOBhsOUyV9wQnlJJuouH2DlgsuzUhUl0bijDp\nJe+PS0KEkWn8OjnbZPMuoC3HetXH3nJJgwPZ921zCsOys4fcSZITy/cp+wxeAjVj\nPptMz8SQebH++4srX+95QyzOIy/mlP2PrfoO0NEGVGqklfoRXC+ZGb5SAeQ1HI6r\nRJPHc+Kgo5WgV6mNWs4qMs6WkYII871iuirAXWekmHm1Yvadb/5ODMCsTYCUVhdF\ndxGkkMgWsJN1mKbLAUNd4bCPP2C2zyLM1hClKfAWKkj9WsDrYM5I8QUL0sTYf4Ne\nKbs3qG0FuVsXKSA6oVfyccWEzExp5caFXf+/qCNTBpvE4hrP+Ubt1/Avux2mOzrp\n+LqF80V75Ge9W3umqRHV3Yepq2azRaHH0Vn7Ar+WUatHed5FrNNehM3DO+l4G2iw\npoLA0/1hKWnOof8TJKDK4WOf1giQnpqllT/ke0K2tZsYG+9P7ToReXWZKKyI/w4x\nBBsG7k08iZIx1MYT97nvmM9TVd2WlUmBXw72BwZSuWJ5my2q7KvMRTpktoFnOced\nAL+B/MH80KD+Az+KpkQh\n=V5e4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-03T09:47:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api