"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T09:41:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(scim): add SCIM Users API with full CRUD, filter, pagination (v4.4.0 PR4) (#269)\n\nImplement RFC 7644 SCIM 2.0 Users endpoint with full CRUD operations:\n- POST /Users - Create user with SCIM attributes\n- GET /Users - List users with filter and pagination\n- GET /Users/<id> - Get user by ID\n- PATCH /Users/<id> - Update user fields\n- PUT /Users/<id> - Replace user entirely\n- DELETE /Users/<id> - Delete user\n\nFeatures:\n- Full SCIM User schema: userName, name, displayName, emails, active, externalId\n- Filter support: userName eq, externalId eq, email eq\n- Pagination: startIndex, count (max 100)\n- userName stored in lowercase for case-insensitive matching\n- Tenant isolation for all operations\n\nSchema changes:\n- Updated scim_users table with full attributes\n- Added conditional unique index on external_id (allows NULL)\n- New methods: list_scim_users, find_scim_users, count_scim_users\n\nTests: 45 new unit tests (154 total SCIM tests passing)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d89554e47d4e0ce1dcbb0cb859c521b4d7736606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/d89554e47d4e0ce1dcbb0cb859c521b4d7736606"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/7827e556e76a3a529037bfdc92c9aba43b071c1f","verification":{"payload":"tree d89554e47d4e0ce1dcbb0cb859c521b4d7736606\nparent a20351fbba654e02dc3abb9cccd75bc11f0c4e51\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767433315 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767433315 +0100\n\nfeat(scim): add SCIM Users API with full CRUD, filter, pagination (v4.4.0 PR4) (#269)\n\nImplement RFC 7644 SCIM 2.0 Users endpoint with full CRUD operations:\n- POST /Users - Create user with SCIM attributes\n- GET /Users - List users with filter and pagination\n- GET /Users/<id> - Get user by ID\n- PATCH /Users/<id> - Update user fields\n- PUT /Users/<id> - Replace user entirely\n- DELETE /Users/<id> - Delete user\n\nFeatures:\n- Full SCIM User schema: userName, name, displayName, emails, active, externalId\n- Filter support: userName eq, externalId eq, email eq\n- Pagination: startIndex, count (max 100)\n- userName stored in lowercase for case-insensitive matching\n- Tenant isolation for all operations\n\nSchema changes:\n- Updated scim_users table with full attributes\n- Added conditional unique index on external_id (allows NULL)\n- New methods: list_scim_users, find_scim_users, count_scim_users\n\nTests: 45 new unit tests (154 total SCIM tests passing)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpWORjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8QkQAJqvqiGI+uMi4SF56ZXTcDEn\nyvJEPbxl4L+xtaZHBivp6QkY8/RoldiAzuN0hLXQ1wuT3oQgB2vi7e7z7SfisNTu\nAn5WAZjFt48ux/r7a5U3JWSpYJ5rwZNM28SXqNkuJSyRsLHP19TW5G6Rlx21yJ/v\nIrJabOhgsQIOHJBW0hiC6WI33lGkmJkP8si0TkaVI7bo2sZNSt20zPxcbRQGfOIU\nJqrRTjrPgGS8ju8kOBWYer2sO3/gaAM1eVQYiJ6WiWY+/AVPDLKxlVWNi124RmRi\nit/5TnaLyfu1tXfT2MlB+OL5dSdM/n1KpKDgdtyFORn8GyRwnf1iKt/3SUndzJEk\n/YgUA9VewA6xPe0Misq4z9URpoYMemrvbP7CgTyH1Zgs1axB7c4rOuiuhcYJ6fEY\nKVXCOg5d1ZUAjLjXt1VJvAwMpmXaiUjfQkh5ft5l/3V5Ew8WT+eWWYtZit6118wf\nbQt5BrkDqvTzyVD3qYff9A+qTlyaG9hXLGczKMTmVkHDqzoto74D4NgKRvOJQuoR\ngy2i8QMH5kh9+kOI3K+pojlWfpaNsGD50u2tbeqljoy9IZP4vcUmtOIIJ+Y1xM5w\nEEQNKvh71DxNM1EH1wYO56Rw9OqumrvDTpo+DloujsQwKgC3dHAcpjsBVhZWds3c\n17FQzpoQPebQzjqCps1w\n=Zw/z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-03T09:41:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.g