rs/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/05d659aea805e14cccdeb46cdeb0bf31547fe6d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-03T09:30:46Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-03T09:30:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(scim): add SCIM auth middleware + token management API (v4.4.0 PR2) (#267)\n\nAdd SCIM bearer token authentication middleware and admin API endpoints\nfor token lifecycle management.\n\nComponents:\n- scim_auth.py: Bearer token extraction, validation, @require_scim_token decorator\n- scim_token_api.py: Flask Blueprint /api/provisioning/tokens\n  - GET: List tenant tokens (metadata only)\n  - POST: Create token (returns plaintext once)\n  - GET/<id>: Get token details\n  - DELETE/<id>: Revoke token\n  - POST/<id>/rotate: Rotate token\n\nSecurity:\n- Tokens stored as SHA-256 + pepper hash\n- Plaintext shown only at creation/rotation\n- @require_admin for all token management\n- RFC 7644 compliant error responses\n\nTests: 35 new unit tests (60 total SCIM tests passing)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fee07357c314b28eeb2a3d65fb400de3a7299362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/fee07357c314b28eeb2a3d65fb400de3a7299362"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/05d659aea805e14cccdeb46cdeb0bf31547fe6d7","verification":{"payload":"tree fee07357c314