vability\n\nSafety features:\n- MAX_DELETIONS_PER_RUN = 10000 (configurable)\n- Advisory lock per tenant/project\n- Legal hold checking before each deletion\n- Error tracking with skipped counts\n\nIntegration:\n- Uses get_effective_policy() for merged retention\n- Uses LegalHoldMatcher for hold checking\n- Creates purge_runs records in compliance store\n\nUnit tests: 16 tests covering dry run, execute, holds, limits\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpWDcnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsJwQAIUBYG2SBGsdtMreExp2cRMa\ncByPN4MpSaA9g0nG4pHAv5i+0yV5L5XKSzoATsoFFTNRgezWvRAan+SeexMMrk+w\nLSjfgnoMqIZ85Q3qr2SqdYyHOKfJotqI21qtD93d32eMdvo39h4lnAxEfY3Z2i5P\nC+idoPNMlc3Sk6lJgsW8hhG1gb3NKDEFAyE7/nkS2vbRCxs+bQrB9chNzTLLHZuo\nGBPSPgyN++jh1Xh6jXXc5GG6omUDFcvXOnOHNQFkecCoBOOm3Z/x5lPi4xA2JovN\n+/S1PMaC/U0dQy9Qz3lLB7y4H6laDmEA6JmcB8ou7TjJMzpCgRZ5iE4WS1Fw8xYz\nf4RiOKk2qnP+NYwc/pDSUYZJIVw8YS7YNT5eDElZp4uQYrZKe9yGbLvBrD349mnT\nJ2UUOtmIWZV2vC48x4w6TM9JiCM3cpNOdZQZ3GXPfogNan6V7IP9fxVDk5XN6cw4\njI0WyfcWY3I7uqFTJQytRPTtTuaBs8GTfDZ4+zfX2jbOXyOKDwwLvcclBsm1EMnj\npqvJXFxmqU1da0QanOYTk8dNw2shYin1HLqxk3G3ItsanPBbWbmS1Ilqn1igwsRq\nYS1V+6ZOqGm7PVBVOBT/6YsXyU8DgZHn0NWwOsESpaQI9dm8HeboHJwvesyrrfee\nxoaacDtGboKAolO4xyhm\n=DV4h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-02T21:22:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/or