thub.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/5c443eaa8208589f79a9e200ecb976997e87671d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-02T21:18:09Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-02T21:18:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(compliance): add legal hold engine with matcher + guards (v4.3.0 PR3) (#256)\n\nv4.3.0 PR3: Legal Hold Engine\n\nFeatures:\n- LegalHoldMatcher - match resources against active holds with caching\n- HoldMatch model - result with holds, reasons, scope\n- HoldViolationError - exception for hold violations\n- check_resource_held() - convenience function with optional raise\n- purge_guard() - context manager for safe purge operations\n- list_affected_resources() - find resources affected by a hold\n- get_hold_summary() - tenant hold statistics\n\nMatching logic:\n- Direct resource hold (most specific)\n- Project-level hold (all resources in project)\n- Tenant-wide \"all\" hold (least specific)\n\nGuard features:\n- fail_fast mode raises immediately on first hold\n- Returns allowed/blocked resource lists\n- Violations tracked with hold IDs and reasons\n\nUnit tests: 26 tests covering matcher, guards, and utilities\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03c3eba69810563ee261bc8d9b1f28ec37dc63ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/03c3eba69810563ee261bc8d9b1f28ec37dc63ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/5c443eaa8208589f79a9e200ecb976997e87671d","verification":{"payload":"tree 03c3eba69810563ee261bc8d9b1f28ec37dc63ec\nparent a7fcc1b3ccfb49b6c220ba497fb6499a9d721123\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767388689 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767388689 +0100\n\nfeat(compliance): add legal hold engine with matcher + guards (v4.3.0 PR3) (#256)\n\nv4.3.0 PR3: Legal Hold E