as","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/739c964e27cdac97c33f4857654fd59c2ad11f69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-02T10:01:13Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-02T10:01:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"obs(projects): add project metrics + forbidden spike alerts (v3.7.0 PR6) (#223)\n\nPrometheus Metrics (observability/project_metrics.py):\n\nCounters:\n- bess_project_operations_total: Project CRUD (create/update/archive/list)\n- bess_project_membership_operations_total: Membership changes (add/update/remove)\n- bess_project_access_checks_total: Permission checks (allowed/denied)\n- bess_project_access_denied_total: Forbidden spikes by reason\n- bess_project_share_policy_enforcements_total: Share policy (allowed/denied/clamped)\n- bess_project_resource_access_total: Project-scoped resource access\n\nGauges:\n- bess_project_count: Projects per tenant\n- bess_project_membership_count: Members per project\n\nHistogram:\n- bess_project_membership_changes: Membership change distribution\n\nAlerting Rules (docs/observability/ALERTS.md):\n- BESSProjectAccessDeniedSpike (critical): >20 denials in 5min\n- BESSProjectForbiddenRateHigh (warning): >10% forbidden rate\n- BESSSharePolicyDenials (warning): Share policy blocking\n- BESSSharePolicyClamping (info): Expiry clamping active\n- BESSProjectMembershipActivity (info): High membership changes\n- BESSNonMemberAccessAttempts (warning): Non-member access\n- BESSProjectCreationRate (info): High project creation\n- BESSCrossProjectAccessDenied (warning): Cross-project denials\n\nTests:\n- tests/unit/test_project_metrics.py with 33 tests\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df847e8db2883ccf42b0d53b44f5660a4e28b9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsma