"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commits/da7404e1ee247faf54513045b558f4e0d6754c7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-02T08:52:01Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"pawelsmas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-02T08:52:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): add projects API endpoints (v3.7.0 PR2) (#219)\n\n* feat(db): add projects + memberships tables with RBAC (v3.7.0 PR1)\n\nDatabase layer for Projects & Per-Project RBAC:\n\nTables added:\n- projects(id, tenant_id, name, created_at, archived_at, created_by_user_id,\n  allow_public_shares, share_max_expiry_hours)\n- project_memberships(id, tenant_id, project_id, user_id, role, created_at)\n  with UNIQUE(project_id, user_id) constraint\n\nMigrations:\n- shares table: added project_id column with index\n- runs table: added project_id column with index\n\nProjectRole enum: owner > editor > viewer hierarchy\n\nAuthStore operations:\n- create_project, get_project, list_projects, update_project\n- archive_project, unarchive_project, project_name_exists\n- add_project_member, get_project_membership, list_project_members\n- list_user_projects, update_project_member_role, remove_project_member\n- count_project_owners, user_has_project_access (role hierarchy check)\n- backfill_default_project (creates \"Default Project\" + adds all users as owners)\n\nRunStore operations:\n- save(), get(), list() now accept project_id parameter\n- Project isolation alongside tenant isolation\n\nScripts:\n- scripts/db/backfill_default_project.py with --dry-run support\n\nTests: 45 unit tests for projects, memberships, role hierarchy, backfill\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(api): add projects API endpoints (v3.7.0 PR2)\n\nProjects REST API at /api/bess-dispatch/projects:\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET /projects - list projects (admin: all, user: member only)\n- POST /projects - create project (admin only, creator becomes owner)\n- GET /projects/{id} - get project details (member or admin)\n- PATCH /projects/{id} - update settings (owner or admin)\n- POST /projects/{id}/archive - archive project (owner or admin)\n- POST /projects/{id}/unarchive - unarchive project (owner or admin)\n\nMember management:\n- GET /projects/{id}/members - list members (any member)\n- POST /projects/{id}/members - add member (owner or admin)\n- PATCH /projects/{id}/members/{user_id} - update role (owner or admin)\n- DELETE /projects/{id}/members/{user_id} - remove member (owner or admin)\n\nBackfill:\n- POST /projects/backfill-default - create Default Project (admin only)\n\nAuthorization:\n- Tenant isolation enforced\n- Project role hierarchy: owner > editor > viewer\n- Cannot remove/demote last owner\n- Duplicate member detection (409 Conflict)\n\nX-Project-Id header support for project context scoping.\n\nTests: 13 unit tests for router logic\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3047cdb0de96f8279aa7984c9069fe535aff0876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/3047cdb0de96f8279aa7984c9069fe535aff0876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/da7404e1ee247faf54513045b558f4e0d6754c7d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3047cdb0de96f8279aa