d} - update settings (owner or admin)\n- POST /projects/{id}/archive - archive project (owner or admin)\n- POST /projects/{id}/unarchive - unarchive project (owner or admin)\n\nMember management:\n- GET /projects/{id}/members - list members (any member)\n- POST /projects/{id}/members - add member (owner or admin)\n- PATCH /projects/{id}/members/{user_id} - update role (owner or admin)\n- DELETE /projects/{id}/members/{user_id} - remove member (owner or admin)\n\nBackfill:\n- POST /projects/backfill-default - create Default Project (admin only)\n\nAuthorization:\n- Tenant isolation enforced\n- Project role hierarchy: owner > editor > viewer\n- Cannot remove/demote last owner\n- Duplicate member detection (409 Conflict)\n\nX-Project-Id header support for project context scoping.\n\nTests: 13 unit tests for router logic\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpV4cxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIekQAHVH6X3B7M2JcYXJP9nyaRGh\n0bOo5JxPnqKOZ4LszJ3FauxBTykhWByRlc+eUZfd4gURB6GRKqQsxN/WIsfG7WSE\nTwAETT7ArwbQl0yomnJA6KEUwngkkq1BTefQC9io61KjVLyrZIHGqBVbPOPxSoBJ\nem5OcD+6hAIEOnoigLijTFcmIuU460hUv4cl16hggnZp7SqgyqgaQCNIbOyP0Jpt\nPVkcRMTglezFSdCBm4/WJ9m15L2tF+fMi5IX+pqWERlejlus8NcVTTytFnhLug3X\nPS+aYsRLXGSMnFexrjZwuGmbcWtNJBMUbzC1VNq2SyIQ55ZypPJqYui43IrKaypm\nXk4pntS1y8lmZronKuXfozfmU1Qlb5MMSm5GzjwRPpT5mByfKmxB/bEApmuqy4EA\n+7N4NyDeKt5ajNdtTBX9emHUJ/5zWhrQ30ukOYr4fIsfm/mCpocEPmrr4l/ktHIM\nJ6filv0zzmFINzDRxg/xSYsD1BEMD4ZQN249dsBNQGkhJ7XaFAKv0xfg4NyVAxfl\nTo3O6adLXZs9L1ENmjnTiQMyCw/rNYKezNGhJwnEkzqgM2MH0vsLQRuEnOubQ+eE\nvJ2pbxvMNb1u0pNadoot/BbOfuVjmeNPMHaRCo4aobybwLvhw2X6fx6NvdsUpTfN\nyfHnjeiW07gtEVIEp+aF\n=7/qG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-02T08:52:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19