-01-01T15:10:23Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-01T15:10:23Z","email":"pawel.smas@pagra.eu","name":"Pawel Smas"},"message":"obs(auth): add auth metrics + docs + alerts (v3.0.0 PR6)\n\n- observability/auth_metrics.py: Prometheus metrics for auth:\n  - bess_auth_login_total (result: success/failure)\n  - bess_auth_token_validations_total (result: success/failure/expired)\n  - bess_auth_api_key_validations_total (result: success/failure/expired/revoked)\n  - bess_auth_api_key_operations_total (operation: create/revoke, result)\n  - bess_audit_log_writes_total (action)\n  - bess_auth_requests_total (auth_method, role)\n  - bess_rbac_checks_total (required_role, result: allowed/denied)\n  - Helper functions: record_login, record_token_validation, etc.\n\n- docs/AUTH.md: Complete auth documentation\n  - Configuration (AUTH_MODE, JWT_SECRET, etc.)\n  - JWT and API key authentication\n  - RBAC role hierarchy and permissions\n  - Multi-tenancy and tenant isolation\n  - Audit logging\n  - Migration guide from v2.x\n\n- docs/observability/ALERTS.md: Auth alerting rules\n  - BESSHighLoginFailureRate (warning)\n  - BESSLoginFailuresSpike (warning)\n  - BESSApiKeyValidationFailures (warning)\n  - BESSExpiredApiKeysUsed (info)\n  - BESSRbacDenials (warning)\n  - BESSAuditLogHighVolume (info)\n\n25 unit tests for auth metrics.\n112 total auth-related tests passing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0681dbd050b41116549ccc1dd68ecfb262affe7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/0681dbd050b41116549ccc1dd68ecfb262affe7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/ce1181e567a747da7e652e4fdff128d2601632a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g