states, error handling\n- settings.html: admin settings page with API keys management (list/create/\n  revoke), audit log viewer with filtering and pagination, export to ZIP\n- index.html: WhoAmI badge in header showing user email/role/tenant,\n  settings link, logout button, initAuth() on page load\n- styles.css: auth UI styles - whoami badge, role colors, API keys table,\n  modal overlay, audit log styles\n\n29 unit tests passing for auth UI structure.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77e675176acc27137542b1d32cd6f392a1d6c1d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/77e675176acc27137542b1d32cd6f392a1d6c1d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/1cd63aff66318a6b03377812887eb066d65b7714","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224280370?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas","id":224280370,"login":"pawelsmas","node_id":"U_kgDODV4_Mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pawelsmas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/commit/1cd63aff663