g storage\n- audit_router.py: API endpoints for querying/exporting\n\nFeatures:\n- Log security events (login, api_key ops, sizing runs)\n- Query with filters (action, actor, date range)\n- Export to CSV, JSON, or ZIP bundle\n- 90-day retention with prune support\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET /audit - query audit log\n- GET /audit/export/csv - export as CSV\n- GET /audit/export/json - export as JSON\n- GET /audit/export/zip - export as ZIP\n\nTests:\n- 11 unit tests for audit store\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79dc9aed22390e31c43fdb968c72377b6b852afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/79dc9aed22390e31c43fdb968c72377b6b852afd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/9c51d81fdbe0f17cfd3c4ce9299d80f5ec474845","verification":{"payload":"tree 79dc9aed22390e31c43fdb968c72377b6b852afd\nparent 16cd5c3bfbda823744a237188cacfee1c019a7ad\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767279130 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767279130 +0100\n\nfeat(audit): add audit log store + /audit endpoint + export (v3.0.0 PR4) (#179)\n\nAudit logging infrastructure:\n- audit_store.py: SQLite-backed audit log storage\n- audit_router.py: API endpoints for querying/exporting\n\nFeatures:\n- Log security events (login, api_key ops, sizing runs)\n- Query with filters (action, actor, date range)\n- Export to CSV, JSON, or ZIP bundle\n- 90-day retention with prune support\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET /audit - query audit log\n- GET /audit/export/csv - export as CSV\n- GET /audit/export/json - export as JSON\n- GET /audit/export/zip - export as ZIP\n\nTests:\n- 11 unit tests for audit store\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVoobCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEWEQADI3zx0Fl1RwC