- create new key (plaintext shown once)\n- DELETE /admin/api-keys/{key_id} - revoke key\n\nSecurity:\n- Admin cannot create admin API keys (only service/editor/viewer)\n- Keys scoped by tenant (cross-tenant returns 404)\n- Revoked keys cannot authenticate\n\nTests:\n- 16 unit tests for RBAC role hierarchy\n- Contract tests for admin API endpoints\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1672695a62a0d915ed9fb2d78be2ce03095ce54e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/1672695a62a0d915ed9fb2d78be2ce03095ce54e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/16cd5c3bfbda823744a237188cacfee1c019a7ad","verification":{"payload":"tree 1672695a62a0d915ed9fb2d78be2ce03095ce54e\nparent 080882ff3eba169a3caac7e27558daff8096995d\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767278885 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767278885 +0100\n\nfeat(rbac): RBAC enforcement + admin API keys endpoints (v3.0.0 PR3) (#178)\n\nRBAC enforcement:\n- Role hierarchy: admin > editor = service > viewer\n- require_role dependency for protected endpoints\n- Role.has_permission method for permission checks\n\nAdmin API endpoints:\n- GET /admin/api-keys - list keys for tenant\n- POST /admin/api-keys - create new key (plaintext shown once)\n- DELETE /admin/api-keys/{key_id} - revoke key\n\nSecurity:\n- Admin cannot create admin API keys (only service/editor/viewer)\n- Keys scoped by tenant (cross-tenant returns 404)\n- Revoked keys cannot authenticate\n\nTests:\n- 16 unit tests for RBAC role hierarchy\n- Contract tests for admin API endpoints\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVoklCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADmQQAGpZwGHNDj9QY4i2FflGWlY+\naxUgD0Yp+ekmB0TeR5DQkJgV3eGvVYcWdbl4eCjZ0Az3uoNT2p76