ting tables\n\nSecurity: Cross-tenant access returns None (404) not 403 to prevent\ninformation leakage about resource existence.\n\nTests:\n- 10 unit tests for tenant scoping behavior\n- All auth tests still passing (31 total)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50a6e00ede1a28d62b10aee3d304ac57a0e886d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/50a6e00ede1a28d62b10aee3d304ac57a0e886d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/080882ff3eba169a3caac7e27558daff8096995d","verification":{"payload":"tree 50a6e00ede1a28d62b10aee3d304ac57a0e886d6\nparent d7ed7a6e9e928d0f7534105321a6a07e0a024695\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767278590 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767278590 +0100\n\nfeat(tenant): add tenant_id scoping to RunStore + JobStore (v3.0.0 PR2) (#177)\n\nTenant isolation for multi-tenant support:\n- RunStore: tenant_id column, get/list/update scoped by tenant\n- JobStore: tenant_id column, get/list scoped by tenant\n- Idempotency keys are now unique per-tenant (composite index)\n- Default tenant_id=''default'' for backward compatibility\n- Migration adds tenant_id column to existing tables\n\nSecurity: Cross-tenant access returns None (404) not 403 to prevent\ninformation leakage about resource existence.\n\nTests:\n- 10 unit tests for tenant scoping behavior\n- All auth tests still passing (31 total)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVof+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0XIQALCRPmvB3tKDU0tgjR2mNvcn\nybkU+0p4SxHZFdgPy/sIkfXA7Q+niTXmoZx99g3kZDc4ctNd//VxhNh7ncGp84O+\nyo2W/sHK5YQlHU+igDziyXXRajf1fqJR0wfs7FSSBqqfTQ74Juv0hXvK0JPDvUvP\nQI+FGlUF0de4K16jomt5R2A+LDQ1pe9yJjDAV2W+3Fjtnvvx44OJJ+ZORYbfy8K2\nPYSKqINoREsg92gnE1r/r5QxvUPPZM5