min > editor = service > viewer\n- DEV_SEED_ADMIN=true seeds admin@local/admin user\n\nTests:\n- 21 unit tests for core auth functionality\n- 3 contract test files for disabled/enabled modes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3db49eff5c6c65d1d0564231a4c0c25c4dae60d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/d3db49eff5c6c65d1d0564231a4c0c25c4dae60d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/d7ed7a6e9e928d0f7534105321a6a07e0a024695","verification":{"payload":"tree d3db49eff5c6c65d1d0564231a4c0c25c4dae60d\nparent 97972a0f86b827105585b1a563eae046462f190b\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767277952 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767277952 +0100\n\nfeat(auth): JWT login + API key auth + /auth/me (v3.0.0 PR1) (#176)\n\nAuth core implementation:\n- auth_config.py: AuthMode, Role enum with RBAC, AuthContext model\n- auth_store.py: SQLite-backed storage for tenants, users, API keys\n- auth_jwt.py: JWT token creation and validation\n- auth_deps.py: FastAPI dependencies for protected endpoints\n- auth_router.py: POST /auth/login, GET /auth/me endpoints\n\nFeatures:\n- AUTH_MODE=disabled (default) allows all requests\n- AUTH_MODE=enabled requires JWT or API key\n- Bcrypt password hashing, SHA-256 API key hashing\n- Role hierarchy: admin > editor = service > viewer\n- DEV_SEED_ADMIN=true seeds admin@local/admin user\n\nTests:\n- 21 unit tests for core auth functionality\n- 3 contract test files for disabled/enabled modes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVoWACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAibsQAJBQZ/GLYKPkDDJHchmcYOfr\nFwPTyzkrtbDGrluM6+xhbLj5EkPmxurZH0HPYdsCMXxH1Sxca79otF4fp1xDY6Zs\nA0EJVAbsAu4neGlgi9cJaaCctYcUwJiMVSoGjLOI0m4oQp/QNjkXYwV12IHJ