om","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): compat=clean|legacy response shaping for deprecated fields (v2.7.0 PR2) (#165)\n\nAdd compatibility mode for response shaping:\n- services/bess-dispatch/compat_mode.py - SSoT for compat mode\n- /sizing endpoint accepts ?compat=clean|legacy query param\n- clean mode (default): omits deprecated response fields\n- legacy mode: adds deprecated field aliases, triggers deprecation headers\n\nCompat mode features:\n- parse_compat_mode() - parse query param\n- apply_compat_mode() - transform response dict\n- _FIELD_ALIASES - mapping of deprecated names to source fields\n- Metrics: bess_compat_legacy_responses_total\n\nTests:\n- 19 unit tests for compat_mode module\n- 13 contract tests for compat mode endpoints\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a847ab064637339f10d62171dc5a557dd30fdd6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/a847ab064637339f10d62171dc5a557dd30fdd6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/37715f182f4daa9c6df1e4ed572a33940040c9a9","verification":{"payload":"tree a847ab064637339f10d62171dc5a557dd30fdd6b\nparent f9c38769b7501a66c85e9ab7c36aa5b1bc58f043\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767273339 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767273339 +0100\n\nfeat(api): compat=clean|legacy response shaping for deprecated fields (v2.7.0 PR2) (#165)\n\nAdd compatibility mode for response shaping:\n- services/bess-dispatch/compat_mode.py - SSoT for compat mode\n- /sizing endpoint accepts ?compat=clean|legacy query param\n- clean mode (default): omits deprecated response fields\n- legacy mode: adds deprecated field aliases, triggers deprecation headers\n\nCompat mode features:\n- parse_compat_mode() - parse query param\n- apply_compat_mode() - transform response dict\n- _FIELD_ALIASES - mapping of deprecated names to source fields\n- Metrics: bess_compat_legacy_responses_total\n\nTests:\n- 19 unit tests for compat_mode module\n- 13 contract tests for compat mode endpoints\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVnN7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfPcQAAwEVl9uaQDr5xi2v/LlTwWf\n5ooMbw6y3s46N45Xck9vBzBaxe3hpqM3VHt06n35lwUXjQH0m5dB0+z57gVOElnA\nsc01zS7KJAnYjuCicnBnQG4lO/wQoA7aZItzKDWBMgtieh2Dvom0nfia7HQpNQ5r\nQllSCnhph3Id29eVeKu7dKFVV8h6mw9rOGMePeP9L5bdEa8uCeG7eWZzl0KM4Wli\n+yXCOcYOsmam4E/n3pE49m/4u45xv0LkJUZTN3ZHpXhTlMZx+KtoZJd0MjubfVul\nTDiwrsaOvaeFoPvwyaVtv3IUUPVaqxpnVM/NqAWB+1EoUgXF7BW6bG5cpl2R0ivw\nSYfFaAKSJ0OFjeCyKYXMVkHuHasLLQtOx/nSTt21dHprt9UnxnCy72rCFCy6TP8N\n17Wn5QJwE3DykVzQRbwOZu7abQcL0cJe0t9gIcLbZ8fMrR+iRqtTlXEMP4mIiO1x\ngAoUAm9eb0rMl4Y8dt13rq0OvB+7VyJqEROQgeJhoZ0HoziXdcgpuZHEjsPnbtI9\nh4ydd9+iI//DHGViq1UEdfZCF0iiRzIfS/LpAU28/MZ4Oil9Ww1mc26jn1lyuvFj\nADVSfyXeFvEZ1YlTpKdhXeyFNFlIOoUtoKBfn6ntouISS55Mvh50ET96de5HzHya\nTrjwFlu15FzQSMb1ALHS\n=+oxS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-01T13:15:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/