"GitHub"},"message":"harden(api): deprecation headers + warnings + metrics (v2.7.0 PR1) (#164)\n\nAdd comprehensive deprecation tracking infrastructure:\n- services/bess-dispatch/deprecations_usage.py - SSoT for tracking\n- Middleware for adding Deprecation/Link/Sunset headers\n- Prometheus metrics: bess_deprecation_used_total, bess_deprecation_responses_total\n- Updated deprecations.json with include_* flags (v2.5.0 deprecated)\n\nDeprecation tracking:\n- mark_used(field) tracks deprecated field usage per request\n- get_deprecation_headers() returns RFC 8594 compliant headers\n- Sunset date: 2026-03-01\n\nTests:\n- 21 unit tests for deprecations_usage module\n- 14 contract tests for deprecation headers\n- Updated registry tests for sunset_date field\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1af30f79b063a170b6badcbe6774f1cf559afee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/1af30f79b063a170b6badcbe6774f1cf559afee7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/f9c38769b7501a66c85e9ab7c36aa5b1bc58f043","verification":{"payload":"tree 1af30f79b063a170b6badcbe6774f1cf559afee7\nparent b4762ce3a6154653e195439247d78c7199ce18b9\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767273017 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767273017 +0100\n\nharden(api): deprecation headers + warnings + metrics (v2.7.0 PR1) (#164)\n\nAdd comprehensive deprecation tracking infrastructure:\n- services/bess-dispatch/deprecations_usage.py - SSoT for tracking\n- Middleware for adding Deprecation/Link/Sunset headers\n- Prometheus metrics: bess_deprecation_used_total, bess_deprecation_responses_total\n- Updated deprecations.json with include_* flags (v2.5.0 deprecated)\n\nDeprecation tracking:\n- mark_used(field) tracks deprecated field usage per request\n- get_deprecation_headers() returns RFC 8594 compliant headers\n- Sunset date: 2026-03-01\n