ion in HTTP middleware\n  - request_size_limit.py: Track limit rejections\n  - report_cache.py: Track cache hits/misses and size\n\n- Tests: 35 unit tests, 28 contract tests\n- Alerts: 8 new alerting rules in ALERTS.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb4917c263d414c53ca8150edfa9e06bae5c9e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/trees/bb4917c263d414c53ca8150edfa9e06bae5c9e7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pawelsmas/analizator-pv/git/commits/ade1d344962547529f1908c40199e531d27b4c61","verification":{"payload":"tree bb4917c263d414c53ca8150edfa9e06bae5c9e7f\nparent a0bb2bce6f829ead51c516c2e8401ae84525be40\nauthor pawelsmas <pawel.smas@pagra.eu> 1767270381 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767270381 +0100\n\nobs(perf): add performance observability metrics (v2.5.0 PR6) (#157)\n\nAdd Prometheus metrics for request/response performance monitoring:\n\n- perf_metrics.py: New SSoT module with metrics for:\n  - Request/response size histograms (bess_request_size_bytes, bess_response_size_bytes)\n  - Request duration histogram (bess_request_duration_seconds)\n  - Slow request counter (bess_slow_requests_total, threshold: 2s)\n  - Report cache hit/miss counters\n  - Report cache size gauge\n  - Compression ratio histogram and savings counter\n  - Limit rejection counter\n\n- Integration points:\n  - app.py: Track request duration in HTTP middleware\n  - request_size_limit.py: Track limit rejections\n  - report_cache.py: Track cache hits/misses and size\n\n- Tests: 35 unit tests, 28 contract tests\n- Alerts: 8 new alerting rules in ALERTS.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpVmftCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlgwQAHZpA4arlbQjlMhYvHTA9+JX\nXVuJi/FpB5mMRofntsaE8kxTOfdaE7sfkgMSQ