ation and task management services\n\n- Added unit tests for `authService`, `taskListService`, and `taskService` to ensure proper functionality of authentication and task management features.\n- Created test cases for user registration, login, and fetching current user data in `authService`.\n- Implemented tests for task list operations including fetching, creating, updating, and deleting tasks in `taskListService`.\n- Developed tests for task operations such as fetching, creating, updating, and deleting tasks in `taskService`.\n- Established a mock for Vuetify styles to facilitate testing without CSS dependencies.\n- Enhanced the README.md to reflect the implementation of tests for services and components.","tree":{"sha":"6d7ba3ec0dbb930894ebd321925c57422190eb61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felps-developer/tasklist-frontend/git/trees/6d7ba3ec0dbb930894ebd321925c57422190eb61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felps-developer/tasklist-frontend/git/commits/7bc44515da15a519df4ec60aa0a246aa8ad9e9ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61009485?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felps-developer","id":61009485,"login":"felps-developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDA5NDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felps-developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur