/users/xizhao/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xizhao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xizhao/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xizhao","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xizhao/hands/commits/4fc5fb73720bd7233c503d4cfadb0be906e080d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-24T08:22:39Z","email":"kevin@fossa.com","name":"Kevin Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-24T08:22:39Z","email":"kevin@fossa.com","name":"Kevin Wang"},"message":"feat: Add always-on taskbar service with screen capture\n\n- System tray integration (tray.rs)\n  - Tray icon with workbook quick access menu\n  - Click to show/focus main window\n  - Capture shortcut in menu\n\n- Global hotkey (hotkeys.rs)\n  - Cmd+Shift+H triggers screen capture\n  - Uses tauri-plugin-global-shortcut\n\n- Screen capture flow (capture.rs)\n  - Region selection overlay\n  - Captures screenshot with xcap\n  - Opens floating chat widget with result\n\n- Multi-window workbooks (runtime_manager.rs)\n  - Dynamic port allocation for parallel runtimes\n  - Window lifecycle management\n  - Active job tracking per workbook\n\n- Window lifecycle changes (lib.rs)\n  - Hide instead of quit on window close\n  - App stays running in system tray\n  - Workbook windows managed separately\n\n- Frontend components\n  - CaptureOverlay.tsx: Fullscreen region selector\n  - ChatWidget.tsx: Floating draggable chat\n  - Window type routing in main.tsx\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c374d7e2190434a8137706f46fe6a88a9f22f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xizhao/hands/git/trees/5c374d7e2190434a8137706f46fe6a88a9f22f6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xizhao/hands/git/commits/4fc5fb73720bd7233c503d4cfadb0be906e080d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned