s and payments stacked on\none crowded screen.\n\n- Replace the two-column summary with a header: invoice number, status\n  and closed tags, labelled details and the key figures.\n- Split the page into Line items, Payments and Timeline tabs.\n- Add a timeline of the bill''s history: opened, items added, payments\n  and close, grouped by day.\n- Wait for the bill to load before rendering; bill mutations clear the\n  cached bill, which crashed the invoice actions on an empty bill.","tree":{"sha":"1ccaea776f9e10c5f25c9478b7d86fdb9db8e03e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/trees/1ccaea776f9e10c5f25c9478b7d86fdb9db8e03e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/commits/847f802879048caa773691f7897f7a5ad4cf1529","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9332481?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErmiasTefera","id":9332481,"login":"ErmiasTefera","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMzI0ODE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commit/847f802879048caa773691f7897f7a5ad4c