m-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commits/c24833ceeadde286d9b3c7589bc8f30915ee4973"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116313567?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahmihassu","id":116313567,"login":"ahmihassu","node_id":"U_kgDOBu7N3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commits/04e7d2035e43b16335121f824689ad346f71387f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:45:03Z","email":"ahmihassu@gmail.com","name":"ahmihassu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:45:03Z","email":"ahmihassu@gmail.com","name":"ahmihassu"},"message":"fix(ward): count days in bed as inclusive calendar days\n\nAdmission tabs and bed-fee billing each invented their own day count, so the admitted list was always one short (0 for same-day admissions) and discharge-in kept climbing after discharge. Route every path through one inclusive-day helper so the number shown matches what is billed.\n\n- Add countInclusiveDays and unit tests for same-day, multi-day, open stays, and invalid dates\n- Wire admitted, awaiting-admission, and discharge-in tables through the shared helper\n- Stop discharge-in duration at the IPD discharge encounter instead of today\n- Reuse the helper inside getBedStayWindow so billing days match the tables\n- Relabel awaiting-admission as Days in queue; unify Days in ward on the other tabs\n- Drop the duplicate durationOnWard translation keys in en/am\n- Make bed-fee stay tests timezone-stable under TZ=UTC","tree":{"sha":"4297ccb546ccc043000621a345e2064703831670","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/trees/4297ccb546ccc043000621a345e2064703831670"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/commits/04e7d2035e43b16335121f824689ad346f71387f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116313567?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahmihassu","id":116313567,"login":"ahmihassu","node_id":"U_kgDOBu7N3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commit/04e7d2035e43b16335121f824689ad346f71387f","node_id":"C_kwDOQlSrztoAKDA0ZTdkMjAzNWU0M2IxNjMzNTEyMWY4MjQ2ODlhZDM0NmY3MTM4N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commit/cb4436cac996ef124d2367b7241d24a692bf1172","sha":"cb4436cac996ef124d2367b