mihassu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commits/83b9eece72e4ac9f8a86edc05bd5a1f3dd2e1069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:45:19Z","email":"ahmihassu@gmail.com","name":"ahmihassu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:45:19Z","email":"ahmihassu@gmail.com","name":"ahmihassu"},"message":"feat(ward): let the liaison generate bed fee bills at discharge\nBed fees were not being billed for a patient''s ward stay, and the billing\nrate varies per facility, so the billable service cannot be pinned in the\nshared cross-facility config. Give the liaison an explicit action that\ncomputes the stay length for them while leaving the service choice open.\n- Add a \"Generate bill\" action to the Discharge-In overflow menu that opens\n  a new bed fee modal\n- Show the stay duration, bed type and admission date as read-only in the\n  modal so the liaison cannot alter days or price, only the billable service\n- Pre-select and search billable services by the shared daily bed fee concept\n  instead of hardcoding service UUIDs per facility\n- Derive the unit price from the visit''s payment mode and show the computed\n  total before the bill is posted\n- Add bed-fee utils for the stay window, encounter lookup, price selection,\n  payment mode and concept matching, with unit tests\n- Register the generate-bed-fee-bill modal in routes.json and index.ts\n- Expose bedFeeDaysBilled and mutate from usePatientBills, and extend the\n  billed-days window past the discharge date so fees raised afterwards still\n  count and cannot be billed twice\n- Request visit attributes in the visit encounters representation so the\n  payment mode is available for price selection\n- Reuse the shared getBedStayWindow in the Discharge-In cells so the days\n  shown and the days billed agree\n- Fix the empty Discharged tab by recording the exit-from-inpatient encounter\n  at the ward location rather than the user''s session location\n- Add the accompanying English translations","tree":{"sha":"b07b93817c42f47f63c6089b9bc8d882288e6c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/trees/b07b93817c42f47f63c6089b9bc8d882288e6c87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/commits/83b9eece72e4ac9f8a86edc05bd5a1f3dd2e1069","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116313567?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahmihassu","id":116313567,"login":"ahmihassu","node_id":"U_kgDOBu7N3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmihassu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/commit/83b9eece72e4ac9f8a86edc05bd5a1f3dd2e1069","node_id":"C_kwDOQlSrztoAKDgzYjllZWNlNzJlNGFjOWY4YTg2ZWRjMDViZDVhMWYzZGQyZTEwNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/palladium-gr