rmias.abera@thepalladiumgroup.com","name":"Ermias Tefera"},"message":"Update dependencies and configurations for OpenMRS 10.x compatibility\n\n- Updated `@openmrs/esm-framework` and `@openmrs/esm-patient-common-lib` to version 10.x and 12.2.1 respectively across multiple packages.\n- Changed Node.js version in CI workflows from 18 to 20.\n- Refactored `rspack.config.js` in various packages to use a new shared configuration.\n- Modified `start:local` command in `package.json` to point to a new backend URL.\n- Introduced a new type `DrugOrderBasketItemWithStartDate` to accommodate changes in the `@openmrs/esm-patient-common-lib`.\n- Adjusted tests and components to reflect the new type and configuration changes.","tree":{"sha":"ec88cac5141d5376343ed79d7a39fb02b01a06b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/trees/ec88cac5141d5376343ed79d7a39fb02b01a06b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-esm-3.x/git/commits/df8f77956e9d6c998ff3ec5d517e875d43005cfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9332481?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ErmiasTefera","id":9332481,"login":"ErmiasTefera","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMzI0ODE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErmiasTefera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co