-smoke.spec.ts`).\n    - `Systems Discovery`: Validated similar smoke test cases for i18n and UI behavior (`tests-e2e/sd-smoke.spec.ts`).\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `action-plan.md` to document:\n    - Addition of LibraKeeper to featured projects and README.\n    - Inclusion of Playwright tests for **Rite of Discovery** and **Systems Discovery**.\n\nThis commit highlights the addition of a new project, improvements in test coverage, and corresponding updates to documentation, ensuring consistency and robust validation.","tree":{"sha":"bcbe837df3c621a598f65f6d731e1e970f5fa9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/bcbe837df3c621a598f65f6d731e1e970f5fa9be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/115f3d2b422b3faa01f79f410b00a2bd0c32ba82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/115f3d2b422b3faa01f79f410b00a2bd0c32ba82","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDExNWYzZDJiNDIyYjNmYWEwMWY3OWY0MTBiMDBh