age URLs, and repository links.\n    - Refined **Quest Hunt** description and replaced local image paths with placeholder `picsum.photos` URLs for consistency.\n    - Removed obsolete **GameHub Backend** project.\n\n- **i18n Improvements:**\n  - Enhanced **Rite of Discovery** localization in `i18n/rite-of-discovery`:\n    - Improved introduction strings with clearer multi-paragraph structure (`p1`, `p2`, `cta`, `skip`) for both EN and FR translations.\n  - Added **Toymaker Escape** localization strings in `i18n/toymaker-escape/en.json` and `i18n/toymaker-escape/fr.json`:\n    - New keys for introduction scenes and multi-paragraph body/transitions.\n    - Localized new prompts and interactive elements such as \"Choose your approach\" and \"Skip intro.\"\n\n- **README Enhancements:**\n  - Added a new **Credits** section to provide attribution for placeholder assets and sounds:\n    - Linked `public/credits.md` for development placeholder sources and notes on final attribution workflows.\n\n- **Carousel Layout Adjustment:**\n  - Refined grid layout in `Carousel.tsx`:\n    - Unified responsive widths between large (`lg`) and extra-large (`xl`) breakpoints for a smoother layout (`calc((100%-2rem)/3)`).\n\nThese changes add new projects, improve localization across games, enhance documentation with a credits section, and polish the responsive Carousel layout.","tree":{"sha":"27bb9a0373d409d89b300ab0eca2beace3593fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/27bb9a0373d409d89b300ab0eca2beace3593fb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/675c2df3054f0b4175f9007650d1a4b149454f3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.gi