com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/e3f9bc13e4f57d6ec91347f5b18ea9b385d3be6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-23T07:11:15Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-23T07:11:15Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(TME, puzzles, tests): optimize persistence and add expanded tests for wires, pipes, and gears**\n\n- **Persistence Optimization:**\n  - Updated `ToymakerEscapeGame.tsx` persistence logic:\n    - Introduced `useRef` with idempotency guard to minimize redundant writes for save state.\n    - Added payload comparison to prevent unnecessary `versionedSave` calls.\n\n- **Expanded Testing:**\n  - Added unit tests for edge and negative cases:\n    - **Wires Puzzle:**\n      - Validated crossing detection under decreasing indices.\n      - Tested solution accuracy with unordered but correct connections.\n      - Ensured reset behavior clears connections and unsolves state.\n    - **Pipes Puzzle:**\n      - Covered multi-source/sink configurations requiring valve toggling and open-path detection.\n      - Verified unsolved state with leaks, closed valves, and improper connections, as well as solving through rotation fixes.\n    - **Gears Puzzle:**\n      - Tested tolerances for gear ratios within and outside of acceptable ranges.\n      - Handled complex setups with multiple idler gears ensuring tolerance adherence.\n  - Increased edge case coverage to improve puzzle robustness.\n\n- **Documentation Updates:**\n  - Updated `action-plan.md`:\n    - Reflected enhancements in test coverage for puzzles and polish tasks.\n    - Documented plans for persistence migration and upcoming Episode 1 refinements.\n\nThese changes ensure optimized persistence, expanded coverage of edge cases, and introduce robust tests for wires, pipes, and gears puzzles.","tree":{"sha":"3f83c4adc39e138a78d85398b09b2c59b821064d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/3f83c4adc39e138a78d85398b09b2c59b821064d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/e3f9bc13e4f57d6ec91347f5b18ea9b385d3be6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/e3f9bc13e4f57d6ec91347f5b18ea9b385d3be6a","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGUzZjliYzEzZTRmNTdkNmVjOTEzNDdmNWIxOGVhOWIzODVkM2JlNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973","sha":"7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973"}],"sha":"e3f9bc13e4f57d6ec91347f5b18ea9b385d3be6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/e3f9bc13e4f57d6ec91347f5b18ea9b385d3be6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T22:33:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T22:33:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(TME, puzzles, i18n, tests): add E1 puzzles (wires, pipes, latch), medal logic, and E2E coverage**\n\n- **E1 Puzzles Integration:**\n  - Added Wires and Pipes puzzles for Episode 1 Gear scene (`E1_GEAR`):\n    - Wires: Connect terminals without crossings.\n    - Pipes: Rotate tiles and open valve to connect source and sink.\n    - Added localized hints and error messages for both puzzles.\n  - Introduced new latch mechanism:\n    - Requires `long-press → drag` gesture over a scuffed hotspot to reveal latch.\n    - Includes an accessible DOM fallback for keyboard and reduced-motion users.\n  - Award medals (gold/silver/bronze) based on puzzle solves with hints used:\n    - Automatically determined once a gate is solved and the latch is revealed.\n\n- **State Persistence:**\n  - Updated `ToymakerEscapeGame.tsx` save/load logic to support new puzzles:\n    - Added save state for flags, wires, pipes, and latch progress using `versionedSave`.\n    - Persisted medal awards in `tme:save:v1`.\n\n- **UI Enhancements:**\n  - Localized strings for new puzzles and E1 scenes in EN/FR:\n    - Expanded `i18n/toymaker-escape` with wires, pipes, latch prompts, and medal labels.\n    - Readable error messages for invalid configurations (e.g., crossings in wires, leaks in pipes).\n  - Added minimalist canvas to visually and interactively manage the latch scuff hotspot.\n\n- **Testing:**\n  - Unit tests for Wires, Pipes, Gears, and scene progression logic.\n  - Playwright E2E test (`tests-e2e/tme-e1-golden.spec.ts`):\n    - Smoke-tested the “golden path” (solving puzzles and revealing latch).\n    - Validated medal awarding and i18n localization for both EN and FR.\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `README.md` and `scene-puzzles.md`:\n    - Added example usage for Wires, Pipes, and Gears puzzles.\n    - Documented medal logic and E1’s “golden path” workflow.\n  - Introduced macro specs for the latch scuff hotspot interaction:\n    - Defined logical bounds, input gestures, and fallback accessibility options.\n\nThese changes introduce challenging yet accessible E1 puzzles, ensure state persistence across gameplay, and enrich Toymaker Escape with medal logic and i18n support.","tree":{"sha":"e83bb62959c8d00ef54c7705f5df80c70e25e43d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/e83bb62959c8d00ef54c7705f5df80c70e25e43d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDdhYzUwNDBkNTg5MDM5M2Y4YzIyNTlkZmNmYTg5OTM0YWYyZDc5NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f","sha":"7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f"}],"sha":"7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7ac5040d5890393f8c2259dfcfa89934af2d7973"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T21:26:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T21:26:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(shared, puzzles, tests): add pipes/flow puzzle with tests and README example**\n\n- **Pipes/Flow Puzzle Implementation:**\n  - Added `pipes.ts`:\n    - Introduced logic-based pipes/flow puzzle with the following mechanics:\n      - Tiles: `straight`, `elbow`, `tee`, `cross`, `endcap`, `valve` (open/closed).\n      - Solved when all sinks are connected to a source with no leaks or open paths, and all valves on paths are open.\n      - Supports customizable grid size with `sources` and `sinks` configurable on tiles.\n    - Core APIs:\n      - `createPipesState`: Initializes a puzzle state.\n      - `setTileRotation`: Rotates tiles to achieve desired connections.\n      - `toggleValve`: Opens/closes valves to control flow.\n      - `evaluatePipes`: Validates the puzzle''s solved state.\n  - Included utility functions:\n    - `inBounds`, `indexOf`, directional helpers (`rotateDir`, `neighbor`, `sidesFor`).\n\n- **Testing:**\n  - Added `pipes.test.ts`:\n    - Comprehensive suite to validate:\n      - Simple straight-line source→sink connections.\n      - Valve behavior (solved/unsolved states based on open/closed gates).\n      - Detection of leaks (tiles with open connections to empty/outside grids).\n      - Puzzle manipulation via tile rotations to achieve a solved state.\n    - Edge case coverage:\n      - Incorrect initial setups with leaks or unconnected sinks.\n      - Dynamic state transitions through valve toggling and tile rotations.\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `README.md`:\n    - Added example demonstrating pipes/flow puzzle usage.\n    - Included import example and step-by-step flow of toggling valves to solve a simple grid.\n\n- **Exports Update:**\n  - Updated `libs/shared/src/index.ts` to export `pipes` puzzle APIs for reuse:\n    - `pointclick/puzzles/pipes`.\n\nThese changes introduce a new logic puzzle, complete with reusable APIs, unit tests, and documentation for usage in games and applications.","tree":{"sha":"d1b5081a640be5117e146cae56f23296d5c19fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/d1b5081a640be5117e146cae56f23296d5c19fe8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDdkMjgxNmRkMTQ2MTdmZTVjYzlmOGEyNGEyZmFiZTAxYTRkMWI4MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45","sha":"3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45"}],"sha":"7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7d2816dd14617fe5cc9f8a24a2fabe01a4d1b82f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T20:55:11Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T20:55:11Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(i18n, header, tests): add language toggle in header with EN/FR persistence and E2E tests**\n\n- **Language Toggle Implementation:**\n  - Added `LanguageToggle` component:\n    - EN/FR toggle with accessible design, including ARIA roles and labels.\n    - Persists language selection in `localStorage` using `lib/i18n`.\n    - Triggers a soft refresh via `router.refresh()` to update localized components.\n  - Integrated the language toggle into:\n    - `Header`: Available in the main site header.\n    - `GameHeader`: Added for in-game accessibility.\n\n- **Initializer and Persistence:**\n  - Introduced `I18nInitializer`:\n    - Ensures language is applied on initial load to minimize flicker.\n    - Initialized in `app/layout.tsx` for seamless integration.\n\n- **Testing:**\n  - Added a Playwright E2E test (`tests-e2e/i18n-lang-toggle.spec.ts`):\n    - Validated language switching between EN and FR on the Toymaker Escape page.\n    - Confirmed `localStorage` persistence across sessions.\n  - Updated `tsconfig.json`:\n    - Excluded `.md` files for better tooling consistency.\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `README.md`:\n    - Provided usage details for the language toggle, its structure, and persistence mechanism.\n    - Included configuration and testing process for the toggle functionality.\n\n- **Action Plan Updates:**\n  - Marked implementation of header language toggle, in-game toggle, and associated tests as completed.\n\nThis commit brings consistent, accessible EN/FR language switching across the application, enhances user experience with persistence, and ensures reliability through robust E2E testing.","tree":{"sha":"47797992a114a03454b589b430e78e3fa37c0fe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/47797992a114a03454b589b430e78e3fa37c0fe6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDNhYWFkZDc2YzUwYzI5Y2Y0NzdlOWZhYjZkZDNmNDViYmZiZTRmNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b","sha":"161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b"}],"sha":"3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/3aaadd76c50c29cf477e9fab6dd3f45bbfbe4f45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T20:20:33Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T20:20:33Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(i18n, TME): add EN/FR localization for Toymaker Escape and integrate i18n helper library**\n\n- **Localization (i18n):**\n  - Added support for English (EN) and French (FR) localization in Toymaker Escape:\n    - Created localized string bundles: `i18n/toymaker-escape/en.json` and `i18n/toymaker-escape/fr.json`.\n    - Included Episode 1 scene strings for titles, hints, keypad, and gears puzzle instructions under the `tme` namespace.\n\n- **i18n Library Implementation:**\n  - Introduced a lightweight, title-based i18n helper:\n    - Functions:\n      - `initI18n`: Initialize language from `localStorage` or `navigator.language`.\n      - `setLocale`: Change and persist language at runtime.\n      - `t`: Fetch localized strings by key, with fallback to the key itself.\n    - Supports flat JSON schema for clean scalability across game titles.\n  - Added tests for i18n features:\n    - Validated language switching, default behavior, and key fallback.\n\n- **Toymaker Escape Integration:**\n  - Refactored `ToymakerEscapeGame.tsx` to use the `t()` function for all text:\n    - Replaced hardcoded strings with localizable keys for keypad hints, labels (e.g., \"Clear,\" \"Submit\"), and gears puzzle instructions.\n    - Ensured fallback strings are consistent for missing keys.\n  - Updated keypad hints to reference decor-based clues (e.g., toy shelf orders) instead of inline text.\n\n- **Documentation Updates:**\n  - Expanded `README.md`:\n    - Described usage and structure of the i18n helper.\n    - Provided localization workflow and examples for adding new localized content.\n    - Outlined asset structure under `i18n/<title>` for flat JSON namespaces (e.g., `tme.*`).\n  - Added insight into environmental and accessible puzzle design in `docs/narrative/scene-puzzles.md`.\n\n- **Testing and Accessibility:**\n  - Added `tests/i18n.test.ts` to validate localization behavior for string lookup and switching between EN and FR.\n  - Retained accessibility by ensuring alt text and captions describe the same clues present visually.\n  - Maintained ARIA-compliant roles for all interactive elements using localized labels.\n\nThese changes introduce full EN/FR localization in Toymaker Escape, streamline string management with a reusable i18n helper, and enhance the narrative design with decor-based clues.","tree":{"sha":"af7ae1b956b90d444031f39cf5fc3bcef16db3a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/af7ae1b956b90d444031f39cf5fc3bcef16db3a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDE2MWM3NjBiZDhkMzE0NDc5MjNmNjUzZGNlMDQ5YzYxZTEzZTVmMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06","sha":"72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06"}],"sha":"161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/161c760bd8d31447923f653dce049c61e13e5f1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T12:53:02Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T12:53:02Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(shared, tests): refactor puzzle APIs, add Scene Services, and introduce extensive unit tests**\n\n- **Refactor Puzzle APIs:**\n  - Updated naming conventions in the Wires and Gears puzzles for clarity:\n    - Renamed:\n      - `setConnection` → `setWiresConnection`\n      - `clearConnections` → `clearWiresConnections`\n      - `hasCrossing` → `hasWiresCrossing`\n      - `setTeeth` → `setGearsTeeth`\n    - Adjusted imports and integrated new names across all related tests and components for consistency.\n\n- **Scene Services Implementation:**\n  - Added `SceneServices` suite with:\n    - **TimerService**: Supports pausable timeouts and intervals tied to scene lifecycle with a single animation loop.\n    - **CutsceneRunner**: Manages sequential cutscene steps with support for event-based and time-based waits.\n    - **Blackboard**: Simple typed key-value storage for per-scene puzzle states.\n  - Integrated comprehensive unit tests covering:\n    - `TimerService`: Timeout firing, pause/resume functionality, and interval cancellations.\n    - `CutsceneRunner`: Execution of steps with waiting on timers/events and cancellation behavior.\n    - `Blackboard`: Basic `get`, `set`, and `update` operations for key-value pairs.\n\n- **Additional Puzzle Primitives:**\n  - Created reusable gears puzzle logic:\n    - Added `createGearsState`, `evaluateGears`, and `setGearsTeeth` APIs for solving ratio-based gear puzzles with idler gears.\n    - Developed utility functions for connection management and graph traversal.\n    - Included unit tests for solving simple gear ratios and breaking solutions with invalid setups.\n  - Expanded tests for Wires puzzle:\n    - Enhanced test coverage for connection ordering, crossing detection, and solution evaluation.\n\n- **Persistence Utilities:**\n  - Introduced `Persistence` module:\n    - `versionedSave` and `versionedLoad` functions for handling versioned localStorage payloads.\n    - `loadWithMigrations` for forward-compatible data migrations.\n    - Added tests for save/load functionality under migration scenarios and edge cases (e.g., corrupted data).\n\n- **Shared Library Enhancements:**\n  - Expanded exports to include `SceneServices` modules, Gears logic, and Persistence helpers.\n  - Updated TypeScript typing and stricter API definitions to ensure robust development interfaces.\n\n- **New Unit Test Suites:**\n  - Added unit tests for Gears, Persistence, InputSequenceDetector integration, and SceneServices under `/tests`:\n    - Validated system reliability and ensured handling of edge cases in all implemented features.\n\nThese changes introduce new systems for scene management, refactor puzzle APIs for clarity, and reinforce code reliability with extensive testing.","tree":{"sha":"6f4732c6fcdd4b451228ca4ba1b689f2cadaa69f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/6f4732c6fcdd4b451228ca4ba1b689f2cadaa69f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDcyYmQyZjNmNmI5ZDMwZDFkYzdmY2M2YTUxY2IzMWY1OWJlZTZjMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab","sha":"45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab"}],"sha":"72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/72bd2f3f6b9d30d1dc7fcc6a51cb31f59bee6c06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T12:37:23Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T12:37:23Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(pointclick, puzzles): add sequence and wires puzzles with tests, enhance TME with new scenes**\n\n- **New Puzzle Primitives:**\n  - **Sequence Puzzle:**\n    - Implemented Simon-style sequence puzzle with pure logic in `libs/shared/src/pointclick/puzzles/sequence.ts`.\n    - Added mechanics for tracking target sequence, user input, and solving or failing based on lives.\n    - Included unit tests to validate proper progression, life reduction on error, reset behavior, and edge cases.\n  - **Wires Puzzle:**\n    - Created wires/connectors puzzle in `libs/shared/src/pointclick/puzzles/wires.ts`:\n      - Logic for setting/removing wires, checking goals, detecting crossing connections, and solved state evaluation.\n    - Comprehensive test coverage to verify connection handling, state resets, and crossing detection.\n\n- **Tests:**\n  - Added unit tests for both puzzles under `/tests`:\n    - Validated sequence puzzle flow (matching, failing, resetting).\n    - Verified wires logic (goal satisfaction, crossing prevention).\n\n- **TME Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `ToymakerEscapeGame.tsx` to integrate new puzzles:\n    - Connected keypad and gears mini-games with inventory rewards and scene transitions.\n    - Introduced wires/connectors puzzle in Episode 1 Gear scene (`E1_GEAR`) with mobile-friendly UI and solutions tracking.\n    - Added a secondary sequence puzzle for additional interactive gameplay using the new sequence logic.\n  - Improved accessibility of interactive elements with ARIA-compliant roles, labels, and minimum touch sizes (≥44px).\n\n- **Shared Library Updates:**\n  - Expanded exports in `@games/shared` to include sequence and wires puzzles for reuse across games.\n  - Extended `InputSequenceDetector` to handle gesture-based puzzle input in scene interactions.\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `README.md` with examples and usage of sequence and wires puzzles:\n    - Added wiring puzzle logic explanation and use-case demonstration.\n    - Documented sequence puzzle state and API for developers.\n\nThese updates introduce reusable sequence and wires puzzles, enhance TME gameplay with new scenes and logic, and provide robust testing coverage for puzzle mechanics.","tree":{"sha":"18a082f5da075ff5500ca5d7b2725dc019536cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/18a082f5da075ff5500ca5d7b2725dc019536cd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDQ1ZjhjNGE4ODU5ZTA0ZDBlMDhhYjEzN2IzOTM0NTE2NmI3MjM5YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3","sha":"b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3"}],"sha":"45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/45f8c4a8859e04d0e08ab137b39345166b7239ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T11:44:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T11:44:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(shared): add reusable point-and-click components, context enhancements, and keypad puzzle**\n\n- **Point-and-Click React Components:**\n  - Introduced `InventoryBar` component:\n    - Displays inventory as buttons, with ARIA toolbar role and accessibility enhancements.\n    - Allows configurable `onUse` handlers triggered by user actions.\n  - Added `DialogueBox` component:\n    - Presents scene-based titles, body text, and multiple choice options with multilingual support.\n    - Ensures dialog accessibility with ARIA-compliant roles and labels.\n\n- **Engine Context and Effects:**\n  - Extended core runtime context (`EngineCtx`) to manage flags, inventory, and variables:\n    - Added helper functions to normalize context (`ensureCtx`) and handle persistence.\n    - Introduced new guard and effect functions:\n      - **Effects**: `setFlag`, `addItem`, `removeItem`, `setVar`.\n      - **Guards**: `hasFlag`, `hasItem`, `varEquals`.\n    - Updated save/load logic to support context migration and versioning.\n  - Improved scene progression to ensure context consistency and guard validation.\n\n- **Keypad Puzzle Implementation:**\n  - Developed `keypad.ts` puzzle library:\n    - Supports configurable numeric code, max length, and leading-zero rules.\n    - Added functions to handle input (`pressKey`), clear state (`clearKeypad`), and validate submissions (`submitKeypad`).\n  - Integrated comprehensive unit tests for keypad functionality:\n    - Validates solving logic, input constraints, and edge cases (e.g., rolling buffer, wrong attempts).\n\n- **Testing Enhancements:**\n  - Added `vitest` unit tests for `keypad` mechanics:\n    - Verified behavior for digit entry, submission, clearing, and input rules.\n    - Tested code-solving with leading-zero restrictions and max-length behavior.\n\nThese changes add foundational reusable UI components, enhance engine context management, and introduce a fully functional keypad puzzle with robust test coverage.","tree":{"sha":"d1e9977c2e6fbb5aa51d8e8b29a0fe9616cd2839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/d1e9977c2e6fbb5aa51d8e8b29a0fe9616cd2839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGI4NjNiNWJkODg0MjAxOGJjMTlhYzFmMWNkMzAzMTVjMjU5YTg1YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba","sha":"94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba"}],"sha":"b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b863b5bd8842018bc19ac1f1cd30315c259a85b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T11:31:43Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T11:31:43Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(shared): add core point-and-click components and systems integration**\n\n- **Core Engine Implementation:**\n  - Introduced `GameEngine` class in shared point-and-click library:\n    - Core systems include `StateManager`, `SceneManager`, `AssetManager`, `AnimationManager`, `InputManager`, and `EventSystem`.\n    - Configurable initialization with game settings, canvas handling, and pixel ratio adaptation.\n    - Added game loop with `update` and `render` lifecycles, supporting debug info and canvas resizing.\n\n- **Subsystem Additions:**\n  - `StateManager`: Centralized state management with undo history, persistence, and event-driven reactivity.\n  - `SceneManager`: Handles scene registration and switching with support for history tracking and transitions.\n  - `AnimationManager`: Manages animations with frame progression, play/pause/stop controls, and events.\n  - `InputManager`: Unified input handling for keyboard, mouse, and touch with gesture detection (e.g., long press, swipes, double-tap).\n\n- **Plugins and Extendability:**\n  - Added plugin manager to enable dynamic feature injection into the engine:\n    - Registered core plugins for dialogue, achievements, and inventory systems with extensible APIs for custom plugins.\n  - `AchievementPlugin`: Introduced achievement tracking and state persistence via `localStorage`.\n\n- **Game Object Framework:**\n  - Defined reusable `GameObject` base class for interactive game entities with configurable position, size, visibility, and pointer events.\n\n- **Features for Detection and Input:**\n  - `InputSequenceDetector`: Modular input sequence matching for gesture-based gameplay and custom interactions.\n\nThese updates establish the foundation for a flexible point-and-click engine with modular subsystems, extensible plugin support, and input-driven gameplay mechanics.","tree":{"sha":"5b2535a7d31965884d911c6b5643370614eec9fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/5b2535a7d31965884d911c6b5643370614eec9fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDk0MjIxZjU0NmNhOTEyM2NjZjI5OWU3ZTAxODFiMTdlNjkxNTcwYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002","sha":"8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002"}],"sha":"94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/94221f546ca9123ccf299e7e0181b17e691570ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T10:13:09Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T10:13:09Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(TME, ROD, shared): implement shared point-and-click engine, integrate game scenes, and add tests**\n\n- **Shared Point-and-Click Engine:**\n  - Added reusable `pointclick/engine` in `@games/shared`:\n    - Scene and choice graph implementation with context/state management.\n    - Save/load utilities via `localStorage` with versioning (e.g., `tme:save:v1`, `rod:save:v1`).\n    - Multi-language setup with automatic language detection (`en`, `fr`).\n\n- **New Game Implementations:**\n  - **Toymaker Escape**:\n    - Introduced `ToymakerEscapeGame` with Intro → E1 scenes:\n      - Gear alignment puzzle placeholder for Episode 1.\n      - Medal logic and replayable wrap-up scene.\n    - Persisted game state and transitions (scene+context).\n    - Included accessible UI (ARIA roles, focus management, touch targets).\n  - **Rite of Discovery**:\n    - Developed `RiteOfDiscoveryGame` with Intro → C1 scenes:\n      - Placeholder narrative branching setup with contextual outcomes.\n      - Replayable wrap-up with clean state handling.\n\n- **Testing Integration:**\n  - Added unit tests for scene graph progression:\n    - Validated `nextScene` transitions with and without guards.\n  - Created Playwright E2E smoke tests for both games:\n    - Verified Intro → main scene → Wrap paths for TME and ROD.\n\n- **Shared Library Updates:**\n  - Exported new `pointclick/engine` utilities from `@games/shared` for reuse across games.\n  - Updated `libs/shared` index to include localization scaffolding and point-and-click primitives.\n\n- **Action Plan Progress:**\n  - Marked foundational shared engine, localization, and initial scenes/accompanying tests as complete for TME and ROD.\n\nThis commit introduces a scalable narrative engine, implements core scenes for two games, ensures replayability, and improves testing coverage.","tree":{"sha":"f2ed33ead03a6f439f5cab72d6563e534f298aeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/f2ed33ead03a6f439f5cab72d6563e534f298aeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDhhYmZjYWFmMDc4YmZiOTk0MDdlZjIxNDA0MTMzOGJmNGExOTMwMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab","sha":"447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab"}],"sha":"8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/8abfcaaf078bfb99407ef214041338bf4a193002"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T08:00:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T08:00:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games, accessibility): enhance controls, settings, and accessibility in supported games**\n\n- **Game Controls Update:**\n  - Improved input options for **Snake** and **Breakout**:\n    - **Snake**: Added swipe, joystick, and tap modes (default on touch); prevented page scrolling during touch interactions.\n    - **Breakout**: Introduced optional mouse control (desktop) via toggle, persisting preferences locally.\n\n- **Settings Panel Implementation:**\n  - Created a customizable settings panel with local-only preferences:\n    - Added toggles for Music, Sound Effects, Default Particles, and Reduced Motion.\n    - Stored preferences in `localStorage` for consistent behavior across sessions.\n\n- **Accessibility Enhancements:**\n  - Introduced WCAG-compliant touch targets (≥44×44px) and contrast adjustments in overlays and HUD elements.\n  - Reduced motion toggle minimizes non-essential animations across games.\n\n- **Developer Tools Adjustment:**\n  - Reserved \"Start New Game\" and clear-data buttons for point-and-click games:\n    - Removed them from action games like **Snake**, **Breakout**, and **Memory**, which already have reset/restart UI.\n\n- **Feature Flags & Launcher Behavior:**\n  - Enabled toggling of upcoming playable cards in development with `NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_UPCOMING_PLAY_LOCAL`.\n  - Updated admin seam to allow runtime toggles for non-production environments, persisting in `gh:flags:v1`.\n\n- **Tests and Documentation:**\n  - Added E2E tests for **Breakout** particle toggles and **Memory** animations with spin+fade placeholder logic.\n  - Documented changes in README with updated control modes and settings descriptions.\n\nThese changes improve player experience through enhanced control options and settings, while ensuring accessibility and consistent device-specific behavior.","tree":{"sha":"c18121c1f4c37c1765c74341f6e4b2a583c5046f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/c18121c1f4c37c1765c74341f6e4b2a583c5046f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDQ0N2U0MjI3ZTYyOWEyZWYxODFmYjdhNDc5OTllNjg5MTNkYmNjYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5","sha":"717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5"}],"sha":"447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/447e4227e629a2ef181fb7a47999e68913dbccab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T04:42:46Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T04:42:46Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(sysdisc): implement BOD packs launch, deep-link support, and enhanced accessibility**\n\n- **Feature Implementation:**\n  - Introduced frontend flag-driven exposure for Body Systems (BOD) sub-packs in the `/games` catalog:\n    - Dynamically rendered “Systems Discovery — Body Systems” card based on `localStorage` flags.\n    - Added deep-linking support to start directly at specific sub-pack intros via query parameters (e.g., `/games/systems-discovery?pack=breath`).\n  - Extended `FlagsContext` to manage and persist flag configurations (`gh:flags:v1`) with defaults for the BOD packs.\n\n- **Accessibility Enhancements:**\n  - Updated Homeostasis Meter:\n    - Added ARIA `role=\"meter\"` with `aria-valuemin/max/now` and accessible labels.\n    - Ensured diagrams include descriptive `alt` text and labeled patterns, reducing reliance on color.\n  - Grouped related controls with `role=\"group\"` and improved screen reader compatibility for interactive elements.\n\n- **Refinements:**\n  - Removed temporary BOD entry links from the Core WRAP for a cleaner interface.\n  - Clamped meter values in BOD scenes (45–65) to ensure steady accessibility feedback.\n\n- **Testing:**\n  - Updated Playwright E2E tests for all BOD sub-packs (Breath, Fuel, Move, Signal, Grow):\n    - Verified deep-link navigation and meter range consistency across scenes.\n  - Added unit tests to validate persistence of BOD-specific flags (`bod.meter=60`, `bod.toggles.deeper=false`) in `localStorage`.\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `systems-discovery-design.md` with launcher functionality, deep-linking, and accessibility considerations.\n  - Synced `action-plan.md` with completed tasks for flag-driven BOD exposure and accessibility updates.\n\nThese changes introduce scalable and accessible Body Systems sub-pack launches, streamlining navigation and gameplay mechanics while ensuring inclusivity and user-friendly interactions.","tree":{"sha":"188f64003feab3408695099de0823ea27cb2a251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/188f64003feab3408695099de0823ea27cb2a251"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDcxN2IzN2U2NTIyY2Q5YmRmZGQ1MWNkNTkwMTk1YTA3YTU4YTQ3YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3","sha":"733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3"}],"sha":"717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/717b37e6522cd9bdfdd51cd590195a07a58a47c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T03:31:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T03:31:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(sysdisc): add Homeostasis Meter, BOD scaffolds, and tests**\n\n- **Features:**\n  - Implemented `HomeostasisMeter` React component:\n    - Supports ARIA attributes, reduced motion, and clamped value rendering with colorblind-safe patterns.\n    - Default size (`md`), with customizable small (`sm`) and large (`lg`) sizes.\n\n- **BOD Scaffolds:**\n  - Added scaffolds for five Body Systems (BOD) sub-packs (Breath, Fuel, Move, Signal, Grow):\n    - Included intro, three scenes (e.g., BB1–BB3), and wrap segments for each sub-pack.\n    - Integrated `HomeostasisMeter` in scenes to visualize balance and reinforce gameplay mechanics.\n    - Created accessible navigation with skippable intros and replayable outros.\n\n- **Localization:**\n  - Updated `en.json` with strings for all BOD sub-packs, intros, and Homeostasis Meter.\n\n- **Tests:**\n  - Added `vitest` component tests for `HomeostasisMeter`:\n    - Validated ARIA attributes, clamping, and state announcements.\n  - Authored Playwright E2E tests for one sub-pack across all paths:\n    - Successfully tested Breath (BB1→BB3 + Wrap) with meter progression and badges displayed.\n\n- **UI/UX Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `systems-discovery/src/index.tsx` with temporary links for easy testing of BOD sub-packs:\n    - Links (e.g., \"Try Body Systems (Breath)\") redirect dynamically to respective scaffolds.\n  - Improved accessible cues with screen-reader announcements (e.g., \"Steady,\" \"High\").\n\n- **Action Plan Sync:**\n  - Marked the development of `Homeostasis Meter`, BOD scaffolds, and Playwright smoke tests complete in `action-plan.md`.\n\nThese updates introduce the foundational structure for Body Systems, enrich gameplay mechanics with visual feedback, and ensure accessibility across all experiences.","tree":{"sha":"f60fdf215d00222db03f54f2eb51d89e882a5d2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/f60fdf215d00222db03f54f2eb51d89e882a5d2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDczM2FjMTI1ZWU2NDlmNTdiNDNkNzBlZjFhOTYyMDY5YmQ5NGM3YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/f5d2b5f287f1c1b2d4a0d1f8f783cb73fa58db3a","sha":"f5d2b5f287f1c1b2d4a0d1f8f783cb73fa58db3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/f5d2b5f287f1c1b2d4a0d1f8f783cb73fa58db3a"}],"sha":"733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/733ac125ee649f57b43d70ef1a962069bd94c7b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/f5d2b5f287f1c1b2d4a0d1f8f783cb73fa58db3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T02:38:46Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T02:38:46Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(docs): add Flow & Narrative Sequencing for Systems Discovery, Rite of Discovery, and Toymaker Escape**\n\n- **Flow & Narrative Documentation:**\n  - Added detailed \"Flow & Narrative Sequencing\" sections across design and story documentation:\n    - **Systems Discovery:** Documented Core progression (SD_INTRO → B1 → B2 → B3 → WRAP → SD_OUTRO) and extensions (Space, Ocean, Body Systems packs).\n    - **Rite of Discovery:** Detailed first-run flow (ROD_INTRO → S1 → S2 → S3 → Epilogue → ROD_OUTRO) with branching replay hooks.\n    - **Toymaker Escape:** Structured first episode (TME_INTRO → E1A Workshop → E1B Playroom Sorter → TME_OUTRO) and outlined recurring beats for future episodes.\n\n- **Intro/Outro Extensions:**\n  - Defined intro (e.g., SD_OCEAN_INTRO, TME_INTRO) and outro (SD_OCEAN_OUTRO, TME_OUTRO) structure:\n    - Set accessible design guardrails with reduced-motion, skippable paths, and replay-friendly options.\n    - Clarified flag management for intros/outros using `seen` flags (e.g., `flags.ocean.intro.seen`, `flags.space.outro.seen`).\n\n- **Narrative Enhancements:**\n  - Integrated story concepts for seamless player onboarding and replayability:\n    - Systems Discovery: Highlighted thematic framing like home loops, thematic badge rewards, and calm curiosity.\n    - Rite of Discovery: Refined tone for interactive familial traditions to inspire kindness and discovery.\n    - Toymaker Escape: Emphasized playful environments with puzzling accessible mechanics.\n\n- **Action Plan Sync:**\n  - Marked documentation updates as completed for flow design in `action-plan.md`, aligning with narrative objectives for replay and accessibility.\n\nThese updates establish a cohesive narrative flow across all three games, documenting player progression and ensuring future scalability with accessible, replayable, and thematic elements.","tree":{"sha":"ff256f928f916e8f7262a34dacc3a46ea22f741d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/ff256f928f916e8f7262a34dacc3a46ea22f741d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/f5d2b5f287f1c1b2d4a0d1f8f783cb73fa58db3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"