node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/279f0ae2925486c9fe94297a745adda310059bb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T02:10:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T02:10:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(docs, systems-discovery): document and implement Intro/Outro beats for Core and Extensions**\n\n- **Core Intro/Outro Implementation:**\n  - Added `SD_INTRO` and `SD_OUTRO` scenes:\n    - `SD_INTRO`: Orient players with a welcome message; shown only on the first run.\n    - `SD_OUTRO`: Recaps Core Pack choices, awards the Systems Scout badge, and provides replay options.\n\n- **Extension Intro/Outro Documentation:**\n  - Documented intro/outro beats for Space, Ocean, and Body Systems (BOD) sub-packs:\n    - Intro scenes (e.g., `SD_SPACE_INTRO`, `SD_OCEAN_INTRO`): Introduce thematic framing; marked with individual flags (e.g., `flags.space.intro.seen`).\n    - Outro scenes (e.g., `SD_SPACE_OUTRO`): Recap progress and unlock replay options.\n    - All intros/outros follow accessible, reduced-motion, and skippable design standards.\n\n- **Localization Updates:**\n  - Expanded `en.json`:\n    - Introduced string keys for all intro/outro scenes in Core, Space, Ocean, and BOD packs.\n    - Ensured structured localization under namespaces (e.g., `sysdisc.intro`, `sysdisc.space.intro`).\n\n- **Save System Updates:**\n  - Persisted `intro.seen` and `outro.seen` flags for Core and extensions in `sysdisc:save:v1`.\n\n- **Documentation Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `systems-discovery-design.md` and `systems-discovery-stories.md` to feature intro/outro flag details, audience/tone specifications, and replay hook guidance.\n\nThese updates integrate narrative on-boarding and offboarding for Systems Discovery, building replayability and thematic framing across all packs.","tree":{"sha":"ab6ab94e59452767ea7182539da35349338b47db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/ab6ab94e59452767ea7182539da35349338b47db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/279f0ae2925486c9fe94297a745adda310059bb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/279f0ae2925486c9fe94297a745adda310059bb5","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDI3OWYwYWUyOTI1NDg2YzlmZTk0Mjk3YTc0NWFkZGEzMTAwNTliYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/b762922bf41f802294fed4f0f511cb5033ebc50a","sha":"b762922bf41f802294fed4f0f511cb5033ebc50a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b762922bf41f802294fed4f0f511cb5033ebc50a"}],"sha":"279f0ae2925486c9fe94297a745adda310059bb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/279f0ae2925486c9fe94297a745adda310059bb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b762922bf41f802294fed4f0f511cb5033ebc50a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T01:19:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T01:19:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games, assets, i18n): complete i18n, accessibility, and asset updates for Rite of Discovery and Toymaker Escape**\n\n- **Gameplay Enhancements:**\n  - Added new scenes to \"Rite of Discovery\":\n    - Introduced Intro (ROD_INTRO) and Epilogue (ROD_OUTRO) with branching replay options and item recap.\n    - Updated all scenes to use interactive placeholder images (`/assets/rod`) for background and props.\n  - Expanded \"Toymaker Escape\" with new Intro scene (TME_INTRO) and finalized E1 puzzles:\n    - Added gear alignment and music box mini-games.\n    - Updated Playroom with background (`/assets/tme/playroom_bg.svg`) and key fragment art.\n\n- **Assets Updates:**\n  - Added colorblind-friendly, SVG-based placeholders for game assets:\n    - Backgrounds for Toymaker Escape (Workshop, Playroom) and Rite of Discovery.\n    - Props for Toymaker Escape (Table, Lamp) and Rite of Discovery.\n  - Integrated accessible alt text, aria-labels, and titles in all SVGs for screen reader compatibility.\n\n- **Localization and Strings:**\n  - Replaced string literals with i18n helper (lib/i18n.ts) for both games:\n    - Added `en.json` dictionary with all game strings extracted for localization.\n    - Updated all scenes in Rite of Discovery and Toymaker Escape with dynamic string lookups using `t()`.\n  - Enabled flexible language support for future i18n implementations.\n\n- **Accessibility Improvements:**\n  - Ensured Gentle Mode toggles are integrated and consistent with UI hints and mechanics.\n  - Verified all interactive components adhere to focus visibility, reduced motion, and minimum size targets.\n\n- **Save System and UI Adjustments:**\n  - Updated save initial states for both games to include intros and proper progression logic:\n    - Rite of Discovery now starts at ROD_INTRO with replayable Outro.\n    - Toymaker Escape starts at TME_INTRO with inventory and medals support.\n\nThese updates improve accessibility, introduce localization support, and add new assets for a richer gameplay experience.","tree":{"sha":"aff13c828c0a202e4a32388c2cc375d5570c757d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/aff13c828c0a202e4a32388c2cc375d5570c757d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/b762922bf41f802294fed4f0f511cb5033ebc50a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"ver