red{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0a98b8d1484f991df9f56e61da750e6279d0b368/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T14:36:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T14:36:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(config, contexts): add ''@games/_engine'' alias and enable client rendering for React contexts**\n\n- **Configuration Updates:**\n  - Added `@games/_engine` to `next.config.ts` and `tsconfig.json`:\n    - Configured path aliases for `games/_engine` to streamline package imports.\n    - Updated module resolution for consistent and maintainable imports across the project.\n\n- **Client Rendering:**\n  - Enabled `\"use client\"` directive in key React contexts:\n    - `GameSettingsContext.tsx` and `SoundContext.tsx`:\n      - Ensured compatibility with React''s client-side rendering requirements.\n      - Resolved potential hydration issues for shared libraries in Next.js runtime.\n  - Applied the `\"use client\"` directive to game-specific components:\n    - `SnakeGame.tsx` and `MemoryGame.tsx`:\n      - Prepared for seamless client-side interactions and state management.\n\nThese changes improve module organization, reinforce client-side compatibility, and enhance overall rendering behavior for shared and game-specific components.","tree":{"sha":"de13e8f9ae771daf8d143554e0d8ddbf64bd36e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/de13e8f9ae771daf8d143554e0d8ddbf64bd36e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/0a98b8d1484f991df9f56e61da750e6279d0b368","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https:/