.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/f05dd560aacb87ced35e17a6b6c2f118b961674a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T14:26:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T14:26:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(testing, config): add localStorage mocks and new alias for engine package**\n\n- **Testing Enhancements:**\n  - Introduced `LocalStorageMock` to mock `localStorage` in tests:\n    - Defined `clear`, `getItem`, `setItem`, `removeItem`, and `key` methods with internal state tracking.\n    - Replaced window `localStorage` with this mock using `beforeAll`.\n  - Improved `matchMedia` mock setup:\n    - Moved initialization to `beforeAll` for consistency.\n    - Adjusted mocked `dispatchEvent` to return `true`.\n  - Added global mocks for `matchMedia` and `localStorage`, ensuring reliable cross-test behavior.\n\n- **Configuration Updates:**\n  - Updated `vitest.config.ts` with a new alias for the `@games/_engine` package pointing to `games/_engine` directory.\n  - Ensured consistent paths for package imports across projects.\n\nThese updates improve test reliability through comprehensive mocks while enhancing module resolution for cleaner, more maintainable code.","tree":{"sha":"3aa2052ed80c52e7df3d72caf343cb1ddaa62a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/3aa2052ed80c52e7df3d72caf343cb1ddaa62a87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/f05dd560aacb87ced35e17a6b6