l":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/bccd01c5ac91fa6a5d7e688fc7c1368f01596110/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T13:06:34Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T13:06:34Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games): finalize Betas for \"Toymaker Escape\" E1 and \"Systems Discovery\" Core packs**\n\n- **Gameplay Enhancements:**\n  - Fully implemented \"Toymaker Escape\" E1 with Gear Alignment and Playroom Sorter puzzles:\n    - Added interactive mini-games, medal grading (bronze/silver/gold), and Codex seed unlocks.\n    - Enabled replay routes for alternate paths (Gears/Music) and hint toggles.\n  - Completed \"Systems Discovery\" Core with B1 (Loop Puzzle), B2 (Route Planner), and B3 (Waste Sorting):\n    - Added sequential progression, hints toggle, and Systems Scout Badge as completion reward.\n\n- **Accessibility Improvements:**\n  - Ensured visible focus states, 44px targets, and reduced-motion support across interactive elements.\n  - Added UI hints and captions for puzzles with gentle mode toggles for optional guidance.\n\n- **Assets and Strings:**\n  - Integrated minimal placeholder assets:\n    - Backgrounds, badges, and icons for both games (SVG-based colorblind-safe designs).\n  - Extracted in-game strings to `strings.en.ts` under `tmeStrings` and `sysStrings` namespaces for i18n preparation.\n\n- **Save System and UI Updates:**\n  - Added global volume control, persistent state across puzzles, and inventory handling for \"Toymaker Escape.\"\n  - Validated save fields for medal and badge tracking, ensuring reward attribution across playthroughs.\n\n- **Testing and Documentation:**\n  - Authored Playwright E2E tests for full gameplay flows:\n    - Verified all paths for \"Toymaker Escape\" E1 (Gears/Music + Hints).\n    - Tested progression through \"Systems Discovery\" B1→WRAP with route plans and badge unlocks.\n  - Updated `README.md` and `action-plan.md` to reflect Beta milestones and next steps.\n\nThese updates complete the Beta iterations for both games, showcasing polished gameplay, robust accessibility, and replayable routes aligned with educational storytelling principles.","tree":{"sha":"fddbd5f40ba02da2df5e58130c87c081bea62a2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/fddbd5f40ba02da2df5e58130c87c081bea62a2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/bccd01c5ac91fa6a5d7e688fc7c1368f01596110","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/bccd01c5ac91fa6a5d7e688fc7c1368f01596110","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGJjY2QwMWM1YWM5MWZhNmE1ZDdlNjg4ZmM3YzEzNjhmMDE1OTYxMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45","sha":"688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45"}],"sha":"bccd01c5ac91fa6a5d7e688fc7c1368f01596110","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/bccd01c5ac91fa6a5d7e688fc7c1368f01596110"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T12:39:40Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T12:39:40Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(rite-of-discovery): finalize Beta release with accessibility, gameplay, and save system updates**\n\n- **Gameplay Enhancements:**\n  - Fully implemented S1 (Tag Reassembly) and S2 (Note Letter‑Match) puzzles with improved mechanics and accessibility.\n  - Completed S3 (Proof Moment) branching paths (receipt/overhear) and epilogue with Helper Badge unlock and New Game+ teaser.\n\n- **Accessibility Improvements:**\n  - Added global toggle for \"Gentle Mode,\" providing optional hints across all scenes.\n  - Ensured visible focus indicators, 44px targets, and reduced-motion alternatives for interactive components.\n  - Verified high-contrast design for UI elements and captions container for any future SFX.\n\n- **Save System Updates:**\n  - Introduced inventory management (0–3 items) and persistence functions (`addItem`, `removeItem`).\n  - Added a save migration guard, initializing all saves with `v1` to support future schema changes.\n\n- **Testing:**\n  - Added unit tests for gentle mode toggle and save behavior using RTL.\n  - Created end-to-end test flows for both S3 paths (receipt/overhear) with Playwright.\n  - Verified clean save state behavior for localStorage keys (`rod:save:v1`).\n\n- **Content and Localization:**\n  - Extracted all in-game strings to `strings.en.ts`, preparing for future i18n support.\n  - Wired minimal placeholder assets (badge SVG, basic UI visuals).\n\nThese updates complete the Beta for \"Rite of Discovery,\" delivering polished mechanics, accessibility compliance, and robust save/load features.","tree":{"sha":"6694567d771f12f9351bb69ea98f204ad1381e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/6694567d771f12f9351bb69ea98f204ad1381e4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDY4OGM1ZGJlYjc4NmRlZmQ4MTc1Y2NmNWZlMjkxMWM2ZTFlZWVmNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b","sha":"794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b"}],"sha":"688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/688c5dbeb786defd8175ccf5fe2911c6e1eeef45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T11:00:24Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T11:00:24Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games): implement playable MVPs for \"Rite of Discovery\", \"Systems Discovery\", and \"Toymaker Escape\"**\n\n- **Playable MVPs for Point-and-Click Games:**\n  - Implemented minimal playable vertical slices for the following point-and-click games:\n    - **Rite of Discovery:** Includes S1–S3 scenes and Epilogue (Helper Badge with New Game+ preview).\n    - **Systems Discovery:** Features B1–B3 core scenes with wrap screen (Systems Scout Badge stubbed).\n    - **Toymaker Escape:** Introduces E1A–E1B scenarios with episode completion (Codex seed stubbed).\n\n- **Shared Scene Engine:**\n  - Added a **shared point-and-click engine** under `games/_engine`:\n    - **SceneController**: Handles scene transitions, flags, and localStorage persistence.\n    - **ChoiceList**: Provides accessible (keyboard/ARIA) UI for player choices.\n    - **HotspotButton**: Interactive button component with accessible focus states.\n\n- **Game Scaffolding Updates:**\n  - Replaced placeholder components with actual playable scenes for all three games.\n  - Updated `manifest.ts`:\n    - Marked games as \"Enabled\" and updated descriptions to reflect Alpha MVP status.\n  - Integrated save/load functionality for game states (`rod:save:v1`, `sysdisc:save:v1`, `tme:save:v1`).\n\n- **Documentation and README Updates:**\n  - Added instructions for accessing the Alpha MVPs to `README.md`:\n    - Links for local testing of each game.\n    - Notes on visual/interaction stubs and save system behavior.\n  - Updated `action-plan.md` to reflect progress:\n    - Marked core scene controller, key scenes, and badges as complete for MVP.\n\nThese updates deliver functional, narrative-driven alpha slices for three point-and-click games. Future iterations will expand visuals, puzzles, and replayability while maintaining accessibility and educational design principles.","tree":{"sha":"1df3c2a1158843ba2fd9f774f634d7f6d74e4130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/1df3c2a1158843ba2fd9f774f634d7f6d74e4130"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDc5NGY4MjQ0ZmNkNDFjNGNhNTJlNDRiZDcxNGMwODUyOThiYjliM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd","sha":"efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd"}],"sha":"794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/794f8244fcd41c4ca52e44bd714c085298bb9b3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T10:49:52Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T10:49:52Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(docs, games): add Human History and Africa Prehistory trackers and design documentation**\n\n- **Human History Documentation:**\n  - Added `human-history-design.md` and `human-history-stories.md` to document the design and story scenarios for the \"Human History — Many Hands Make History\" game.\n    - Introduced five thematic packs: Origins, Rivers, Trade, Safety, and Modern Social Nets.\n    - Defined detailed structured entries for all scenarios, including goals, hooks, puzzles, choices/flags, and accessibility guardrails.\n    - Outlined a Universal Review Checklist to ensure alignment with accessibility and sensitivity requirements.\n\n  - Created `human-history-designer-brief.md`:\n    - Defined asset delivery standards (file formats, naming conventions, and accessibility requirements).\n    - Detailed workflows for scenario handoffs, reduced-motion stills, alt text, and captions.\n\n  - Updated `action-plan.md` to include tasks for implementing the \"Human History\" MVP:\n    - Build scene interactions for the Origins pack (O1–O3 + wrap).\n    - Complete accessible UI for Community Web meter and scenarios.\n\n- **Africa Prehistory Documentation:**\n  - Added `africa-prehistory-design.md` and `africa-prehistory-stories.md` to establish the structure for the \"Africa Prehistory — Paths of Many\" game.\n    - Introduced five modular packs: Sahara & Sahel Pathways, Forests & Rivers, Rift & Horn, Great Lakes, and Coasts & Crossings.\n    - Documented replayable scenarios for all packs, emphasizing regional diversity and community focus.\n\n  - Created `africa-prehistory-designer-brief.md`:\n    - Established consistent workflows and delivery standards for assets similar to Human History.\n    - Highlighted cultural sensitivity rules, file submission templates, and review requirements.\n\n- **Overall Enhancements:**\n  - Expanded `README.md` to cross-link all new design and story trackers.\n  - Updated `action-plan.md` to track goals for building these games as MVP vertical slices, with Origins and Sahara pack priority.\n  - Aligned documentation and changes with accessible, educational, and culturally respectful design principles.\n\nThese updates lay the groundwork for educational, kindness-driven storytelling in Human History and Africa Prehistory while ensuring accessibility and regional inclusivity.","tree":{"sha":"59304c8b1bc7015c75467eee6164b058d73f345b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/59304c8b1bc7015c75467eee6164b058d73f345b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGVmYzE4MDEyZmMzN2Y3ZWY3MTJhODQwYzg1NTc4M2I2OTBmMGMxYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8","sha":"93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8"}],"sha":"efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/efc18012fc37f7ef712a840c855783b690f0c1bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T10:26:58Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T10:26:58Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(docs, systems): expand Systems Discovery with Body Systems pack and update related assets**\n\n- **New Body Systems Pack:**\n  - Introduced \"Body Systems\" as a new multi-sub-pack extension for Systems Discovery (`systems-discovery-design.md`). Includes:\n    - Five sub-packs: Breath (Respiration & Circulation), Fuel (Digest, Absorb, Excrete), Move (Frame & Motion), Signal & Defend (Sense, Signal, Protect), and Grow (Development & Care).\n    - Integrated Homeostasis Meter gameplay mechanic promoting balance-driven learning with educational, body-positive, and culturally neutral framing.\n    - Sub-pack scenarios include scene-based mini-puzzles, captions, and wrap screens connecting themes across biology concepts.\n\n- **Gameplay and Accessibility Enhancements:**\n  - Added support for \"Deeper Science\" toggles (ages 15+) to surface optional advanced educational content in captions/tooltips.\n  - Expanded data models to accommodate Body Systems:\n    - Save state updated with `bod` entries (e.g., meters, flags, toggles).\n    - Medal tracking with collectible badges per sub-pack.\n    - Accessibility-first visuals (reduced motion, alt text for diagrams, colorblind-safe patterns).\n\n- **Asset Updates:**\n  - Documented per-sub-pack asset templates in `systems-discovery-designer-brief.md`, aligning with existing reusable UI components (e.g., Homeostasis Meter).\n  - Added placeholder references for abstract visuals (e.g., lungs, heart chambers, sensory paths) while adhering to schematic styles and inclusive designs.\n  - Revised file organization under `assets/{core|space|ocean|bod|shared}` with budget parity across packs.\n\n- **Documentation and Development Tasks:**\n  - Updated action plan (`action-plan.md`):\n    - Marked design document expansion and scenario tracker updates as completed.\n    - Added tasks for scaffolding Body Systems sub-pack routes, mechanics integration, and accessibility verification via tests.\n  - Extended `systems-discovery-stories.md` with scene descriptions for all sub-packs, including goals, hooks, beats, and accessibility guardrails.\n\n- **Post-MVP Scenario Additions:**\n  - Drafted concepts for additional Body Systems scenarios (e.g., \"Sleep & Circadian,\" \"Microbiome Buddies,\" \"First Aid Basics\").\n  - Documented hooks for educational extensions aligned with community health themes.\n\nThese updates significantly expand Systems Discovery with a new, fully scaffolded sub-pack, ensuring replayability, educational value, and accessibility alignment.","tree":{"sha":"9af4ed808fe29ace716bafae50dca89fc4a21e74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/9af4ed808fe29ace716bafae50dca89fc4a21e74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDkzOTAwZDIwZTg0NDZlOWE2YzUwOGQ0YTFlMWZhNTJiOTZlNmFhZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6","sha":"154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6"}],"sha":"93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/93900d20e8446e9a6c508d4a1e1fa52b96e6aae8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T10:11:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T10:11:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(docs): expand systems discovery and toymaker escape design documentation**\n\n- **New Design Documentation:**\n  - Added comprehensive design documents for \"Systems Discovery\" (`systems-discovery-design.md`) and \"Toymaker Escape\" (`toymaker-escape-design.md`) under `/docs`. Includes detailed narrative outlines, accessibility guardrails, gameplay systems, and replayability mechanics for both games.\n\n- **Designer/Animator Briefs:**\n  - Introduced bilingual (EN/FR) Designer/Animator Briefs for \"Systems Discovery\" and \"Toymaker Escape\" to standardize visual asset workflows, naming conventions, format guidelines, and moral sensitivity requirements.\n  - Added per-scene asset templates for key scenarios (core, space, ocean for \"Systems Discovery\" and E1–E3 for \"Toymaker Escape\").\n\n- **Stories & Scenarios Trackers:**\n  - Created centralized trackers for story and scenario development:\n    - `systems-discovery-stories.md` documents scenarios, choices, kindness guardrails, and status tracking for the core and extension packs.\n    - `toymaker-escape-stories.md` details story arcs, puzzles, and choice-driven gameplay.\n\n- **Core Gameplay Loop Expansion:**\n  - Defined core puzzle structures for initial scenes:\n    - Systems Discovery: B1 Food Web Loop, B2 Transit Route Planner, B3 Waste Sorting.\n    - Toymaker Escape: E1 Gear Alignment, Music Box, Color Sorter Mini-games.\n  - Added flexibility for replayability with alternate routes, Codex unlocks, and medal systems (bronze/silver/gold grading).\n\n- **Accessibility and Moral Guardrails:**\n  - Integrated reduced motion visuals, contrast-friendly designs, large click targets, and empathetic framing throughout all scenarios.\n  - Emphasized educational stewardship and playful discovery while avoiding fear or guilt-driven narratives.\n\n- **Action Plan Alignment:**\n  - Updated `action-plan.md` with tasks for MVP implementation of Systems Discovery (Core Pack scenes) and Toymaker Escape (E1 vertical slice).\n  - Detailed steps for wiring up save/load support and overlay UI integration for all MVP gameplay flows.\n\nThese updates provide a robust foundation for prototyping Systems Discovery and Toymaker Escape, with structured documentation, narrative cohesion, and accessible design.","tree":{"sha":"1fd4c5d3eb1b87b7b96e2fe4f30641cf8cf0ab4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/1fd4c5d3eb1b87b7b96e2fe4f30641cf8cf0ab4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDE1NGQyODRmZTk2MDQ4ZjZmMjI0MTAxZWQ3YjEwZGFiZjlkYzAwYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/823a8161b3a5f7173b0fe18111ab44e694673a15","sha":"823a8161b3a5f7173b0fe18111ab44e694673a15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/823a8161b3a5f7173b0fe18111ab44e694673a15"}],"sha":"154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/154d284fe96048f6f224101ed7b10dabf9dc00c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/823a8161b3a5f7173b0fe18111ab44e694673a15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-21T09:40:14Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T09:40:14Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games, docs): add scaffolded point-and-click games and update related documentation**\n\n- **New Game Scaffolding:**\n  - Added three prototype scaffolds for upcoming point-and-click games: `Rite of Discovery`, `Systems Discovery`, and `Toymaker Escape`.\n  - Included placeholder components with basic UI for each game under `games/`.\n  - Created corresponding `page.tsx` files under `app/games/` for Next.js dynamic imports.\n\n- **Game Manifest Updates:**\n  - Updated `games/manifest.ts` to include new games as `Upcoming`.\n  - Added metadata, preload assets, and `getComponent` definitions for each game.\n\n- **Documentation Updates:**\n  - Renamed and reorganized design docs for \"Rite of Discovery\":\n    - `rite-of-discovery.md` → `rite-of-discovery-design.md` in a new structured folder.\n    - Adjusted cross-links across all related docs (e.g., Designer Brief, Fiction Tracker).\n  - Added a placeholder design doc for \"Systems Discovery\" under `/docs/systems-discovery`.\n\n- **Next.js Configuration:**\n  - Updated `next.config.ts` to add alias paths for the newly scaffolded games.\n\n- **Asset Enhancements:**\n  - Updated visual assets for existing games (e.g., Chess, Memory, Snake) with more descriptive and visually engaging options.\n\n- **Action Plan Alignment:**\n  - Adjusted references in `action-plan.md` to align with doc restructuring and added tasks for updating scaffolding components.\n\nThese changes establish a foundation for upcoming point-and-click games, streamline documentation structure, and prepare assets for enhanced visual storytelling.","tree":{"sha":"75a40e4f3d8bb98be802cec6f5420b79f8db02cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/75a40e4f3d8bb98be802cec6f5420b79f8db02cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/