a `listGames` function for better manageability.\n  - Consolidated game-related logic into a single source of truth by integrating `lib/games` metadata.\n  - Added support for overlaying custom images via `getGameById`.\n\n- **Theming and Layout Improvements:**\n  - Enhanced dark/light mode background styles with layered gradients and translucency effects.\n  - Adjusted panel and card translucency (`bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-sm`) for better backdrop visibility.\n  - Refined carousel layout to ensure 3 full cards are visible on `XL` viewports without clipping.\n\n- **Testing and Accessibility Enhancements:**\n  - Added Playwright tests for `Featured Projects` validation and carousel behavior.\n  - Verified seamless background rendering with light/dark modes across components.","tree":{"sha":"011c05809da4a1d71fda0ec4c08118f7c2a16a33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/011c05809da4a1d71fda0ec4c08118f7c2a16a33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/e4555967d06b1206ad770fcfd63c1e0f96e67e93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions"