title and improve background consistency**\n\n- **Homepage Title Update:**\n  - Simplified the title from \"JavaScript Games & Interactive Projects\" to \"Fun Games & Projects\" for a more engaging and general tone.\n\n- **Background and Styles Improvements:**\n  - Enhanced `:root`, `html`, and `body` background consistency to mirror `body` styles:\n    - Added background-color from `--background` to the root element.\n    - Set `background-image` and other properties directly on `:root` to ensure full-bleed containers do not obscure the background.\n  - Fine-tuned `background-size`, `background-repeat`, and `background-attachment` for better rendering with full-page layouts.\n\nThese changes improve content focus, maintain a cohesive visual design, and address potential rendering artifacts in edge cases.","tree":{"sha":"3b8731bdd982342d50841fc295dcbf48d1600a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/3b8731bdd982342d50841fc295dcbf48d1600a47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/dc170a69988213d900ba46ed9370e6f89af767fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/dc170a69988213d900ba46ed9370e6f89af767fe","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGRjMTcwYTY5OTg4MjEzZDkwMGJhNDZlZDkzNzBlNmY4OWFmNzY3ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/ff37a081c119aa55d6e660236f967b543f403297","sha":"ff37a081c119aa55d6e660236f967b543f403297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/ff37a081c119aa55d6e660236f967b543f403297"}],"sha":"dc170a69988213d900ba46ed9370e6f89af767fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/dc170a69988213d900ba46ed9370e6f89af767fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/ff37a081c119aa55d6e660236f967b543f403297/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T10:04:35Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T10:04:35Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(theming, backgrounds, tests): overhaul theming system with improved backgrounds and tests**\n\n- **Theming System Enhancements:**\n  - Documented detailed light and dark theme palettes, fully utilizing CSS custom properties.\n  - Added perceptually consistent OKLCH-based colors, mapped to semantic tokens (`--primary`, `--accent`, etc.) for uniform UI styling.\n  - Introduced fallback palettes for browsers that lack OKLCH and `color-mix` support, ensuring broad compatibility.\n\n- **Background Improvements:**\n  - Implemented visually rich galaxy (dark) and star-glow (light) backgrounds:\n    - **Light mode:** Warm radial glow with optional blue and minimal variants.\n    - **Dark mode:** Layered gradients for a galaxy effect, including nebulae and subtle starfields.\n    - Automatically fallback to gradient-based backgrounds across unsupported browsers.\n  - Updated documentation in `README.md` to guide changes in tokens and backgrounds.\n\n- **Testing Updates:**\n  - Extended Playwright E2E tests to verify background-image integrity:\n    - Tested light theme for `gradient` background rendering.\n    - Verified dark theme transitions and applied gradients after enabling the `.dark` class.\n\n- **Documentation and Action Plan:**\n  - Added accessibility targets for text/background contrast (≥ 4.5:1) and visible focus indicators in both themes.\n  - Updated `action-plan.md` with visibility fixes, background re-verification tasks, and fallback handling for diverse browser environments.\n\nThese updates ensure a robust, accessible, and cohesive theming system that scales across devices, browsers, and user preferences.","tree":{"sha":"d2e244bebe56ac09bd4ab64620a7a620cd99a28f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/d2e244bebe56ac09bd4ab64620a7a620cd99a28f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/ff37a081c119aa55d6e660236f967b543f403297","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fa