9,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/79ef212f2895db830ca2e0cbdff093d4afa644cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T09:14:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T09:14:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"feat(docs, games, tests): expand documentation, add theme details, and improve game/testing support\n\n- **Documentation Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `README.md` with a detailed list of featured playable games: Breakout, Memory, Snake, Knitzy, Bubble Pop, Checkers, and Chess.\n  - Expanded branding and UI themes section:\n    - Added descriptions of Light and Dark themes, their design principles, and implementation details using CSS variables (`app/globals.css`).\n    - Documented steps to modify theme palettes and background layers for customization.\n    - Emphasized accessibility improvements with contrast ratios and translucency handling.\n\n- **Game Improvements:**\n  - Updated game cards in the catalog to be fully clickable, supporting full-card navigation to `/games/[slug]`.\n  - Verified accessibility of game cards by adding focus indicators and keyboard interactions.\n  - Adjusted Bubble Pop''s canvas component with `data-testid` for testing reliability.\n\n- **E2E Testing Enhancements:**\n  - Added detailed test specifications for all MVP games:\n    - Verified rendering and UI interactions for Breakout, Memory, Snake, Knitzy, Bubble Pop, Checkers, and Chess.\n    - Enhanced assertions with semantic selectors (`aria-label`, `role`) ensuring accessibility compliance.\n  - Updated Playwright configurations for improved execution and root-level test support.\n\n- **Dependency Updates:**\n  - Made minor corrections to `pnpm-lock.yaml` for uniform dependency formatting and new testing-related updates.\n\nThese changes improve documentation, ensure consistent branding implementation, enhance gameplay accessibility, and strengthen testing coverage.","tree":{"sha":"94f50fd149834643ff9f8e6ca56d0355f8e08f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/94f50fd149834643ff9f8e6ca56d0355f8e08f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/79ef212f2895db830ca2e0cbdff093d4afa644cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/79ef212f2895db830ca2e0cbdff093d4afa644cb","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDc5ZWYyMTJmMjg5NWRiODMwY2EyZTBjYmRmZjA5M2