https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/27289220194af8342994a86626f78954a8eb2d5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T06:37:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T06:37:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(dev-backend, tests-e2e): enhance local development support and standardize formatting**\n\n- **E2E Test Formatting Standardization:**\n  - Updated `smoke.spec.ts` to follow consistent formatting practices:\n    - Standardized spacing for `import` statements.\n    - Improved indentation and spacing for `test.describe` and `test` blocks.\n    - Added a newline at the end of the file to adhere to style guidelines.\n\n- **Backend Development Improvements:**\n  - Introduced `net` module import to handle socket-level connection checks.\n  - Added a robust `checkTcp` utility function for verifying TCP connection readiness of local DB services.\n  - Implemented `ensureLocalDbIfRequestedOrMissing` to manage containerized PostgreSQL initialization and readiness checks:\n    - Automatically starts the `db` service in Docker Compose if necessary.\n    - Validates connection readiness for `localhost:5432` with timeouts and retries.\n  - Enhanced backend startup logic to support Compose-based database connectivity:\n    - Allowed dynamic fallback to `localhost` if `host.docker.internal` fails on Windows/macOS.\n    - Improved environment configuration by aligning `SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL` with Compose DB settings.\n    - Ensured proper health checks for `/api/health` and `/actuator/health`.\n\n- **Docker Updates:**\n  - Refined `docker-compose.yml`:\n    - Updated `SPRING_DATASOURCE_DRIVER_CLASS_NAME` and `SPRING_JPA_DATABASE_PLATFORM` to better align with PostgreSQL setup.\n    - Changed `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE` default value to \"local\" for accurate environment targeting.\n\n- **Container Management Enhancements:**\n  - Implemented `dockerCapture` to capture and handle Docker command outputs for better diagnostics.\n  - Improved handling of container state monitoring with `isContainerRunning`.\n  - Extended `tryRemoveExisting` to clean up Compose backend instances on re-execution.\n\n- **Development Quality of Life Improvements:**\n  - Enhanced logging throughout the backend initialization script for better traceability.\n  - Introduced safer retries in containerized environments to improve resilience during health check failures.\n\nThese updates improve developer experience, enhance test consistency, and ensure reliable local backend initialization in Compose environments.","tree":{"sha":"7300f8b3c68527bc96ca9ff351aa6c4e7aa04018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/7300f8b3c68527bc96ca9ff351aa6c4e7aa04018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/27289220194af8342994a86626f78954a8eb2d5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADM