:"2025-12-20T02:23:17Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**refactor(games): standardize formatting and ensure localStorage compatibility in test environments**\n\n- **Formatting Improvements:**\n  - Updated arrow function syntax across multiple game components (`KnitzyGame`, `BubblePopGame`, `ChessGame`, `CheckersGame`, `SnakeGame`) to ensure consistent use of braces for readability and alignment with style guides.\n  - Refined conditional logic in `BreakoutGame` to use braces, improving clarity in nested if-statements.\n\n- **Local Storage Compatibility:**\n  - Added a fallback implementation for `localStorage` in `GameSettingsContext` to ensure it operates correctly in test environments where `window.localStorage` may be undefined.\n\n- **Maintenance and Cleanup:**\n  - Improved readability and maintainability of conditional checks in game logic by adding braces across various components (`BreakoutGame`, `SnakeGame`).\n  - Modularized logic in `SnakeGame` to ensure better handling of edge cases in the tap-based control scheme.\n\nThese updates improve code readability, maintain style consistency, and enhance compatibility in testing environments.","tree":{"sha":"a5726722f4753aa765569561eb438802f82cb143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/a5726722f4753aa765569561eb438802f82cb143"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/802a40bb26c305bd0de8412d94c69a8f778b7f73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":405