_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b394d545e1aa7fe6a72ea7634600bc9072efa76c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T02:19:51Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T02:19:51Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(memory): update matched card handling to improve UX and layout consistency**\n\n- Updated logic to remove matched cards from the layout after animations instead of keeping empty grid spaces.\n- Introduced a new `removedIds` state to track and exclude matched cards from rendering post-animation.\n- Adjusted timeout-based state updates to ensure a smooth transition:\n  - First, cards are visually hidden after a spin+fade animation.\n  - Then, they are removed completely from the layout after a brief delay (750ms total).\n- Refined `MemoryGame.tsx` card rendering logic to render `null` for removed cards, improving performance and clarity.\n\nThese changes enhance gameplay feedback and ensure a more intuitive user experience in the Memory game.","tree":{"sha":"80c22a628bf98f87f7a4f4c5591bdd0b9ec4f044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/80c22a628bf98f87f7a4f4c5591bdd0b9ec4f044"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/b394d545e1aa7fe6a72ea7634600bc9072efa76c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/b394d545e1aa7fe6a72ea7634600bc9072efa76c","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGIzOTRkNTQ1ZTFhYTdmZTZhNzJlYTc2MzQ2MDBiYzkwNzJlZmE3NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093","sha":"a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093"}],"sha":"b394d545e1aa7fe6a72ea7634600bc9072efa76c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b394d545e1aa7fe6a72ea7634600bc9072efa76c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T00:41:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T00:41:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games, tests): add MVPs for new games and expand E2E test coverage**\n\n- **New Games Added:**\n  - Implemented MVPs for four games with manifest entries:\n    - **Knitzy:** `/games/knitzy` — relaxing stitch grid game with scoring mechanics.\n    - **Bubble Pop:** `/games/bubble-pop` — match-3 bubble shooter with pop mechanics.\n    - **Checkers:** `/games/checkers` — local 2-player draughts board with basic move interactions.\n    - **Chess:** `/games/chess` — local 2-player chessboard with move validation (rules WIP).\n\n- **Manifest and Launcher Updates:**\n  - Updated `games/manifest.ts`:\n    - Added metadata for new games (slugs, descriptions, tags, assets, and dynamic imports).\n    - Incorporated preload asset support for optimized resource loading.\n  - Enhanced the catalog and `[slug]` routes to dynamically load new game modules.\n\n- **E2E Tests Introduced:**\n  - Added Playwright tests for each game''s MVP:\n    - Verified each game page renders with proper UI components (e.g., canvas, headings).\n    - Tested basic interaction mechanics:\n      - **Knitzy:** Tap to stitch functionality and score updates.\n      - **Bubble Pop:** Bubble popping interaction with score increment validation.\n      - **Checkers:** Board rendering and piece movement.\n      - **Chess:** Board loading and overlay dismissals.\n  - Utilized robust selectors (e.g., `role` and `aria-label`) to enhance test reliability and accessibility standards.\n\n- **Code Improvements:**\n  - Modularized component exports for new games to improve maintainability (`index.ts` added for Chess, Knitzy, Bubble Pop, and Checkers).\n  - Fixed minor JSX issues (e.g., missing `export default` statements in game components).\n\n- **Documentation:**\n  - Updated `README.md`:\n    - Listed new game routes and instructions for local testing with `pnpm dev`.\n  - Expanded `action-plan.md`:\n    - Added detailed implementation tasks and priority order for Playable MVPs.\n\nThese changes add new playable game MVPs, extend manifest functionality, and ensure comprehensive test coverage.","tree":{"sha":"c196e3d513eac99cee546e1e5f37131723bdc080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/c196e3d513eac99cee546e1e5f37131723bdc080"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGEwZDQxYzk0NDkzMGE0MjEwYTVlOWQ3YmIxZjQ5ZWU3YTkzZTEwOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/6a853d30ef31b6ce5846376bbff06514f115272c","sha":"6a853d30ef31b6ce5846376bbff06514f115272c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/6a853d30ef31b6ce5846376bbff06514f115272c"}],"sha":"a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/a0d41c944930a4210a5e9d7bb1f49ee7a93e1093"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/6a853d30ef31b6ce5846376bbff06514f115272c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-19T05:34:14Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-19T05:34:14Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(admin, games, ui): implement manifest-driven game launcher and admin feature flags**\n\n- **Admin Dashboard:**\n  - Introduced a frontend-only MVP for Admin Feature Flags:\n    - Flags stored in `localStorage`, enabling per-game configuration and UI/state tunables.\n    - Added `/admin` route guarded by `ADMIN` role, supporting local dev overrides.\n    - Tabs include Feature Flags, Runtime Config, Users (stub), and Audit Log (local export/import as JSON).\n    - Schema supports toggling `enabled/upcoming` states, UI defaults, and gameplay configurations.\n  - Roadmap: Prepared schema for future backend persistence via REST endpoints.\n\n- **Game Launcher System:**\n  - Implemented manifest-driven dynamic game loading:\n    - Centralized manifest (`games/manifest.ts`) defines game metadata (slug, title, tags, dynamic imports, enabled/upcoming flags).\n    - `/games` catalog dynamically renders from manifest while respecting admin-controlled flags.\n    - `/games/[slug]` dynamic route loads individual games on demand, with \"Coming Soon\" or \"Disabled\" states.\n  - Preloading support added to optimize asset loading (e.g., sound effects, images) via hover-triggered prefetch.\n\n- **UI and Code Refinements:**\n  - Refactored GamesList to source from the manifest, ensuring clean integration.\n  - Improved `/games/[slug]` page to handle non-playable states (e.g., upcoming or admin-disabled games) with user-friendly messaging.\n  - Enhanced project organization by modularizing game initialization and asset management in the manifest.\n\n- **Testing:**\n  - Playwright tests verify:\n    - Admin toggles properly affect game catalog and dynamic routes after reload.\n    - Disabled/upcoming states render expected UI feedback.\n    - Dynamic imports load correctly with manifest-driven entries.\n\nThese changes establish a scalable game management system, introduce feature flagging via the Admin Dashboard, and enhance game discovery with manifest-driven functionality.","tree":{"sha":"a6760d017f8da3d5afac57c5e74614c21d3cf7bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/a6760d017f8da3d5afac57c5e74614c21d3cf7bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/6a853d30ef31b6ce5846376bbff06514f115272c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi