"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/76bc1b592d42d8949cd441fac34ec8c5d14a06ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-17T11:53:00Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-17T11:53:00Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(memory, projects, gitignore): improve card UI, add new project, and adjust file management**\n\n- **Memory Game Enhancements:**\n  - Updated logic for matched cards:\n    - Cards are now visually hidden after matches but retain grid space for layout consistency.\n    - Refined animation handling: removed abrupt opacity transitions and ensured smooth fade-out effects.\n    - Improved game reset behavior by clearing the `hiddenIds` state, preventing residual effects from prior rounds.\n  - Enhanced `MemoryGame` card rendering logic:\n    - Added checks to ensure matched cards are removed from pointer interactions while maintaining visual continuity.\n\n- **Projects Page Update:**\n  - Introduced \"Velvet Galaxy\" project with:\n    - Description, stack tags (`Next.js`, `Prisma`, etc.), and GitHub repository link.\n    - Marked as \"coming soon\" for visibility.\n  - Ensured consistent styling and structure for new project entries.\n\n- **Gitignore Updates:**\n  - Added `next-env.d.ts` to `.gitignore` to exclude auto-generated TypeScript environment files from version control.\n\nThese updates improve gameplay feedback in the Memory game, expand the project showcase, and streamline file management practices.","tree":{"sha":"676e588457addc011fdb63f2d0dfb303c53a2cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/676e588457addc011fdb63f2d0dfb303c53a2cb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/76bc1b592d42d8949cd441fac34ec8c5d14a06ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https