d":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/d75aafba0d67060f2d0b5490828c9b47bbebfda4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-17T07:08:09Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-17T07:08:09Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games): add new sound effects, UI refinements, and introduce \"Taps\" control scheme in Snake**\n\n- **Sound and Visual Enhancements:**\n  - Added README files for `public/sounds` and `public/images`:\n    - Describes sound effects, music (e.g., `paddle-hit.wav`, `snake-eat.wav`), and image assets from sources like Kenney.\n    - Encourages replacing placeholders with variants while maintaining filenames for compatibility.\n  - Improved `BreakoutGame` UI responsiveness:\n    - Added `min-h-[44px]` and `whitespace-nowrap` to the HUD for better layout on smaller screens.\n    - Truncated long toggle text via `maxWidth` and `textOverflow: ''ellipsis''`, ensuring HUD readability.\n\n- **Snake Game Control Scheme:**\n  - Introduced \"Taps\" control scheme for more intuitive touchscreen interactions:\n    - Tap the left or right side of the canvas to trigger relative left/right turns based on the current direction.\n    - Handled edge cases to prevent 180° directional reversals and maintain accurate gameplay logic.\n    - Updated control selector UI to include \"Taps\" alongside \"Swipe\" and \"Joystick.\"\n\n- **Mobile Focus Improvements:**\n  - Enhanced mobile control accessibility:\n    - Added dynamic button styles (e.g., active state highlights) for better user feedback when switching controls.\n    - Improved interaction handling for touch events with contextual logic to support the new \"Taps\" control.\n\n- **Code Refinements:**\n  - Modularized tap handling using reusable functions, improving maintainability and reducing duplication.\n  - Updated local storage logic to persist the selected control scheme, including \"Taps,\" across sessions.\n  - Enhanced comments for newly added features, clarifying design choices and edge-case handling.\n\nThese enhancements improve gameplay interactivity in Snake, refine UI responsiveness, and clarify asset usage with expanded documentation.","tree":{"sha":"2ba98802137ec5fb30304db262bc9f805a39ef4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/2ba98802137ec5fb30304db262bc9f805a39ef4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/d75aafba0d67060f2d0b5490828c9b47bbebfda4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/d75aafba0d67060f2d0b5490828c9b47bbebfda4","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGQ3NWFhZmJhMGQ2NzA2MGYyZDBiNTQ5MDgyOGM5YjQ3YmJlYmZkYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/479e2959ad5c3e3eeeed67ce16549b20d53cef96","sha":"479e2959ad5c3e3eeeed67ce16549b20d53cef96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/479e2959ad5c3e3eeeed67ce16549b20d53cef96"}],"sha":"d75aafba0d67060f2d0b5490828c9b47bbebfda4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/d75aafba0d67060f2d0b5490828c9b47bbebfda4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/479e2959ad5c3e3eeeed67ce16549b20d53cef96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-17T06:48:34Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-17T06:48:34Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout, memory, ui): improve particle settings, memory game feedback, and card UI behavior**\n\n- **Breakout Enhancements:**\n  - Updated particles to default to `enabled` unless explicitly disabled in user settings, improving visual feedback consistency during gameplay.\n  - Refined logic for handling undefined particle settings, ensuring `enableParticles` defaults to `true` for a better initial experience.\n\n- **Memory Game Improvements:**\n  - Added `hiddenIds` state to track and hide matched cards after animations, creating a cleaner UI.\n  - Updated reset logic to clear `hiddenIds` when the game is restarted.\n  - Introduced a removal animation for matched cards with a timed fade-out effect and hidden state update.\n\n- **Game Card UX Enhancements:**\n  - Made the entire card clickable for better user experience while retaining the \"Play\" button overlay.\n  - Introduced full-width clickable wrapping for non-upcoming games, improving navigation via the card interface.\n  - Ensured consistent aspect ratio (`16:9`) for game media slots to prevent image distortion.\n\n- **Code Refinements:**\n  - Cleaned up repetitive animation handling logic and added detailed comments for new UI behaviors.\n  - Simplified component structure and optimized animations for better performance.\n  - Updated `.gitignore` to include `next-env.d.ts` for TypeScript project compatibility.\n\nThese updates improve gameplay feedback, enhance UI interactions, and ensure consistent behavior across multiple components and games.","tree":{"sha":"a052eadd86aa358f4c257ea97a90f9e59cdb0741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/a052eadd86aa358f4c257ea97a90f9e59cdb0741"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/479e2959ad5c3e3eeeed67ce16549b20d53cef96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followe