:"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T11:41:41Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(pages): add \"Story Forge\" project details to Projects and Explore pages**\n\n- **New Project Inclusion:**\n  - Added \"Story Forge\" to projects listed in both `ProjectsPage` and `ExplorePage`.\n  - Includes full description, technology stack (`Next.js 14+`, `NestJS`, `PostgreSQL`, `Prisma`, `Vercel`, etc.), and GitHub repository link (`https://github.com/DTADMI/story-forge`).\n  - Marked the project as \"coming soon\" for visibility.\n\nThese updates expand the project showcase and ensure consistency across the listed pages.","tree":{"sha":"0602340e89d67db4f8b68d70f8f8c6ff265ba61e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/0602340e89d67db4f8b68d70f8f8c6ff265ba61e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/65cd7d3666d1e7b61cc4b0b3fef2e363334ee5ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/65cd7d3666d1e7b61cc4b0b3fef2e363334ee5ff","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDY1Y2Q3ZDM2NjZkMWU3YjYxY2M0YjBiM2ZlZjJlMzYzMzM0ZWU1ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8","sha":"937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8"}],"sha":"65cd7d3666d1e7b61cc4b0b3fef2e363334ee5ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/65cd7d3666d1e7b61cc4b0b3fef2e363334ee5ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T11:22:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T11:22:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(sound): improve sound preload logic and refine availability checking**\n\n- **Enhanced Preload Handling:**\n  - Updated `SoundManager` to allow lazy preloading of sounds even when registered but not yet loaded.\n  - Introduced handling for concurrent load attempts by marking sounds as `loading` to avoid redundant retries.\n  - Added fallback for failed preloads, marking sounds as `disabled` for better error handling.\n\n- **API Improvements:**\n  - Refined `isAvailable` and `isDisabled` methods:\n    - Improved checks to account for states like missing, disabled, or unavailable sounds.\n    - Added explicit handling for invalid or missing audio elements in availability checks.\n\n- **Test Updates:**\n  - Adjusted sound tests to account for updated preload timing:\n    - Increased `setTimeout` delay to allow correct preload completion before validation.\n    - Added tests for failed preloads, ensuring sounds are marked as disabled when loading fails.\n\n- **Code Refinements:**\n  - Improved comments for clarity on sound preload, availability, and disabled state transitions.\n  - Consolidated logic for loading sound entries, ensuring cleaner and more maintainable code paths.\n\nThese changes improve sound management, enhance preload reliability, and provide more robust error handling for unavailable sounds in the system.","tree":{"sha":"3163d34e8678a5328153f73ce41d2671b2c2c63e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/3163d34e8678a5328153f73ce41d2671b2c2c63e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDkzN2U3Y2MyMThjYWIzOTMwMjYzNDRiMDJiY2RmNjc3YWRjMmMzZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24","sha":"4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24"}],"sha":"937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/937e7cc218cab393026344b02bcdf677adc2c3d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T10:59:57Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T10:59:57Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout/shared): introduce boost mechanic, refine particles, and enhance paddle physics**\n\n- **Boost Mechanic:**\n  - Added player-controlled speed boost for increased gameplay dynamism:\n    - Desktop: `B` key activation.\n    - Mobile: double-tap or dedicated \"Boost\" button in the UI.\n    - Boosts limited per round, displayed in HUD with remaining count.\n  - Implemented boost expiration after brick contact and speed normalization logic.\n\n- **Particle Enhancements:**\n  - Refined spark and puff rendering for better visibility across themes:\n    - Changed sparks to use `source-over` composition for consistent rendering across all backgrounds.\n    - Adjusted size and alpha calculations for clearer visual effects.\n  - Introduced debug toggle for particle testing, emitting continuous effects at the ball position.\n  - Modified particle pools to support higher effect counts without performance penalties.\n  - Expanded effect variety based on brick health and environment mode (light/dark).\n\n- **Gameplay and Paddle Physics:**\n  - Smoothed frame-based physics scaling with damping to reduce jitter during high refresh rates.\n  - Improved paddle movement calculations to ensure responsiveness even with variable frame lengths.\n  - Clamped ball bounce angles to avoid overly vertical rebounds, ensuring smoother gameplay.\n\n- **HUD and UI Updates:**\n  - HUD now includes a visible boost counter (`🚀 Boost`) with contextual labels and states.\n  - Added a button for activating boosts on mobile, styled dynamically based on availability.\n  - Introduced accordion-style particle debug controls in the sidebar for developers.\n\n- **Code Refactor and Cleanup:**\n  - Centralized boost logic using refs to minimize state read/write redundancy.\n  - Consolidated particle behaviors and physics adjustments for maintainability.\n  - Streamlined paddle velocity calculation and collision tracking to reduce redundancy.\n  - Added descriptive comments for all new logic and adjusted existing ones for clarity.\n\nThese changes introduce an exciting new boost mechanic, improve visual effects, and enhance gameplay fluidity for a more polished user experience.","tree":{"sha":"8a3f515091b8ff9fe9d60cbe41b5dfd259d21a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/8a3f515091b8ff9fe9d60cbe41b5dfd259d21a24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDRhNTUwZTQ1M2FkOWM5MjNjODcxY2EyZGU0Y2E2NzZiMTUyMWRhMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3","sha":"e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3"}],"sha":"4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/4a550e453ad9c923c871ca2de4ca676b1521da24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T07:43:11Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T07:43:11Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout): add frame-based physics scaling and improve collision resolution**\n\n- **Frame-Based Physics Scaling:**\n  - Introduced delta time (`dt`) normalization logic for consistent physics across varying frame rates.\n  - Scaled paddle and ball movement (`dx`, `dy`) using `frameScale` to maintain smooth gameplay independent of device performance.\n\n- **Collision Improvements:**\n  - Enhanced ball-brick collision resolution with directional separation logic:\n    - Adjusted ball position based on entry angle to avoid overlap after collision.\n    - Improved the accuracy and realism of rebound behavior.\n  - Updated extra balls and falling power-ups to account for `frameScale` in movement calculations.\n\n- **Code Enhancements:**\n  - Added descriptive comments to clarify physics updates and collision logic.\n  - Improved variable naming for clarity (`lastPhysTs`, `frameScale`).\n  - Refined gameplay updates to minimize redundant calculations and ensure consistent performance.\n\nThese updates deliver smoother gameplay, improved visual consistency across devices, and enhanced collision handling for a more engaging player experience.","tree":{"sha":"42ec3d97fe9717cb9a767a4330dca1299a620783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/42ec3d97fe9717cb9a767a4330dca1299a620783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGUzZGY0NzdiOGYzZGUzNThjYmQ2MjhhZWFiMzljYzEyNGMwYzJhYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4","sha":"20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4"}],"sha":"e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/e3df477b8f3de358cbd628aeab39cc124c0c2ab3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T07:05:50Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T07:05:50Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(shared, games): refine restart logic, improve sound handling, and enhance fail-safe mechanisms**\n\n- **Prop Renaming Updates:**\n  - Standardized `onRestart` and `onPauseToggle` props across all games (`Tetris`, `Breakout`, `BubblePop`, `Snake`, etc.) by renaming them to `onRestartAction` and `onPauseToggleAction`. Updated associated handlers and event listeners for consistency.\n\n- **Sound Manager Enhancements:**\n  - Reworked `SoundManager` to handle fail-safe audio loading:\n    - Added lazy preloading for known sound paths, avoiding multiple failed load attempts.\n    - Implemented error handling with a `disabled` state for audio files that fail to load, improving performance and reducing console noise.\n    - Added new API methods (`isDisabled`, `enableSound`, `disableSound`) for finer control over sound states.\n  - Introduced a mockable test setup using `FakeAudio` for consistent results in tests.\n\n- **Tests:**\n  - Added unit tests for `SoundManager` fail-safe logic, validating features like lazy preloading, error handling, and disabled state management.\n\n- **Code Cleanup and Consistency:**\n  - Updated conditional formatting to wrap single-line blocks with braces for better readability and adherence to project standards.\n  - Simplified shared libraries (`particles`, `sound`) and adjusted logic for clarity, particularly in particle behavior.\n\nThese updates improve code maintainability, ensure consistency across components, and enhance resilience in sound handling for all games.","tree":{"sha":"36773b4409d1ec256cfba86d2883bfe1b3de338d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/36773b4409d1ec256cfba86d2883bfe1b3de338d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDIwYTI1ZGZjNzBmZmE1MDcyZjhlYzUxZDU4N2MwZmI0Yjg3ZjQzYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7","sha":"0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7"}],"sha":"20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/20a25dfc70ffa5072f8ec51d587c0fb4b87f43c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T06:40:49Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T06:40:49Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**refactor(game-hud): standardize prop names and update all game instances**\n\n- **Prop Renaming:**\n  - Renamed `onPauseToggle` to `onPauseToggleAction` and `onRestart` to `onRestartAction` in `GameHUD` component for better semantic clarity and alignment with naming conventions.\n\n- **Game Instance Updates:**\n  - Updated all game pages (`chess`, `checkers`, `block-blast`, `memory`, `platformer`, and `tower-defense`) to use the new `onPauseToggleAction` and `onRestartAction` props in `GameHUD`.\n  - Adjusted corresponding handlers across games to match new prop names.\n\n- **Component Updates:**\n  - Updated `GameHUD` component to reflect the renamed props, including `aria-labels` and `onClick` handlers for pause and restart buttons.\n  - Made consistent changes in `GameShell` for `GameHUD` usage, ensuring no breaking interactions with `mobileControls`.\n\n- **Sound Manager Improvements:**\n  - Added lazy loading for known default sound paths to prevent repeated 404 errors and unnecessary log spam.\n  - Introduced fallback to a silent audio buffer for missing sounds, improving performance and reducing console noise.\n\n- **Breakout Gameplay Enhancements:**\n  - Refined ball velocity normalization to only apply post-collision, improving gameplay responsiveness and avoiding redundant calculations.\n  - Added `needNormalize` flag to enforce velocity adjustments when required.\n  - Enhanced brick interaction logic for `extraBalls`, tracking brick state changes and ensuring consistent rendering updates.\n\n- **Code Cleanup:**\n  - Removed unused or outdated annotations and streamlined logic in the `BreakoutGame` component.\n  - Improved comments for new props and sound-related updates in `GameHUD` and `SoundManager`.\n\nThese changes standardize prop names for clarity, improve audio handling, enhance breakout physics and gameplay, and ensure consistency across all game implementations.","tree":{"sha":"5581d6e34306eedeb1888b6d412f0001d26e8818","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/5581d6e34306eedeb1888b6d412f0001d26e8818"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDBlNTE2ZjJlNTA1MmRjZmE3MzI5ZWJhMWJjYWE4ZDQ1NTBmMGVlZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/0298a2b4192e2f920954d171a2157ac7143b5ec6","sha":"0298a2b4192e2f920954d171a2157ac7143b5ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0298a2b4192e2f920954d171a2157ac7143b5ec6"}],"sha":"0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0e516f2e5052dcfa7329eba1bcaa8d4550f0eee7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0298a2b4192e2f920954d171a2157ac7143b5ec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T06:16:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T06:16:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(particles, breakout): improve particle effect clarity and enhance visibility in different environments**\n\n- **Particle Effect Improvements (Shared Library):**\n  - Adjusted `draw()` logic to enhance visibility:\n    - Added comments for better clarity on `spark` and `puff` rendering.\n    - Used `\"lighter\"` global composite operation for `sparks`, ensuring vibrant effects on both light and dark backgrounds.\n    - Standardized composition for `puffs` with `\"source-over\"` to improve visibility on white backgrounds.\n  - Simplified `inactive` particle check by collapsing single-line conditionals.\n\n- **Breakout Game Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `emitDustPuff()` to use bright white puffs (`rgba(255,255,255,0.95)`) for better visibility in light backgrounds.\n  - Increased particle count and adjusted randomness for `emitDustPuff()` and `emitSparkBurst()` to enhance visual feedback:\n    - Dust puff count: `8 + random(0-4)` → `10 + random(0-6)`\n    - Spark burst count: `14 + random(0-6)` for clearer bursts during gameplay.\n\nThese updates improve particle effect rendering across various backgrounds, refine particle animations for gameplay feedback, and enhance overall visual clarity.","tree":{"sha":"126ed26f293e047eccf9a36f4d07b4978f9200c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/126ed26f293e047eccf9a36f4d07b4978f9200c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/0298a2b4192e2f920954d171a2157ac7143b5ec6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations