.0.0-beta.30` in `package.json`.\n- Prepares for adoption of NextAuth v5 API changes, including improved typings and enhanced compatibility with the latest features.","tree":{"sha":"fcda2b702a8587e945f6ef3fac8cfcea496671e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/fcda2b702a8587e945f6ef3fac8cfcea496671e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/ed915216056222eea21f99eeebe445b3be5d830a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/ed915216056222eea21f99eeebe445b3be5d830a","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGVkOTE1MjE2MDU2MjIyZWVhMjFmOTllZWViZTQ0NWIzYmU1ZDgzMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/0ceef39b6d6871a7f3467c4f34fc43be50a9b224","sha":"0ceef39b6d6871a7f3467c4f34fc43be50a9b224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0ceef39b6d6871a7f3467c4f34fc43be50a9b224"}],"sha":"ed915216056222eea21f99eeebe445b3be5d830a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/ed915216056222eea21f99eeebe445b3be5d830a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0ceef39b6d6871a7f3467c4f34fc43be50a9b224/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T23:08:01Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T23:08:01Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"### **feat(auth, breakout, config): add `/signin` route, migrate to NextAuth v5, and enhance gameplay mechanics**\n\n#### **Authentication & Configuration**\n- **New `/signin` Page:**\n  - Added `app/signin/page.tsx` with support for email/password authentication and third-party providers (Google, GitHub).\n  - Implemented dynamic tabs (`Sign In` and `Sign Up`) for streamlined user registration and login experience.\n  - Enhanced callbacks to handle `callbackUrl` and redirection, including error messages and authentication states.\n- **NextAuth v5 Migration:**\n  - Migrated from `v4` to `v5` for improved typings and compatibility.\n  - Adjusted `authOptions` to derive type from `NextAuth` handler for better alignment with v5 API changes.\n  - Renamed routes and updated APIs to use `/auth/signin`, `/auth/signup`, `/auth/refresh`, and `/auth/me` for clarity.\n\n#### **Environment & API Updates**\n- Updated `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` to default to `http://localhost:8080/api` in `.env` and all references (`next.config.ts`, routes, etc.).\n- Adjusted headers, rewrites, and security policies to align with the updated API URL.\n\n#### **Breakout Gameplay Enhancements**\n- Introduced multiball improvements: losing the main ball now promotes one of the extra balls to avoid losing a life.\n- Unified ball colors for consistency across light/dark modes (`#e11d48`/`#e74c3c` for all balls).\n- Refactored lifecycle handling: streamlined interactions when the ball contacts the bottom of the canvas.\n\n#### **Documentation & ReadMe Updates**\n- Added `.env` details for NextAuth (`NEXTAUTH_URL`, `NEXTAUTH_SECRET`) and OAuth callbacks for local/prod.\n- Documented new email/password endpoints and callback flows for NextAuth and `/signin`.\n\n#### **Dependency & Build Changes**\n- Updated `pnpm-lock.yaml` to reflect dependency adjustments:\n  - Bumped `next-auth` to `v5.0.0-beta.30`.\n  - Updated package specs for consistent formatting (e.g., `@radix-ui/library`).\n\nThese updates introduce robust authentication capabilities, improve the game''s fluidity with enhanced gameplay mechanics, and ensure compatibility with the latest NextAuth libraries.","tree":{"sha":"43017df6883f7ddbc4b286e452297f4f21de2fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/43017df6883f7ddbc4b286e452297f4f21de2fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/0ceef39b6d6871a7f3467c4f34fc43be50a9b224","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co