I/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/7a41998eb51c648e756ca7bad3f44c8deac30253/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T10:05:42Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T10:05:42Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**refactor(breakout): wrap single-line conditionals, rename refs, and cleanup code**\n\n- Enclosed single-line conditional statements within blocks (`{}`) across `BreakoutGame` to improve readability and maintain consistency with the project''s style.\n- Renamed mutable refs (`modifierTimerRef`, `stateLives`, etc.) to use a leading underscore for better semantic clarity and internal state distinction.\n- Adjusted variable initialization and function readability:\n  - Simplified comments and removed redundant or outdated annotations.\n  - Improved clarity in logic, including power-up selection and brick interactions.\n- Streamlined physics and power-up handling logic to ensure consistent gameplay behavior.\n\nThese changes enhance code maintainability, readability, and adherence to project coding standards without altering core functionalities.","tree":{"sha":"95d3fe889d98a05895fc670b781e8a755bee7346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/95d3fe889d98a05895fc670b781e8a755bee7346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/7a41998eb51c648e756ca7bad3f44c8deac30253","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","e