ttps://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/9f8fff3b8a536f73eb65866a8608c71c2ed400e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T10:00:51Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T10:00:51Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"feat(breakout/powerups): add new power-ups (expand, shrink, multiball) and enhance gameplay mechanics\n\n- **New Power-Ups Added:**\n  - Introduced \"expand\" (wider paddle), \"shrink\" (narrower paddle), and \"multiball\" (spawns extra balls).\n  - Assigned unique visuals and icons for new power-ups (`colorMap` and `letterMap`).\n  - Integrated paddle resizing logic for expand and shrink with duration-based resets.\n\n- **Multiball Mechanics:**\n  - Implemented extra balls with physics updates:\n    - Bounce against walls, paddle, and bricks without costing lives when missed.\n    - Simplified collision logic for better performance.\n  - Spawns two additional balls with slight angular offsets from the main ball.\n\n- **Power-Up Logic Updates:**\n  - Updated weighted power-up selection to include new types with balanced probabilities.\n  - Introduced paddle size constraints to ensure it remains within canvas boundaries during modifications.\n\n- **Gameplay Visual Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `draw()` function to render extra balls and apply distinctive colors (emerald for multiballs).\n  - Added custom HUD background colors and icons in `BreakoutGame` for the new power-ups.\n\n- **Code Improvements:**\n  - Improved power-up expiration handling, resetting paddle size properly when expand/shrink effects end.\n  - Centralized logic for power-up physics and interactions for consistency and maintainability.\n\nThese updates introduce exciting new gameplay mechanics and visual elements, enhancing player interaction and overall experience.","tree":{"sha":"6903fdb7dd5400bb5468c9b95e223643b763e49c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/6903fdb7dd5400bb5468c9b95e223643b763e49c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/9f8fff3b8a536f73eb65866a8608c71c2ed400e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/9f8fff3b8a536f73eb65866a8608c71c2ed400e3","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDlmOGZmZjNiOGE1MzZmNzNlYjY1ODY2YTg2MDhjNzFjMmVkNDAwZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/438f730546be8032b782e4030efedc518ac99b09","sha":"438f730546be8032b782e4030efedc518ac99b09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/438f730546be8032b782e4