"Subscriber\" locks (`auth`/`sub`), dynamically adjusted based on user state.\n\n- **HUD Enhancements:**\n  - Updated active modifier display with contextual background colors tied to active power-up types (`colorClass`).\n  - Improved clarity of timers and visual association between modifiers and HUD elements.\n\n- **Code Refactor:**\n  - Replaced duplicative inline power-up descriptions with reusable `PowerUpCard` components for desktop and mobile, enhancing maintainability and consistency.\n  - Consolidated gated logic for power-ups into a unified structure using `useGameSettings`.\n\nThese changes enhance the visual clarity of power-ups, improve gameplay HUD integration, and provide a mobile-friendly experience.","tree":{"sha":"e8cf97a3a4e198f3003dba92a603a28651670bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/e8cf97a3a4e198f3003dba92a603a28651670bee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/438f730546be8032b782e4030efedc518ac99b09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI",