Restrictions:**\n  - Updated game mode options (`hard` and `chaos`) to include restrictions based on user status:\n    - `Hard` mode disabled for unauthenticated users. Displays prompt: `(sign in)`.\n    - `Chaos` mode disabled for non-subscribers. Displays prompt: `(sub)`.\n- **Dropdown Improvements:**\n  - Improved user communication by appending contextual prompts to restricted options (`(sign in)`/`(sub)`).\n  - Dynamically enabled/disabled dropdown options based on `isAuthenticated` and `isSubscriber` states.\n\nThese updates enhance user experience by aligning mode availability with user entitlements while maintaining clear communication within dropdown menus.","tree":{"sha":"f7ceffca6f6523ac66680bc682c3f28f4fdb4e10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/f7ceffca6f6523ac66680bc682c3f28f4fdb4e10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/6c3b2269a96929b6274b2c9a5614db1d8feaa716","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/6c3b2269a96929b6274b2c9a5614db1d8feaa716","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDZjM2IyMjY5YTk2OTI5YjYyNzRiMmM5YTU2MTRkYjFkOGZlYWE3MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7","sha":"528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7"}],"sha":"6c3b2269a96929b6274b2c9a5614db1d8feaa716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/6c3b2269a96929b6274b2c9a5614db1d8feaa716"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T09:00:11Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T09:00:11Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout): add new power-ups, improve physics, and enhance gameplay HUD**\n\n- **New Power-Ups:**\n  - Introduced additional power-ups: \"thru\" (pierce bricks), \"bomb\" (AoE), \"fireball\" (one-hit), \"laser\" (paddle shots), and \"extraLife\".\n  - Adjusted modifiers for premium power-ups with extended duration (`POWERUP_DURATION_LONG_MS`).\n\n- **Physics Enhancements:**\n  - Improved particle effects:\n    - Made spark lines thicker and extended their range for improved visibility.\n    - Added additive blending (\"lighter\") to create more vibrant effects.\n  - Introduced context save/restore for better rendering clarity.\n  - Tweaked ball speed scaling for gameplay modes (`hard`, `chaos`) via `modeScale` multiplier.\n  - Added support for bricks with specific interactions while modifiers like \"thru\" and \"fireball\" are active.\n\n- **Gameplay Features:**\n  - Implemented `advanceToNextLevel` helper to handle smoother level transitions.\n  - Added fireworks visual effects during level completion.\n  - Enhanced paddle interaction with touch handling for \"tap-advance\" responsiveness.\n  - Introduced context-aware power-up availability, unlocked by authentication and subscription states.\n\n- **UI Improvements:**\n  - Replaced in-canvas HUD with a compact, external HUD displaying score, lives, level, and active modifiers.\n  - Integrated HUD scaling and improved typography for better readability.\n  - Allowed touch-sensitive input for resuming/pause and advancing levels.\n\n- **Game Settings:**\n  - Expanded `GameSettingsContext`:\n    - Added support for \"mode\" (`classic`, `hard`, `chaos`) and authentication states.\n    - Persisted settings with new durability for user preferences (e.g., local mode or premium).\n\n- **Code Enhancements:**\n  - Centralized particle initialization for fireworks during special effects.\n  - Optimized power-up selection logic by weighting availability based on entitlement.\n  - Updated conditional checks and rewrote falling power-up logic for better maintainability and readability.\n\nThese updates extend gameplay mechanics, refine visual clarity, and enhance user experience while supporting advanced power-ups and responsive feedback for players.","tree":{"sha":"302ca5a6797ca403a8805c9eee16a0e5f1f36a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/302ca5a6797ca403a8805c9eee16a0e5f1f36a65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDUyODkxNmQ1OTczNTkwMDVlNzg2YzllYjNmOTAwMWFjNGNiMmQ0Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/1a63392310f8dc72cf637737ef53c6d645265ca4","sha":"1a63392310f8dc72cf637737ef53c6d645265ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/1a63392310f8dc72cf637737ef53c6d645265ca4"}],"sha":"528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/528916d597359005e786c9eb3f9001ac4cb2d4c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/1a63392310f8dc72cf637737ef53c6d645265ca4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:56:43Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T05:56:43Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout/ui): adjust gameplay physics, improve HUD, and refine footer and layout responsiveness**\n\n- **Gameplay Physics Adjustments:**\n  - Reduced `BASE_BALL_SPEED` by ~10% (`4.8` → `4.32`) for better control on desktop screens while maintaining responsiveness in wide canvases.\n  - Increased particle count for `dustPuff` and `sparkBurst` effects, enhancing visual feedback when bricks are destroyed.\n\n- **HUD Enhancements:**\n  - Redesigned in-game HUD (`BreakoutGame`) with improved structure and typography:\n    - Consolidated score, high score, lives, and level indicators into a visually aligned external HUD bar.\n    - Modified styles for better readability, including larger font sizes, spacing optimizations, and responsive scaling across devices.\n    - Added a new modifier timer display for active power-ups, using accessible labels for visual clarity.\n\n- **Footer and Layout Refinements:**\n  - Converted `Footer` to use full-width styling with improved container alignment for better scalability.\n  - Simplified footer spacing and removed unnecessary border markup for a cleaner and more readable UI.\n\n- **Game Container Updates:**\n  - Adjusted max canvas width (`max-w-4xl` → `max-w-[960px]`) in `GameContainer` to ensure better adaptability on smaller and mid-sized screens.\n\nThese updates enhance gameplay visuals, improve HUD functionality, and ensure a more accessible and responsive layout across all devices.","tree":{"sha":"a0f893fe2dd5b1f371bcd077254dfc19423c48a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/a0f893fe2dd5b1f371bcd077254dfc19423c48a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/1a63392310f8dc72cf637737ef53c6d645265ca4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_