n- **Particle Effect Customization:**\n  - Added support for selecting particle effects (`sparks` or `puff`) in `BreakoutGame` when bricks are destroyed.\n  - Integrated particle settings into `GameSettingsContext`, persisted in `localStorage` with default values (`sparks`).\n\n- **Footer UX Improvements:**\n  - Added a collapsible footer section with a \"More\" toggle to reduce vertical spacing for streamlined navigation.\n  - Refined spacing, compacted the header row, and made additional links and forms available through toggle expansion.\n\n- **Layout Enhancements:**\n  - Updated site layout to use a sticky footer with tighter vertical spacing, ensuring most pages fit within a single screen.\n  - Adjusted `GameContainer` and global layout to handle viewport heights (`min-h-0`), improving scalability across devices.\n\n- **Code Improvements:**\n  - Refactored particle logic for improved readability, centralizing conditional checks for `enableParticles` and `particleEffect` selection.\n  - Updated reusable UI components (e.g., GameSettings) to improve maintainability with clean state initialization and expanded settings.\n\nThese changes enhance gameplay visuals, improve footer and layout flexibility, and ensure better usability on mobile and web platforms.","tree":{"sha":"dc19837aacd29fc8f264f64087581afb63e55c26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/dc19837aacd29fc8f264f64087581afb63e55c26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/0828cd05a5c0471951a26cf047029cfb58b8606b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gi