/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/5a82a4ce4b9990d37313bdf9cf9d3e6ce5d7e3db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T04:30:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T04:30:30Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout/footer/shared): adjust gameplay physics, improve layouts, and refine UI responsiveness**\n\n- **Gameplay Physics Updates:**\n  - Increased `BASE_BALL_SPEED`, `MIN_BALL_SPEED`, and `MAX_BALL_SPEED` to enhance responsiveness and maintain snappy gameplay on wider canvases.\n  - Adjusted `SLOW_FACTOR_MOBILE` to `0.9` for smoother gameplay on mobile devices, avoiding sluggishness.\n  - Updated power-up falling speed (`dy`) to `2.2` for better visibility and engagement.\n\n- **Footer Layout Adjustments:**\n  - Reduced padding (`py-6` → `py-4`, `md:py-10` → `md:py-6`) for a more compact design.\n  - Adjusted footer spacing (`mt-8` → `mt-6`, `md:mt-10` → `md:mt-8`) to improve overall visual balance.\n\n- **GameContainer Improvements:**\n  - Updated `min-h-screen` to `min-h-[100svh]` for better handling of viewport height on mobile devices.\n  - Tightened vertical spacing (`py-4` → `py-3`, `md:py-6` → `md:py-4`) for a more efficient layout.\n  - Simplified header and button styles, optimizing for readability and usability:\n    - Reduced header margins (`mb-4` → `mb-3`).\n    - Streamlined button visuals with smaller padding (`px-6 py-2` → `px-4 py-1.5`) and rounded corners (`rounded-lg` → `rounded-md`).\n\nThese updates enhance gameplay fluidity, refine mobile UX, and streamline layout aesthetics across components.","tree":{"sha":"38b561322c6bf53adcaea667d4c48d640b80eeda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/38b561322c6bf53adcaea667d4c48d640b80eeda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/rep