rl":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b6c0cf9a81bba274031ecf9e3496589743302003/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T04:17:29Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T04:17:29Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout/footer): add responsive brick layout and improve mobile experience**\n\n- **Breakout Brick Layout:**\n  - Implemented a responsive and centered brick layout in `BreakoutGame`, dynamically adjusting columns and brick sizes based on canvas width.\n  - Replaced hardcoded brick dimensions and offsets with computed values for better scalability and alignment.\n\n- **Footer Enhancements:**\n  - Reduced vertical spacing and refined grid layout to improve navigation usability.\n  - Added collapsible footer sections for mobile devices, minimizing scrolling while retaining access to all links.\n\n- **Game Pages:**\n  - Tightened vertical spacing on game pages (`GameContainer`) to reduce excessive scrolling.\n  - Updated headers and descriptions to adapt to varying screen sizes with better spacing and font size adjustments.\n\n- **Code Improvements:**\n  - Optimized brick grid computation logic with fallback handling for edge cases, ensuring consistent gameplay on all resolutions.\n  - Enhanced mobile-first UX with streamlined layout adjustments and collapsible elements.","tree":{"sha":"2376bc9a551e821511309cefc50514e6169d556f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/2376bc9a551e821511309cefc50514e6169d556f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/b6c0cf9a81bba274031ecf9e3496589743302003","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/b6c0cf9a81bba274031ecf9e3496589743302003","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGI2YzBjZjlhODFiYmEyNzQwMzFlY2Y5ZTM0OTY1ODk3NDMzMDIwMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/ba500cad4b56a7c4e822fe1718a08b1b419e77ad","sha":"ba500cad4b56a7c4e822fe1718a08b1b419e77ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/ba500cad4b56a7c4e822fe1718a08b1b419e77ad"}],"sha":"b6c0cf9a81bba274031ecf9e3496589743302003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/b6c0cf9a81bba274031ecf9e3496589743302003"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/ba500cad4b56a7c4e822fe1718a08b1b419e77ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:56:15Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:56:15Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**refactor(shared/breakout): improve readability by wrapping conditional statements in blocks**\n\n- Enclosed single-line conditional statements (`if`/`for`) in blocks (`{}`) across `ParticlePool`, `BreakoutGame`, and context files for better readability and consistency.\n- Adjusted React hooks in `BreakoutGame` by adding missing dependencies (e.g., `ball`, `lives`, `paddle`) to prevent stale closure issues.\n- Minor import reordering in `GameContainer` and `index.ts` to align with the project''s alphabetization style.","tree":{"sha":"1335c389b5efddca6d18a88f3b79b4278dd4369b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/1335c389b5efddca6d18a88f3b79b4278dd4369b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/co