users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/08673703b8f634bcc1e9aa41dcfc2464f0fdb523/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:51:35Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:51:35Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout/shared/e2e): add particle system, game settings context, and E2E enhancements**\n\n- **Particle System:**\n  - Introduced a lightweight particle system (`ParticlePool`) for canvas-based games, supporting spark bursts and dust puffs.\n  - Integrated optional particle effects into `Breakout` gameplay with toggleable settings for sparks on brick breaks and puffs on hits.\n  - Efficient pooling ensures minimal performance impact, even on low-end devices.\n\n- **Game Settings Context:**\n  - Added `GameSettingsContext` to manage global game settings (e.g., particle effects toggle).\n  - Persisted settings using `localStorage` with fallback defaults for SSR environments.\n  - Integrated `GameSettingsProvider` into `GameContainer` and added a UI toggle for enabling/disabling particles.\n\n- **E2E Test Stabilizations:**\n  - Relaxed expectations in `Breakout` E2E tests to reduce flakiness in CI/mobile environments:\n    - Updated CI tests to tolerate timing variance (e.g., `toBeGreaterThanOrEqual`).\n    - Ensured dataset attributes (e.g., ball position, paddle position) initialize appropriately for test reliability.\n  - Added deterministic behaviors for E2E mode (`NEXT_PUBLIC_E2E`) to ensure consistent test runs (e.g., ball nudging for life loss scenarios).\n\n- **Gameplay Enhancements & Refactor:**\n  - Adjusted paddle physics for coarse touch input, optimizing ball control on mobile devices.\n  - Exposed visual attributes (`data-px`, `data-bally`, etc.) on every frame to assist Playwright E2E tests.\n  - Centralized dataset population logic for accurate, readable states across game components.\n\n- **Documentation Update:**\n  - Expanded README with particle system usage, device-pixel-ratio fixes to improve rendering sharpness, and guidance for toggling particle effects.\n\nThese updates introduce an experimental visual enhancement for gameplay, streamline test runs, and provide tools for developers to manage global game settings intuitively.","tree":{"sha":"ac2551916fff7e4b5e27b52f77bcbb28f7be44b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/ac2551916fff7e4b5e27b52f77bcbb28f7be44b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/08673703b8f634bcc1e9aa41dcfc2464f0fdb523","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/08673703b8f634bcc1e9aa41dcfc2464f0fdb523","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDA4NjczNzAzYjhmNjM0YmNjMWU5YWE0MWRjZmMyNDY0ZjBmZGI1MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b","sha":"0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b"}],"sha":"08673703b8f634bcc1e9aa41dcfc2464f0fdb523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/08673703b8f634bcc1e9aa41dcfc2464f0fdb523"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:27:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:27:20Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**refactor(snake/memory/breakout): clean up conditional calls, improve touch handling, and add comments**\n\n- **Code Cleanup:**\n  - Wrapped single-line conditional statements in blocks (`{}`) across `SnakeGame`, `MemoryGame`, and `BreakoutGame` for improved readability and consistency.\n  - Refactored input handling logic to streamline event callbacks and prevent redundant checks.\n\n- **Touch Handling Enhancements:**\n  - Improved logic for handling touch events (`onTouchStart`, `onTouchEnd`, `onTouchMove`), ensuring better responsiveness and consistency across games.\n  - Added touch handling safety checks in `SnakeGame` and `MemoryGame` to prevent unintended inputs during gameplay interruptions (e.g., pause or game over states).\n\n- **Maintainability Improvements:**\n  - Declared missing dependencies (`playSound`, `onDirection`) in React `useEffect` and `useCallback` hooks to prevent potential issues with stale closures.\n  - Added inline comments for complex functions to clarify purpose and behavior, particularly in touch and swipe logic.\n\n- **Backend Dev Script Updates:**\n  - Added explicit comments to `dev-backend-fallback.mjs` for better maintainability.\n  - Resolved eslint-disable directives by incorporating explicit global declarations and ignoring unused error blocks properly.\n\nThese changes improve code quality, maintainability, and responsiveness while ensuring better gameplay interactions across all affected modules.","tree":{"sha":"1a2ccc6669208b5ffe5547491c4389cedf5d7a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/1a2ccc6669208b5ffe5547491c4389cedf5d7a5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDBhMTMzYzYxMWJkMGY2ZGRmNGI4ZDcxYmUyZTg0NGYyZWFlOWQ3MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17","sha":"fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17"}],"sha":"0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/0a133c611bd0f6ddf4b8d71be2e844f2eae9d70b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:16:54Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T03:16:54Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games, e2e, workflows, docs): enhance mobile gameplay, backend setup, and CI pipelines**\n\n- **Mobile Gameplay Enhancements:**\n  - Improved touch handling in `SnakeGame` with refined swipe thresholds, joystick deadzones, and haptic feedback for better UX.\n  - Updated `MemoryGame` with a throttled sound manager (`playSound`) to prevent repetitive sounds on low-end devices.\n  - Ensured overlays (`Tap-to-start`, `Tap-to-pause`) improve mobile-first UX and responsiveness across games.\n\n- **Local Backend Fallback:**\n  - Added commands (`backend:up`, `backend:down`) for automated local backend setup using Docker, with fallback to Docker Hub if GCP Artifact Registry is unavailable.\n  - Introduced full local stack using Docker Compose for Postgres and backend services on predefined ports (`5432`, `8080`), streamlining development.\n\n- **Playwright Updates:**\n  - E2E tests now include a backend health-gate via `global-setup.ts` to facilitate seamless local test environments.\n  - Automatically starts/stops the backend during local E2E runs when required.\n\n- **CI/CD Workflow Improvements:**\n  - Split workflows for PR and `main` pipelines:\n    - PR checks: lint, type-check, unit tests, build, and mobile smoke tests.\n    - `main` pipeline: full CI/CD pipeline with deploys to Cloud Run.\n  - Enhanced caching for faster runs, including `pnpm` dependency management.\n\n- **Documentation Updates:**\n  - Expanded README with instructions for local backend setup (helper scripts, Compose) and mobile-first game UX improvements, making it easier to onboard developers.\n\nThese updates significantly improve mobile UX, backend usability for local development, and CI/CD efficiency, streamlining the developer experience.","tree":{"sha":"76a913f32cc971efd5ab07a6f5b0d1c3321a29b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/76a913f32cc971efd5ab07a6f5b0d1c3321a29b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKGZlMWZkNjIwMWMwYmVkNjA1YjRmYzdkMjE4NTZkYTM2ZTQ4YjRlMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486","sha":"18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486"}],"sha":"fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/fe1fd6201c0bed605b4fc7d21856da36e48b4e17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:52:50Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:52:50Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(snake/memory): improve UI consistency, touch handling, and accessibility**\n\n- **UI Consistency:**\n  - Standardized button styles across `SnakeGame` and `MemoryGame` components:\n    - Updated padding, minimum height (`min-h-11`), and hover effects for cleaner and more consistent UI appearance.\n\n- **Touch Handling Enhancements:**\n  - Added \"Tap-to-start\" and \"Tap-to-resume\" overlays in `SnakeGame` for mobile-first gameplay, improving UX on touch devices.\n  - Introduced pause handling via tap gestures for mobile players, matching existing desktop functionality.\n\n- **Accessibility Improvements:**\n  - Provided `aria-label` attributes for the canvas and interactive buttons in `SnakeGame`, ensuring better screen reader usability.\n  - Ensured buttons maintain clear descriptive labels and alignment across game states.\n\n- **Code Improvements:**\n  - Refined responsive design logic and updated styles for overlays and interactive elements to enhance accessibility and usability on smaller screens.\n  - Updated event handling for touch and pause interactions to streamline gameplay logic and improve maintainability.\n\nThese updates significantly improve mobile usability, UI consistency, and accessibility while enhancing the overall player experience.","tree":{"sha":"eb213020bdd3a40a7a7df6288ca666f72e1f93fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/eb213020bdd3a40a7a7df6288ca666f72e1f93fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDE4YzlkMTA1ZmU1ZjliODg0YTllMGUzZjljMjgxMmRkNTM2YTM0ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/77981434de11531a028cc6352079e09256322656","sha":"77981434de11531a028cc6352079e09256322656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/77981434de11531a028cc6352079e09256322656"}],"sha":"18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/18c9d105fe5f9b884a9e0e3f9c2812dd536a3486"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/77981434de11531a028cc6352079e09256322656/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:34:55Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:34:55Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(e2e): add global setup for backend fallback and compose local dev services**\n\n- **Global Setup for E2E Tests:**\n  - Added `tests-e2e/global-setup.ts` to handle backend availability during E2E testing:\n    - Implements health check polling for backend endpoints (`/api/health`, `/actuator/health`, `/health`).\n    - Starts fallback backend using the helper script if a local backend is absent and public mode is off.\n    - Ensures seamless backend availability for localhost environments, with a 45-second polling delay for health readiness.\n\n- **Docker Compose Integration:**\n  - Introduced `docker-compose.yml` to simplify local development:\n    - Includes `db` (Postgres) and `backend` services for easier local backend setup.\n    - Configured `gamehub-backend` to connect with the `gamehub-postgres` database.\n    - Predefined ports, volumes, and environment variables aligning with backend development requirements.\n\n- **Playwright Configuration Update:**\n  - Linked `globalSetup` to `tests-e2e/global-setup.ts` in `playwright.config.ts` to streamline backend setup during test runs.\n\nThese changes enhance E2E testing reliability, improve local development efficiency with Docker Compose, and automate backend setup for improved DX (developer experience).","tree":{"sha":"14be926d2914bc522ffd22dc73086f2e44a988d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/14be926d2914bc522ffd22dc73086f2e44a988d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/77981434de11531a028cc6352079e09256322656","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/