e_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/4f022d3bfb867a1317e8d421b284ee16af8c0511/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:04:02Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:04:02Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(ci/cd): enhance workflows, add PR checks, and dev backend helper script**\n\n- **Workflow Updates:**\n  - Split workflows for improved CI/CD pipeline:\n    - Added `ci-pr.yml` for pull requests: runs linting, unit tests (Vitest), type-checking (tsc), and build (no deploy/E2E).\n    - Updated `ci-cd.yml` to remove PR trigger and simplify image build process.\n    - Adjusted `test-e2e.yml`: removed `push` on `main` trigger and added caching for `pnpm` dependencies.\n\n- **Backend Development Helper:**\n  - Introduced `scripts/dev-backend-fallback.mjs`: ensures the backend is available locally for frontend development.\n    - Checks backend health status at `localhost:8080`.\n    - Pulls backend Docker image from GCP Artifact Registry (preferred) or Docker Hub (fallback).\n    - Automatically runs the backend container if it''s not already up.\n    - Added scripts: `backend:up` and `backend:down`.\n\n- **Documentation Updates:**\n  - Expanded `guidelines.md` with:\n    - CI/CD workflow explanations, including environment variables and secrets for GCP authentication.\n    - Dev backend helper usage instructions and fallback behavior.\n\nThese updates simplify the CI/CD process, add robust PR checks, and improve local development efficiency by ensuring backend readiness.","tree":{"sha":"d442f0319f2578e53c265a6c16bc11de2250870e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/d442f0319f2578e53c265a6c16bc11de2250870e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/4f022d3bfb867a1317e8d421b284ee16af8c0511","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/4f022d3bfb867a1317e8d421b284ee16af8c0511","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDRmMDIyZDNiZmI4NjdhMTMxN2U4ZDQyMWIyODRlZTE2YWY4YzA1MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad","sha":"27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad"}],"sha":"4f022d3bfb867a1317e8d421b284ee16af8c0511","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/4f022d3bfb867a1317e8d421b284ee16af8c0511"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T01:38:59Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-15T01:38:59Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(games): add touch improvements, score submission, and responsive updates**\n\n- **Breakout:**\n  - Added haptic feedback for brick hits and breaks on supported devices.\n  - Integrated score submission to the backend using `submitScore` (best-effort).\n  - Improved input handling for mobile touch gameplay with vibration enhancements.\n\n- **Snake:**\n  - Implemented responsive scaling for improved canvas rendering on high-DPI and smaller screens.\n  - Added backend score submission with error handling.\n  - Enhanced UI with better scaling and font sizing for game stats and controls.\n\n- **Memory:**\n  - Introduced pause functionality with tap-to-pause overlays.\n  - Added \"Tap to start\" and \"Tap to resume\" screens for better UX, especially on mobile.\n  - Improved difficulty handling with restricted dropdown interaction after the game starts.\n\n- **Playwright Configuration:**\n  - Added browser profiles for testing `mobile-chrome` and `mobile-safari` environments.\n\nThese updates enhance mobile gameplay, responsiveness, and backend integration for multiple games while ensuring improved user experience and consistency across platforms.","tree":{"sha":"6cb95bf8b15e94cefc7f7246f6eb812220cb63c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/6cb95bf8b15e94cefc7f7246f6eb812220cb63c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad","node_id":"C_kwDOQl0HN9oAKDI3ZjM4ZjZlNmJkNTc5YWQ3NzJlNWNjYjhmYzcxN2E2MzYzNzc0YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/15636c0d8c5574a2a69efad0f15c42161a118b63","sha":"15636c0d8c5574a2a69efad0f15c42161a118b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/15636c0d8c5574a2a69efad0f15c42161a118b63"}],"sha":"27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/27f38f6e6bd579ad772e5ccb8fc717a6363774ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/15636c0d8c5574a2a69efad0f15c42161a118b63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-14T23:42:22Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-14T23:42:22Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(snake): add control scheme options and enhance touch controls**\n\n- **Control Scheme Support:**\n  - Introduced `controlScheme` state to allow switching between \"swipe\" and \"joystick\" controls for mobile devices.\n  - Persisted control scheme preference using `localStorage`.\n\n- **Swipe Controls:**\n  - Implemented touch swipe gestures to change the snake''s direction. Horizontal and vertical swipes are mapped to cardinal directions with guardrails to prevent reverse moves.\n  - Added thresholds to minimize accidental gestures and improve gameplay accuracy.\n\n- **Joystick Controls:**\n  - Added a `VirtualJoystick` component for intuitive directional input.\n  - Knob movement translates to cardinal directions, dynamically updating the snake''s direction with visual feedback.\n  - Enhanced touch handling with deadzones, movement constraints, and smooth transitions.\n\n- **UI Enhancements:**\n  - Added UI toggle buttons for switching between \"swipe\" and \"joystick\" controls with clear hover and active styles.\n  - Updated game description and UI elements for better mobile control integration.\n\n- **Code Improvements:**\n  - Refined keyboard input handling by simplifying conditional checks.\n  - Added reusable helper functions for vector conversion and touch event handling.\n  - Improved maintainability with modular joystick and swipe logic.\n\nThis update significantly enhances mobile gameplay and usability with flexible control options, while improving code quality and readability.","tree":{"sha":"849b0ae6d98d61b2027c5ebe9d20e364c5c54e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/849b0ae6d98d61b2027c5ebe9d20e364c5c54e15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/15636c0d8c5574a2a69efad0f15c42161a118b63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admi