ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-14T23:15:41Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(breakout): improve touch support, overlays, and accessibility**\n\n- **Touch Handling Improvements:**\n  - Added \"Tap-to-start/pause\" functionality with overlays for mobile-first UX, improving accessibility and usability on touch devices.\n  - Ensured touch-friendly pause/resume behavior with updated input handling logic.\n\n- **Overlays:**\n  - Introduced clear visual overlays for game states:\n    - \"Tap to start\" or \"Tap to resume\" for paused gameplay.\n    - \"Game Over\" overlay displaying score and a restart button.\n  - Added absolute positioning and responsive design to ensure overlays adapt to various screen sizes.\n\n- **Accessibility Enhancements:**\n  - Added `aria-label` descriptions for canvas elements and interactive buttons to improve screen reader usability.\n  - Updated help sections for more structured and mobile-first content:\n    - Added collapsible \"How to Play\" and \"Power-Ups\" sections on mobile devices.\n    - Retained expanded views for larger screens.\n\n- **UI Refinements:**\n  - Consolidated and styled gameplay instructions and power-up descriptions for both mobile and desktop views.\n  - Improved dark mode support for entire help sections and overlays, ensuring consistent visual quality.\n\nThese changes enhance mobile gameplay, accessibility, and the overall user experience.","tree":{"sha":"5e40e3b7495ebe1590e80d64455a40327226cb61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/5e40e3b7495ebe1590e80d64455a40327226cb61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/d1427b8ed91d10fe51a58bf6239e65dac217cef4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers