.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commits/8422006e39ebd41f969bc047b6efd1290e3e5228/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-14T22:32:26Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-14T22:32:56Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**feat(game): improve GraphQL setup and enhance touch handling in GameContainer**\n\n- **GraphQL Updates:**\n  - Changed default backend URL for GraphQL API to use port `8080` for local development to align with updated guidelines.\n\n- **GameContainer Enhancements:**\n  - Added `lockTouch` prop to prevent scrolling/zooming and enable touch-action safety within the game area. This improves mobile usability.\n  - Defaulted `lockTouch` to `true` to enhance user interaction in touch-based environments.\n  - Applied touch gesture prevention (`onTouchMove`, `onTouchStart`, `onTouchEnd`, `onWheel`) when `lockTouch` is enabled.\n  - Updated class handling to include `touch-none` and `select-none` styles for locked interactions.\n\nThese changes improve development setup for GraphQL and enhance mobile gameplay by preventing unintended gestures during interaction.","tree":{"sha":"adb4bfc84f473bf75cb2de43ca5a3ba611d9c4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/adb4bfc84f473bf75cb2de43ca5a3ba611d9c4ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/8422006e39ebd41f969bc047b6efd1290e3e5228","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.