2-14T20:09:44Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"test(breakout): add E2E tests for core gameplay mechanics\n\n- Add Playwright E2E tests for the Breakout game:\n  - Verify paddle movement with `ArrowRight` key interaction.\n  - Test start/pause functionality using the `Space` key, ensuring ball movement and stabilization.\n  - Check life mechanics by monitoring life decrements after losing a ball.\n- Implement utility functions (`getCanvas` and `getDataInt`) for reusable and readable element handling in tests.\n- Enhance game test coverage to ensure MVP functionality is accurately validated.","tree":{"sha":"3cf2728b94fcc2dfd97ebfbed1d8840fd61a8140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/trees/3cf2728b94fcc2dfd97ebfbed1d8840fd61a8140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/gamehub-app/git/commits/23faf771c397e079c57ca7bbcde7d6179e0fdac7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/gamehub-app/commit/23faf771c3