ncur"},"message":"feat: Configure Vercel deployment for monorepo - Separate Projects Strategy\n\n TASK 15 COMPLETED - Vercel Deployment Configuration\n\n##  Deployment Strategy: Separate Projects\nEach app will be deployed as an independent Vercel project for maximum flexibility and scalability.\n\n##  Configured Applications:\n### CrediSync (Active)\n-  vercel.json optimized for monorepo structure\n-  Build command: cd ../.. && pnpm build:credisync\n-  Output directory: dist\n-  Environment variables configured\n-  Build tested and working (627.62 kB bundle)\n-  URL: credisync.vercel.app\n\n### HealthSync (Future)\n-  vercel.json template prepared\n-  Configuration ready for when app is developed\n-  URL: healthsync.vercel.app\n\n### SurveySync (Future)\n-  vercel.json template prepared\n-  Configuration ready for when app is developed\n-  URL: surveysync.vercel.app\n\n##  Technical Improvements:\n- Smart deployment with ignoreCommand for conditional builds\n- Monorepo-aware build commands (cd ../.. && pnpm build:app)\n- Proper output directory mapping (apps/{app}/dist)\n- Security headers and PWA support maintained\n- Environment variables properly scoped per application\n\n##  Documentation:\n- Complete Vercel monorepo setup guide created\n- Deployment strategy documented\n- Troubleshooting guide included\n- Checklist for future deployments\n\n##  Ready for:\n- Vercel project creation and testing\n- CI/CD pipeline configuration\n- Production deployment validation\n\nNext: Test deployment and create CI/CD pipelines","tree":{"sha":"5300fa7b4b739a71541266c0580f5b38107b06ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fbetancur/sync/git/trees/5300fa7b4b739a71541266c0580f5b38107b06ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fbetancur/sync/git/commits/db15fd923bede71dd1082c64f8d0581ec4bd794e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247896808?v=4","e