mail":"64867944@qq.com","name":"Gavinoio"},"message":"docs: 优化进阶板块，新增面试题精选\n\n- 精简 design-patterns 7 个、scenarios 14 个、algorithm 4 个、cross-platform 4 个文档\n- 新增 design-patterns/interview.md（8题）：单例、观察者/发布订阅、工厂、策略、代理、装饰器、SOLID\n- 新增 scenarios/interview.md（10题）：监控系统、HTTP 封装、大文件上传、虚拟列表、搜索建议、请求重试、拖拽排序、国际化、错误边界、可视化\n- 新增 algorithm/interview.md（16题）：排序、数组去重/扁平化、两数之和、链表、二叉树、动态规划、LRU 缓存\n- 新增 cross-platform/interview.md（10题）：跨端方案对比、小程序双线程架构、生命周期、setData 优化、uni-app 条件编译、Taro 3.x 原理、分包加载\n- 更新 config.js 四个板块侧边栏，新增「面试题精选」分组入口\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c6ee3198c42b5e4f30b224ab4039190564e444f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/git/trees/6c6ee3198c42b5e4f30b224ab4039190564e444f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/git/commits/88d9a17523cf8c02396295bbcc78a3f1b6853669","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75530283?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gavinoio","id":75530283,"login":"Gavinoio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTMwMjgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gavinoio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/comm