.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32536c5f1e56dee5a04fe27cca9233a85c0d8e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/git/trees/32536c5f1e56dee5a04fe27cca9233a85c0d8e71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/git/commits/bb6c567cac6de88b0ce63d082090453a98c6d823","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/commit/bb6c567cac6de88b0ce63d082090453a98c6d823","node_id":"C_kwDOQmEJBdoAKGJiNmM1NjdjYWM2ZGU4OGIwY2U2M2QwODIwOTA0NTNhOThjNmQ4MjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/commit/33e573a993f01aa5468178223baf82365aa45ed6","sha":"33e573a993f01aa5468178223baf82365aa45ed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/commits/33e573a993f01aa5468178223baf82365aa45ed6"}],"sha":"bb6c567cac6de88b0ce63d082090453a98c6d823","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/commits/bb6c567cac6de88b0ce63d082090453a98c6d823"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gavinoio/frontend-interview/commits/33e573a993f01aa5468178223baf82365aa45ed6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T02:06:38Z","email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T02:06:38Z","email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"message":"docs: 大幅扩充 uni-app 开发文档\n\n新增内容:\n- 组件通信: 父子组件通信、EventBus、Vuex 状态管理\n- 插件开发: 自定义组件、自定义插件封装\n- 真机调试: 开发环境配置、调试工具封装\n- nvue 原生渲染: nvue 与 vue 区别、使用场景详解\n- 小程序特性: 自定义导航栏、分享功能、订阅消息、小程序码生成\n- 性能优化进阶: 图片懒加载、防抖节流、数据预加载、setData 优化\n- 常见面试题: 7个高频面试题及详细答案\n- 项目实战: 统一请求封装、全局错误处理\n\n优化内容:\n- 补充完整的代码示例和注释\n- 添加对比表格和最佳实践\n- 完善生命周期执行顺序说明\n- 增加多端差异处理方案\n- 提供实战开发技巧\n\n文档特点:\n- 从基础到进阶的完整知识体系\n- 包含大量可直接使用的代码示例\n- 覆盖 uni-app 面试高频考点\n- 适合快速学习和面试准备\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-cod